{"ID":"20240515193710-ev781k7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515193710-ev781k7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515193710-ev781k7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519102429-fshvcve\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519105856-y81vhoz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240519105856-y81vhoz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"27(2010.03.03-2010.04.14)","type":"doc","updated":"20240523090441"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240519102429-fshvcve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-fshvcve","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"衛署：長期荷爾蒙療法 肺癌風險增"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-bcy3uyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-bcy3uyk","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/02 16:57"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-wgsgh1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-wgsgh1f","updated":"20240519102443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者陳麗婷台北 2日電）衛生署今天表示，國際期刊發表研究報告，更年期婦女長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法，罹患肺癌風險比不使用者高，但因果關係仍需確認。衛署將發函相關醫學會、醫生，用藥時多評估。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(衛生署終於說出一次實話，但是卻沒有說清楚、講明白。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-ts00e96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-ts00e96","updated":"20240519102444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"過去美國研究認為，長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法（HRT），會增加乳癌罹患風險。衛生署食品藥物管理局藥品組科長呂理福受訪表示，根據近期臨床腫瘤醫學期刊發表1篇有關更年期婦女長期使用HRT的論文，追蹤10年發現，更年期婦女長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法，罹患肺癌風險比不使用者高。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(也就是說，使用赫爾蒙療法不但容易到乳癌，現在更證明也容易得到肺癌了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-aiaud4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-aiaud4x","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呂理福說，研究主要針對 3萬6000多名婦女研究，比較50到75歲更年期婦女，長期使用HRT（也就是含雌激素與合成的黃體激素成分的藥品），治療婦女停經後更年期症候群。結果發現，長期使用HRT的婦女，與未使用者比較，罹患肺癌風險比較高。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-lu58zqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-lu58zqi","updated":"20240519102448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呂理福說，根據全國藥物不良反應通報資料，沒有接獲疑似使用HRT引起肺癌的不良反應通報；不過，過去也有研究指出，使用HRT舒緩更年期症候群，也可能增加血管栓塞、乳癌風險，這些警語都已經刊載在藥品說明書中。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(也就是說這種荷爾蒙替代療法的藥物也會引發心臟病。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-dtm5p3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-dtm5p3u","updated":"20240519102450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他表示，將發函相關醫學會、婦產科醫師，提醒醫師為婦女處方荷爾蒙類藥品緩解更年期症候群時，審慎評估風險效益。尤其是罹患癌症的患者、家族中有人罹患癌症者，都要謹慎用藥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(實話就是根本就沒有必要使用荷爾蒙替代療法。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-dpblz02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-dpblz02","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-00oft8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-00oft8e","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     讀者可知我國千年以來一共有多少婦女出現嗎？在西醫學尚未進入我國之前，你可曾聽說過有一位婦女死於更年期的不適症狀，也就是說更年期所產生的一些不適症狀本來是不會產生致命性的病症，就算沒有藥也不會死，現在西藥廠將更年期之症狀嚴重化，它們假借理由說不控制就會出現骨質疏鬆症之類欺騙人的研究，於是到處鼓勵婦女們使用這種荷爾蒙替代療法，這種療法已經造成許多婦女們得到乳癌與肺癌，還有心臟病，讀者試想，一種原本不需要任何藥物也不是疾病的更年期症狀，卻因為被西藥廠宣染誇大危險性後，許多婦女聽從西藥廠的謊言，於是去吃這種荷爾蒙替代品，終於死於乳癌與肺癌，想想西藥廠真是壞透了，再想想這些婦女也真好騙啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-0v19u7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-0v19u7j","updated":"20240519102454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    婦女們請注意，如果妳有更年期的不適症狀，請找中醫來幫忙或是吃"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐64號"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我們正統中醫早在二千年前就已經幫天下婦女們解決這個擾人又不是病的問題了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102429-zxog0fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102429-zxog0fs","updated":"20240519102429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102430-24mjyyg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102430-24mjyyg"}},{"ID":"20240519102503-30mulua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-30mulua","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荷爾蒙療法增肺癌風險？部分醫師不認同"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-g54zv9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-g54zv9j","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/02 18:04"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-ncwgare","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-ncwgare","updated":"20240519102517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者陳麗婷台北2日電）美國研究指更年期婦女長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法，可能增肺癌風險。台灣部分醫師今天表示，這項研究設計不夠嚴謹，且研究對象開始用藥年紀較大，BMI值偏高，研究結果僅供參考。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(說這種話的西醫師，就是本身利益受到這種說法打擊的醫師，所以他們只顧他們自己的利益而說這種話，這已經證明這種醫師只管自己賺多少錢，從不管病人的感受如何？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-9h3grap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-9h3grap","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國研究發現，更年期婦女長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法，追蹤發現罹患肺癌風險較高。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-59rypm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-59rypm5","updated":"20240519102515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中華民國生育醫學會理事長楊再興受訪表示，美國這項研究當初是針對使用荷爾蒙療法會不會增加心血管疾病風險，若要看與肺癌的關聯，設計基礎大不相同。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人居然不知，世界上有很多的發現，都是意外發現的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-4wr6m2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-4wr6m2j","updated":"20240519102513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"楊再興說，國內治療更年期標準是只要一停經，醫師評估患者狀況後，認為有需要就會立即用藥，通常都是在患者50到55歲間就開始用藥。美國研究的用藥平均年齡是63.8歲，用藥時間較晚，很多婦女身體狀況已經較差，醫師必須使用較強的補藥，就可能產生副作用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人說話不老實，婦女更年期不是一種疾病，為何需要用藥呢？這才是實話。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-mhl6xvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-mhl6xvy","updated":"20240519102522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，美國研究對象是BMI(身體質量指數)值超過28 的肥胖者；楊再興說，肥胖本來就比較容易增加疾病風險，因此，他認為這項研究僅供參考。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-xgolof2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-xgolof2","updated":"20240519102525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣更年期醫學會監事周輝政受訪表示，這項研究未呈現荷爾蒙療法與癌症間的關聯性，但顯示荷爾蒙療法後，罹患大腸癌、子宮內膜癌會減少。另在臨床上，荷爾蒙療法能預防骨質疏鬆。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人又在胡說八道了，在美國已經出現年許多高八十歲的婦女們，她們從五十歲更年期開始就因為相信美國西醫的這種說法，他們告訴婦女說荷爾蒙療法能預防骨質疏鬆，而三十年後真實的後果，卻是得到全身性的骨質疏鬆症，這些婦女一直要求我必須公諸於世，讓全世界的婦女都知道西醫在說謊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-p2zqpwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-p2zqpwp","updated":"20240519102508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，周輝政說，使用荷爾蒙替代療法者，比未使用者的5年總體死亡率下降2%。因此，他認為荷爾蒙替代療法並不是那麼差。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(又在使用死亡率這個模糊字眼來欺騙大眾了，世界上跟本沒有一位婦女是死於更年期的不適症狀的，何來這種"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"比未使用者的5年總體死亡率下降2%"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"的說法呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-1e9i5rh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-1e9i5rh","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-gpgzd0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-gpgzd0o","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    讀者千萬不要被這幾位西醫師騙了，理由是第一 : 更年期是一位正常婦女身體退化的一個過程，它不是病，也從未造成任何婦女有致命性的後果，所以不要怕它。第二 : 使用這種荷爾蒙替代療法，其副作用就是得到乳癌與肺癌，這在美國已經是不爭的事實，而台灣這些西醫只因為這樣說法會影響到他們的既得利益，而強辭奪理的繼續替自己辯白，這些西醫師本身從沒有得過乳癌，不知道乳癌病患的痛苦，實在是一些不說實話的西醫師啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-j6pfd3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-j6pfd3f","updated":"20240519102529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"西醫說在臨床上，荷爾蒙療法能預防骨質疏鬆，這是欺騙人的說法，請大家千萬不要上當。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102503-hlppo9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102503-hlppo9f","updated":"20240519102503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102504-wiarbg8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102504-wiarbg8"}},{"ID":"20240519102533-929zwth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-929zwth","updated":"20240519102533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年後腹痛又貧血 意外驗出大腸直腸癌"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-hcbdngo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-hcbdngo","updated":"20240519102533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者張瑞楨／中縣報導  更新日期:2010/03/03 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-0qrmoil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-0qrmoil","updated":"20240519102545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年假飲食不正常，意外讓大腸直腸癌現形！2名婦人近半年有腹痛與貧血症狀，但卻不以為意，年假大吃大喝後，因腸堵塞就醫，意外被診斷出罹患大腸直腸癌。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此時就該立刻找中醫來治療，給西醫治是必死。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-rgrlweu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-rgrlweu","updated":"20240519102548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫師指出，大腸直腸癌很容易找到早期病灶，有症狀就要立即就醫，千萬不要拖延。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者有便秘時就該找中醫治療了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-864p96t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-864p96t","updated":"20240519102550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台中慈濟醫院大腸直腸外科醫師黃玄遠發現，患者分別為一名82歲的老阿嬤及另一名60多歲婦人，兩人貧血都已達半年，經常腹部同一位置疼痛，懷疑主因是惡性腫瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這兩位婦女沒有警覺性，都已經貧血了還不找中醫來治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-de4t3eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-de4t3eo","updated":"20240519102552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中，阿嬤是升結腸位置出現大腸腫瘤，引發腸阻塞與肚子發脹，婦人則是第四期大腸癌引發腸阻塞，2人都漠視貧血與腹痛警訊，卻因飲食不正常引發腸堵塞，才發現腫瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只要一有便秘就該找中醫治療，不可以拖延時間。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-z9hnh55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-z9hnh55","updated":"20240519102555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃玄遠表示，早期大腸直腸癌病灶不難發現，也能有效治療，如果同一位置反覆不明腹痛，又有長期貧血，一定要儘速檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(給西醫檢查還可以，但是要說治療的話，只有中醫才有治。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-w8xbir6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-w8xbir6","updated":"20240519102538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他強調，大腸直腸癌發生率逐年增高，主因與生活習慣、家族史及高熱量、高脂等飲食習慣有關。若排便習慣改變，合併有血便、排泄「裡急後重」（即感覺很急，卻又有排泄不乾淨之感），合併體重急劇下降等現象，都是危險訊號。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-1f67uik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-1f67uik","updated":"20240519102536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-av24h1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-av24h1v","updated":"20240519102533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    大腸癌給西醫治療，都沒有好的結果，百分之99都會移轉成肝癌而死，如果從一開始就是中醫來治療，癌症是不會移轉成肝癌的，因為中醫治金，必先實木。西醫不知，所以越治病人就越短命。如果你得到大腸癌後，先給西醫治療，出現惡化時再找中醫治療，這也太慢了，時常是連中藥都無法入口的含恨而去。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102533-csx0vd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102533-csx0vd8","updated":"20240519102533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102534-m12gg2m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102534-m12gg2m"}},{"ID":"20240519102605-hbzaxp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-hbzaxp0","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"太「癌」重！台灣每天25名女性罹婦癌"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-ie6lvb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-ie6lvb6","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者王昶閔／台北報導  更新日期:2010/03/04 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-br1powi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-br1powi","updated":"20240519102624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣平均每天有25名婦女罹患乳癌、子宮頸癌！但是乳癌好發高峰年齡層的篩檢涵蓋率卻只有2到3成，子宮頸抹片只有5成，使得婦癌發生率與死亡率居高不下，醫師表示，婦癌防治仍有改進空間。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫永遠都在認為是病人的錯，從沒想過是自己的醫學理論出現問題才造成這種結果。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-pi6w4o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-pi6w4o5","updated":"20240519102626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"婦癌篩檢率偏低"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫認為篩檢才是預防癌症的不二法門，真是宇宙無敵超級愚笨的想法了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-doi6six","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-doi6six","updated":"20240519102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"財團法人乳癌防治基金會、癌症希望協會和寶僑家品昨日舉辦「六分鐘護一生．三點不漏」婦癌防治記者會，呼籲全國婦女定期做婦癌篩檢，落實「三點不漏」的原則。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(天下婦女如果按照西醫說的三點都露的去做篩檢，結果必然造成更多的婦女冤死。中醫認為三點都不用露，就可以了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-3aovpec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-3aovpec","updated":"20240519102633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據國健局2007年統計，台灣當年乳癌新增個案為7502人、子宮頸癌新增個案1749人。國內乳癌發生率與死亡率高於日、韓；子宮頸癌的死亡率高於日、韓與新加坡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是因為台灣提倡西醫學，而西醫學至今都不知道乳癌與子宮頸癌的真正成因是什麼？當然會使罹癌的人數一直上升。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-5ce1c8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-5ce1c8s","updated":"20240519102636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百歲人瑞王奶奶在97歲高齡摸到胸部硬塊，是乳癌第二期，以手術切除左乳後，現正接受藥物治療中，家人也落實定期檢查；年僅26歲的楊小姐，懷孕6個月時乳頭有不明分泌物，卻等摸到硬塊時才就醫，先開刀切除病灶，等孩子出生後才開始化療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這二位婦女原本可以不死的，現在經過西醫開刀後，結果必死，這是西醫在殺人啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-37rbvou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-37rbvou","updated":"20240519102638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐小姐因工作忙碌，無暇做抹片檢查，去年異常出血，卻延誤半年後才就醫檢查，證實為子宮頸癌，卵巢、子宮、鼠蹊淋巴全數切除；37歲的黃小姐在懷第一胎時順便做抹片檢查，幸運發現子宮頸癌一期，切除子宮頸、保留子宮，生下第一胎後還生了第二胎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這樣切除後，病就會好嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-7qmmut5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-7qmmut5","updated":"20240519102640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"免費乳房篩檢率不到3成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(乳房篩檢率跟預防乳癌是毫無干係的，要知道真正乳癌的成因，才有資格可以談論如何預防乳癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-u5bwsuh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-u5bwsuh","updated":"20240519102643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"財團法人乳癌防治基金會董事長、台大外科教授張金堅表示，婦女接受免費乳房篩檢率過低，只有17%45到69歲婦女曾篩檢，乳癌好發高峰期的50到64歲婦女，也只有22%到31%曾做檢查。最新研究顯示，光靠乳房觸診不足以早期發現乳癌，50到64歲女性應每年進行乳房攝影檢測，高風險者更應提早到40歲。高危險群婦女在隆乳前要三思，無論是裝置鹽水袋或果凍矽膠，都會影響乳癌篩檢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是由不知道乳癌成因的醫師，才會說出這種話，乳癌篩檢跟預防乳癌根本是風馬牛不相干。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-l7l9r9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-l7l9r9q","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子宮頸抹片篩檢僅5成"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-3a1v6kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-3a1v6kv","updated":"20240519102645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癌症希望協會學術委員、長庚醫院婦產科主治醫師張廷彰表示，子宮頸抹片篩檢自民國89年起就停留在5成，篩檢率停滯不前是子宮頸癌防治最大困境，目前確診個案中，高達31%從未做過抹片。 婦女只要定期做抹片檢查，早期發現與治療，子宮頸癌早期治癒率可達100%。建議30歲以上婦女，每3年至少接受一次子宮頸抹片檢查。此外，接受免疫抑制療法的患者、HIV感染者、曾有高風險HPV感染者，則應每年做一次抹片檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(沒有用的，該得到癌症的還是會得到癌症。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-eec2lo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-eec2lo0","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-99ljnpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-99ljnpr","updated":"20240519102609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    只有真正知道乳癌成因的醫師，才有資格說可以預防乳癌，對不對？西醫學直到目前為止，尚不知道乳癌與子宮頸癌的真正成因是什麼？而西醫院的婦癌篩檢方法，是使用很霸道的儀器在做篩檢，而這類篩檢的動作，就很容易造成病人更加容易得到癌症，也就是說越篩檢就越壞，不但無法預防婦女得到癌症，反而讓接受篩檢的婦女更容易得到癌症，真是本末倒置的作法。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-2hogzc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-2hogzc9","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    台灣會出現如此多的婦女得到癌症，主要原因就是台灣政府提倡西醫學才造成的後果。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102605-40ngi0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102605-40ngi0x","updated":"20240519102605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102606-h002hzd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102606-h002hzd"}},{"ID":"20240519102652-k4h2isa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-k4h2isa","updated":"20240519102652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"台灣乳癌死亡率 亞洲第二"}]},{"ID":"20240519102652-pd3j0xf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-pd3j0xf","updated":"20240519102652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/03 22:16"}]},{"ID":"20240519102652-2pjjdnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-2pjjdnm","updated":"20240519102659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     提醒婦女朋友，台灣女性在亞洲先進國家中，乳癌發生率以及死亡率排名第二，僅次於新加坡，台灣每天就有25名女性朋友罹患婦科癌症。根據婦癌基金會的統計，台灣乳癌以及子宮頸癌一年新增個案就有9251人，平均每一天就有25位女性得婦癌，相當驚人。乳癌是國內女性癌症發生率第一位，最近13、14年來，乳癌發生率上升87%，死亡率上升10.3%，就是因為飲食西化，大量攝取脂肪，食物高油、高鹽，加上國人晚婚、不生小孩、甚至不願意哺乳，造成乳癌患者越來越多，有年輕化趨勢。提醒45到69歲婦女要定期做乳房篩檢，千萬不要因為害羞而延誤病情。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102652-6hg80nj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-6hg80nj","updated":"20240519102652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102652-8lm361e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-8lm361e","updated":"20240519102652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這些笨蛋以為利用這個真實的數據，就可以刺激台灣婦女多多去做定期做乳房篩檢，他們沒有想到這正好曝露西醫的禍害有多大？這個數字已經證明了台灣的醫療政策是錯誤的，如果不立刻修正，將來只會更壞而已。之所以僅次於新加坡，是因為新加坡的西醫比台灣的西醫學更發達，所以新加坡的乳癌人數才會成為亞洲第一，而亞洲其他的落後國家，因為政府沒有很富裕，所以沒有財力來推行採購西醫的醫療器材，於是很少做定期做乳房篩檢，所以罹患乳癌的人數，自然就很低。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102652-efevapj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102652-efevapj","updated":"20240519102652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102653-2e885iy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102653-2e885iy"}},{"ID":"20240519102706-gkl8yuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-gkl8yuk","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多發性骨髓瘤 近年成長最快血癌"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-fgxu6u1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-fgxu6u1","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者王昶閔／台北報導  更新日期:2010/03/04 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-yoiwkgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-yoiwkgs","updated":"20240519102712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多發性骨髓瘤是近年成長較快的一種血癌，病患不易自我警覺，確認診斷時多半已是第三期。醫師提醒民眾，若罹患不明原因的腰痠背痛、貧血、腎功能惡化，經治療半年，始終未見起色，必須要留意多發性骨髓瘤的可能性，主動與醫師討論。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(找西醫只有死路一條，因為西醫只會給病人換骨髓或是做化療，結果病人不是死於多發性骨髓瘤，而是死於化療與吃抗排斥藥物。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-lodwof2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-lodwof2","updated":"20240519102715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中華民國血液病學會昨日發佈第一份本土多發性骨髓瘤流行病學調查，該會自民國95年起，收集全台15家醫學中心與區域醫院多發性骨髓瘤病患的登錄資料進行研究，完整追蹤兩年結果後發現，老年人是多發性骨髓瘤的好發族群，有62.5%病患超過60歲，男性是女性的2倍，近7成病患診斷出來時已是第三期。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是因為台灣的老人被電視廣告影響，以為每天吃一些多種維他命，或是吃些維x力等營養食品會對身體很好，事實上卻正好相反，已經有許多老人因為這樣做而終於得到多發性骨髓瘤。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-bjov6t9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-bjov6t9","updated":"20240519102717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中華民國血液病學會理事長邱宗傑表示，民眾對多發性骨髓瘤非常陌生，因其主要症狀為貧血、骨頭疼痛、腎功能不佳，病患多半先到骨科、復健科、腎臟科、風濕免疫科就診一段時間後，才發現異常而被轉介至血液腫瘤科，因此常延誤治療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(就算早期被西醫發現，只要給西醫治療就是死路一條。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-boziomu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-boziomu","updated":"20240519102720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台大醫院血液科醫師黃聖懿表示，多發性骨髓瘤病患的骨頭痠痛與骨折，主要集中在上半身，以手臂、胸骨、肋骨疼痛最常見。最極端的個案是曾有一名50幾歲的女病患，在拿水杯喝水時，手骨竟瞬間斷成3截，才知是罹患多發性骨髓瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我保證此女必定每天都在吃各種綜合維他命或是鈣片等，她心想要補骨髓，結果因為太補而補到癌細胞。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-kd91qcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-kd91qcu","updated":"20240519102721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃聖懿表示，及早讓病患使用標靶藥物，可望提高療效與延長存活期，部分病患不但能完全緩解，甚至能說是治癒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人不老實，真的有被西醫治癒的嗎？直到目前為止，根本沒有一人被西醫治好過，全都死掉了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-fu66eas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-fu66eas","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"健保放寬標靶藥物給付"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-4r0jxk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-4r0jxk4","updated":"20240519102723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多發性骨髓瘤的治療藥物，已從傳統的化療藥物進步到標靶藥物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種標靶藥物，名字取得很好聽，實際上它非常的毒，病人如果持續的使用這種標靶藥物，遲早會死在這個藥上。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-n3kd3hg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-n3kd3hg","updated":"20240519102725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今年3月起，健保放寬標靶治療藥物bortezomib為二線用藥，病患平均需注射4到8個療程，約可省下64萬到128萬元。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西藥廠要將藥價調得很貴，這樣才會讓病人以為是很好的藥。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-9ozezxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-9ozezxb","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-buclx93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-buclx93","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   首先我要跟各位讀者說明，多發性骨髓瘤是吃過多的西洋人製造的營養劑造成的癌症，如果妳是一位從不吃任何維他命與鈣片，或是騙人的維x力等，我保證你絕對不會得到這種多發性骨髓瘤的，台灣很多婦女在更年期時，受到西醫師的欺騙，西醫師跟她們說，妳必須要接受長期使用荷爾蒙替代療法，因為這樣可以幫助妳預防妳得到骨質疏鬆症，這種欺騙婦女只為了能多賣些藥賺些錢，結果又要婦女們多吃些鈣片或是一些所謂補骨頭的營養劑，結果這些無知的婦女聽信了這些謊言後，每天不斷的吃這些害人生病的補骨質的藥，吃過多這些人工合成的營養劑後，結果正常骨質沒有吸收，反而被一些癌細胞吸收，這就是多發性骨髓瘤的起因。台灣男人會得到這多發性骨髓瘤，就是受到廣告的影響，說每天要吃一粒綜合維他命等不實廣告的宣傳，於是他們就每天吃，終於得到這多發性骨髓瘤，如果你兩樣都吃，我保證你一定會得到多發性骨髓瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-5kq8qeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-5kq8qeb","updated":"20240519102728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 小孩得到多發性骨髓瘤與得到血癌是相同的，都來自對小兒痲痺疫苗的不適應造成的憾事。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102706-lyt1u3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102706-lyt1u3d","updated":"20240519102706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102707-6esmcp4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102707-6esmcp4"}},{"ID":"20240519102809-d2k886v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-d2k886v","updated":"20240519102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺癌「悄悄」上身 定檢很重要"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-m7wm6tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-m7wm6tv","updated":"20240519102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/04 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-ymlv8uv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-ymlv8uv","updated":"20240519102823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者傅潮標／苗栗報導〕長庚醫院皮膚科名醫翁雯柔最近因肺腺癌病逝，藝人文英、舞蹈家羅曼菲也都死於肺腺癌，苗栗大千醫院胸腔科主任謝為忠提醒說，肺癌初期沒有明顯症狀，高達8成發現時已是末期，只有定期篩檢才能早期發現，提高存活率。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(給西醫治療，無論你是初期還是末期病患，都一樣必死。沒有所謂的提高存活率一說。這段裡提到的醫師與藝人等都死於肺癌，其實是不對的，是死於西醫的治療上。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-5icnzsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-5icnzsr","updated":"20240519102822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"謝為忠說，患者在肺癌第1期就被確診，5年存活率約有7成，如果腫瘤在1公分以下，5年存活率可達百分之百，10年存活率也達9成以上。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫最喜歡用存活率來騙人，這種模糊其辭的說法，最令我痛恨。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-l2aynbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-l2aynbh","updated":"20240519102819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第2期才被確診，5年存活率降到約4成5，到了第3期，因癌細胞已轉移到淋巴等組織，存活率更低；第4期的存活率低於1成。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(他到底在說些什麼？我沒有聽懂。我只知道結果肺癌病人都死掉了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-iq4ie35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-iq4ie35","updated":"20240519102818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菸槍、家族史…高危險群"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(許多不抽菸的婦女都得到肺癌，所以這種說法不正確。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-nnu6ci9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-nnu6ci9","updated":"20240519102816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"謝為忠說，X光、痰液細胞檢查是傳統肺癌篩檢的主要方法，但容易出現盲點，錯失治療先機；低劑量的胸部電腦斷層，有高達9成以上能篩檢出極早期病灶，儀器的精密度甚至可檢出0.05公分的癌細胞，讓肺癌無所遁形。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫沒有任何藥物可以治療肺癌，所以沒有所謂的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"錯失治療先機"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一詞，他在自誇。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-h3pgw7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-h3pgw7k","updated":"20240519102814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"謝為忠提醒民眾定期健檢，50歲以上，建議每年進行1次胸部X光檢查，如果是老菸槍、有肺癌家族史、咳嗽超過2周以上、咳嗽情況改變（如老菸槍習慣清晨咳，中午、晚上不太咳，突然變得一天到晚都在咳）等高危險族群，40歲以上就應定期健檢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(許多人不做檢查還沒事，一做完後就出事，所以我只建議我的敵人每年去做體檢，這樣我的敵人很快就會因為癌症而死翹翹了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-a5mo0f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-a5mo0f3","updated":"20240519102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-tkja55i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-tkja55i","updated":"20240519102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   肺癌無論你是得到第幾期，如果給西醫治療，絕對無一能倖免於死，但是給中醫治療就不同了，中醫治療時就算沒有將你治好，但是延長你的壽命是絕對可以做到的。至今西醫仍未了解肺癌的成因，他們不知道，許多人得到肺癌其實就是因為吃西藥才造成的，很多西藥都會傷害到心臟，也有很多西藥都含有賀爾蒙，這些就是造成肺癌的真正部分原因所在，所以不想得到肺癌的民眾，第一件事要做到的就是遠離西藥與各種維他命，當然空氣的品質也很重要，多運動，多練些氣功等都很有幫助，如果你每天半夜三點到五點鐘必醒過來，這時就要注意了，請就近找可以相信的中醫來治療，就可以幫助你，預防得到肺癌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-1w1l3e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-1w1l3e8","updated":"20240519102809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月05日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102809-na7sxi8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102809-na7sxi8"}},{"ID":"20240519102836-95grn24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-95grn24","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三高失控 易致腎病"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-fy8akd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-fy8akd6","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/05 00:17 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【記者陳元春／台北報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-lz60xf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-lz60xf8","updated":"20240519102859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地下電台賣藥實力驚人，據衛生署調查，國內十八歲以上成人吃過電台藥的比率，達六·五％，換算約有一百十五萬國人，都曾吃過電台賣的藥，且不只有六十五歲以上老人愛亂吃電台藥，糖尿病、高血壓患者吃過電台藥的比例，還是沒有患高血壓、血糖患者的兩倍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣最惡質的就是這些地下電台在賣的假藥。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-q3q3zx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-q3q3zx4","updated":"20240519102855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣腎臟醫學會理事長林裕�指出，國內目前約有五千八百名洗腎病患，分析造成國人洗腎的原因主為糖尿病，約占四成，慢性腎絲球炎次之占兩成五，高血壓與間質性腎炎各占一成。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(造成洗腎的真正原因是因為病人長期服用降血壓藥、降血糖藥等造成的，不是因為高血壓或是糖尿病造成的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-h12m7le","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-h12m7le","updated":"20240519102852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據衛生署國健局調查，國內十八歲以上國人吃過電台藥物的比率達六·五％，換算下來，約有一百十五萬名民眾都曾吃過電台藥，進一步分析，六十五歲以上老人買或吃過電台藥的比率，占超過一成。且患有糖尿病、高血壓的患者吃過電台藥物的比率分別高達十一·九％與九·三％。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣人真是老實，如此好騙。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-jnjt6u9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-jnjt6u9","updated":"20240519102850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"國健局長邱淑媞指出，老人家聽收音機解除苦悶，但聽完電台，又總會情不自禁亂買電台藥，且據統計，分別有四成的高血壓患者和兩成四的糖尿病患者，不知道血壓、糖尿病控制不好，會致腎臟病，再度呼籲民眾把握護腎三三原則，預防腎臟病。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡說錯了，不是血壓、糖尿病控制不好，會致腎臟病，而是長期吃降血壓、降血醣藥物會造成洗腎才對。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-titcoc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-titcoc7","updated":"20240519102848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"為了呼籲民眾藥別亂吃，衛生署昨請來國家級總教練徐生明與孫翠鳳出席。徐生明說，過去不知道自己有高血壓，且因痛風，長期吃止痛藥，搞到需要換腎，現在已換腎五年半，目前天天要吃藥，且開玩笑說，現在大家跟他談腎比棒球還多。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是他自己糊塗，亂吃西醫開給他的止痛藥才造成洗腎的，如果吃中藥來治療痛風，怎會出現腎臟衰竭呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-ugfqa78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-ugfqa78","updated":"20240519102844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孫翠鳳則說，護腎三三原則就是預防高血壓、高血糖及高血脂等三高，並遵照醫師指示驗血、驗尿和量血壓。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請問孫小姐，大家都知道能做到預防工作，絕對是好事，但是妳如果認為只要遵照醫師指示驗血、驗尿和量血壓，就是預防，那妳就被西醫欺騙了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-71f395s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-71f395s","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-8lhxqcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-8lhxqcu","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"--三高失控 易致腎病--"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這句話本身就是矛盾的，先說高血壓吧，將近百分之99的高血壓病人，之所以血壓比別人高，就是因為腎臟影問題造成的，當一位醫師，就是應該將該人的腎臟醫好，血壓自然就會回到正常，而不是一眛的給病人吃降血壓藥，高血壓是一個症狀不是病，不可以將高血壓當成病在治療在控制，幾乎所有的降壓藥都是一種利尿劑，這種藥等於是取代了腎臟功能，也就是說吃得越多，腎臟就越退化，而原本病人血壓比別任高時，就已經是腎臟出現問題才會這樣，現在加上吃降血壓藥，藥物讓腎臟功能更加退化，終於導致腎臟衰竭，這就是真正腎臟會衰竭的原因所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-d7h75ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-d7h75ho","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   降血糖藥更差，民眾被西醫嚇到，以為必須控制血糖在正常數值之內就對了，其實這是完全錯誤的想法，血糖再高也只是表示你吃的食物或是你的運動量不夠，並不是真正你身體出現問題，每天吃的食物種類很多，有人喜歡運動也有人不喜歡運動，請問你如何去控制呢？而西醫最可怕的是只檢驗血液中的糖分，卻沒有去檢查血液中的水分，當水分減少時，糖分自然就會增加，所以中醫學是使用中藥將血液中失去的水分補足，於是血糖自然就恢復正常了，而西醫學是去研發一種藥，將血液中的多餘糖分分解掉，讓血糖下降，這是不對的出發點，這種作法病人就需要吃一輩子的西藥，而西藥本身就是毒藥，吃得越多，毒素就累積在腎臟越多，終於導致腎臟衰竭，這就是許多糖尿病患常年服用西藥控制血糖後，最後就是去洗腎的原因了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-g8yo4es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-g8yo4es","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    西醫對有高血脂的病人，只知道開降血脂藥給病人長期吃，而不教導病人從如何攝取食物來降低血脂開始著手，病人的飲食不改善，光靠降血脂藥是不行的，於是病人繼續吃著讓血脂升高的食物，然後西醫就繼續開給病人吃降血脂的藥物，長期下來腎臟當然承受不起這些毒藥，於是腎臟就衰竭了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-ycblwum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-ycblwum","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    上篇中的孫小姐十分天真，以為經常給西醫驗血、驗尿和量血壓，就可以預防腎臟衰竭，這是不可能的。另外一位徐生明就是因為相信西醫藥而長期吃止痛藥，終於造成洗腎的厄夢，這是因為他不知道中醫可以將痛風徹底治好，只知吃止痛藥來鎮痛，所以他會洗腎就是因為他自己的迷信西醫造成的憾事。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-1xwcjv2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-1xwcjv2","updated":"20240519102836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102836-z9pdand","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102836-z9pdand"}},{"ID":"20240519102910-e6cb1fs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-e6cb1fs","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"高血壓失控 易得腎臟病"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-8zhk6kw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-8zhk6kw","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/04 14:12"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-bge5opd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-bge5opd","updated":"20240519102917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者陳清芳台北4日電）衛生署國民健康局調查指出，近4成國人不知道高血壓若沒好好控制，容易得腎臟病；約1成高血壓病人吃過電台販售來路不明的藥物，將自身置於腎衰竭及洗腎危險中。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣地下電台賣的藥跟西醫院中西醫開給高血壓病人吃的降血壓藥，就是造成洗腎的真正原因所在，跟高血壓本身是無關的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-kmxshve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-kmxshve","updated":"20240519102918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"國健局長邱淑媞今天表示，去年對18歲以上4104人的「健康行為危險因子監測系統」電話訪問調查顯示，近9成糖尿病患知道血糖控制與腎臟病的關係，但高血壓患者對「高血壓和腎臟病之關係」的認知率，僅有57.3%。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡提及的近9成糖尿病患知道血糖控制與腎臟病的關係，還是不正確的知識，還是需要由我來說明，比較清楚些。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-8wuzvjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-8wuzvjm","updated":"20240519102922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣腎臟醫學會理事長林裕峰指出，據2007年統計，台灣腎臟病發生率是每100萬人有415人，是世界第1，現有5萬8000人洗腎或做腹膜透析，每年人數增加幅度約6%，雖有趨緩，但高血壓、糖尿病和腎絲球腎炎，一直是末期腎病的主要原因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不正確，會造成洗腎的原因是因為吃西藥太多。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-2jbxrou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-2jbxrou","updated":"20240519102926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林裕峰說，腎絲球可透析尿液，某些病毒感染或類澱粉症等病症會造成腎絲球腎炎；另外，高血壓會造成腎絲球的壓力，糖尿病會產生的糖化蛋白以及高血脂的脂化蛋白，都會造成腎絲球發炎，所以血壓、血糖、血脂等三高失控，就是會害腎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不正確，正確說法應該是腎臟先出問題後，血壓因此而上升，於是吃降血壓藥後，腎臟功能就變得更差，才會出現這種腎絲球發炎的現象。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-60gi05g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-60gi05g","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱淑媞和林裕峰呼籲民眾別吃不明藥物，邱淑媞說，97年健康行為危險因子監測系統電訪結果顯示，6.5%的18歲以上國人吃過電台藥，糖尿病、高血壓患者吃過的比例則分別達11.9%與9.3%，幾乎是非糖尿病患5.9%、非高血壓患者5.8%的2倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-fojbii2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-fojbii2","updated":"20240519102929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在3月11日世界腎臟日前夕，國健局提出護腎三三口號，呼籲一般民眾應預防三高上身，三高族群應作好疾病控制，預防腎臟病的發生，接受定期的驗血、驗尿、量血壓檢查，幫助自己瞭解腎臟的功能。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是消極的醫療方式，積極的應該找中醫將腎臟功能恢復到正常才對。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-is82mc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-is82mc7","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學知識"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-dq0p4qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-dq0p4qh","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    本來高血壓就是因為腎臟出現問題後才有的一種症狀，所以應該將腎臟功能恢復到正常後，血壓自然就會恢復過來，現在的西醫作法正好相反，他們認為高血壓是一種病，他們不知道是腎臟發生問題造成的，所以只知一眛的開降血壓藥給病人吃，而降血壓藥物會造成腎臟的負擔，吃得越多腎臟就越衰弱，如此惡性循環下去，終有一天病人會面臨洗腎的憾事，這是因為西醫不明白高血壓是一種症狀，不是疾病，而將高血壓當成疾病在控制，這就是台灣現在洗腎排名世界第一的緣由了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102910-skbu1v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102910-skbu1v3","updated":"20240519102910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102911-stode25","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102911-stode25"}},{"ID":"20240519102940-mg848sl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-mg848sl","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"維他命開封 一周後無效"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-hk9zzxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-hk9zzxf","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/06 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【台北訊】"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-jtkmlj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-jtkmlj3","updated":"20240519102948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"專家說，受到環境濕氣影響，放在廚櫃的維他命補充品，可能在一個星期內就失效。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(吃這些無效的維它命比吃有效的還好些。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-2ptmux1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-2ptmux1","updated":"20240519102950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國「每日郵報」網路版（Mail Online）報導，即使放進有蓋瓶罐裡，還是無法阻止這些維他命變質。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(跟本就是不必要的營養劑。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-kvzspq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-kvzspq3","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食品科學家發現，包括維他命C、部分的維他命B與其他膳食補充劑在內的結晶物質，容易歷經一種無法復原的過程，即潮解。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-u6ecyh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-u6ecyh8","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這意味著，在廚房與浴室這種溼度高的地方，重要營養物質可輕易溶解，散逸至空氣中。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-96wkalg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-96wkalg","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國印第安納州（Indiana）普度大學（Purdue University）助理教授莫爾（LisaMauer）建議將粉末狀補充品存放極度乾燥地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-sk9zwbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-sk9zwbw","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她說：「你可能看過鹽巴或糖開始結塊，這就是潮解的跡象。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-7w5i6cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-7w5i6cu","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莫爾表示，潮解會造成產品中的化學不穩性。她又說：「如果成分分解了，產品品質與保存期限會降低，營養程度也會跟著下降。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-b8ay4qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-b8ay4qw","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有蓋瓶罐也不一定能阻止產品變質。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-s6fq5u0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-s6fq5u0","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莫爾說：「打開和關閉包裝盒會改變內部空氣。如果你在浴室開閉包裝盒，每次就會跑進一點濕氣與水氣。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-5jtmrin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-5jtmrin","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"存放環境與產品配方皆會影響潮解程度。在短時間內，一個星期，某些產品的維他命C就會完全失效。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-dz32yzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-dz32yzx","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莫爾將這項研究成果發表於「農業與食品化學期刊」（Journal of Agricultural and Food Chemistry）。她表示，如果容器中有水分，或是膠囊出現褐色斑點，那就表示補充品變質了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-79bidp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-79bidp6","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她指出：「這樣的補充品不一定不安全，但如果產品沒有你想攝取的維他命，又何必吃呢？」"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-mh3wo64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-mh3wo64","updated":"20240519102944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-g06npm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-g06npm6","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我寧可大家去吃這些已經無效的營養劑，因為有效的營養劑只會去餵時癌細胞，不會被正常身體的組織所接受，因為它不是天然的，都是人工合成的假營養劑，這些營養劑不但不能幫助人體的健康，反而會造成身體的多餘負擔，再加上它們的分子很小，只會去餵食癌腫瘤，不會被身體所接受，這是世界上最壞的假營養劑，請大家不要吃它。"}]},{"ID":"20240519102940-lix8g84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519102940-lix8g84","updated":"20240519102940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519102941-ruf3ee5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519102941-ruf3ee5"}},{"ID":"20240519103013-pcbbw9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-pcbbw9k","updated":"20240519103013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"美研發腦癌疫苗　病患存活率多19個月"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-au1ppca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-au1ppca","updated":"20240519103013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/05 02:48 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"生活中心／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-4nrqiuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-4nrqiuq","updated":"20240519103026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目前治療腦癌病患的方式，大部分是採用化療和腫瘤切除，不過，美國現在已經研發出腦癌疫苗，以每個月打一針的方式，讓病患的存活率增加一倍，雖然目前還在實驗階段，但已經受到醫學界重視。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(任何疾病都必須知道成因是什麼？否則再怎麼研究，效果都是有限的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-6y4ec6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-6y4ec6k","updated":"20240519103021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"惡性腦瘤，病名簡稱GBM，是一種擴散速度非常快的腫瘤，即使接受化療，病患平均存活率仍不到一年。不過，天無絕人之路，腫瘤研究中心為他們帶來希望，就是目前還在實驗階段的疫苗。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(應該找中醫來幫忙治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-uxvtd50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-uxvtd50","updated":"20240519103027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據了解，該疫苗利用人體本身的免疫系統來攻擊腫瘤細胞，但「無法」在所有GBM病患上，因為只有四成的患者在接受注射後，會自行製造特殊蛋白質，產生抵抗腫瘤的細胞。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(病人吃中藥以後也會讓體內的免疫系統增強，來對付癌腫瘤。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-w2x72nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-w2x72nx","updated":"20240519103029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不過，研究顯示，接踵這種疫苗的患者，平均存活率比接受一般療法患者的14個月，足足多了19個月，如果患者動過切除手術再使用疫苗，更能延緩復發期，目前美國多家醫院已經投入研究，預計今年就會發表成果。（新聞來源：東森新聞記者祁傳璽、許乃文）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果有中醫介入治療，病人肯定可以活得更久，有時甚至於有痊癒的機會。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-20hx7l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-20hx7l1","updated":"20240519103016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-d0ig6ze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-d0ig6ze","updated":"20240519103013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    現代有許多癌症的成因，都是來自病人過度的服用營養劑，這些不必要的營養劑，只會去餵食各種癌細胞，讓人更脆弱，讓疾病更強，天下最惡質的西藥廠只為了賺錢，而去大力的誇大宣傳各種維他命的效果，讓人感覺好像不吃這些爛維他命就要死亡一般，這種不實廣告，每天都出現在電視上，從不見任何衛生單位去查處，這些只會讓人生病的各種維他命如果在市場上無法買到，我保證所有癌症的病人數字，立刻就會減少，上篇裡提到的惡性腦瘤病人，我相信只要這些病人先立刻停止繼續吃各種維他命後，腦瘤成長的速度必將立刻減緩下來。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103013-hp0ct5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103013-hp0ct5p","updated":"20240519103013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103014-7pcsa7p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103014-7pcsa7p"}},{"ID":"20240519103035-upzcgbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-upzcgbn","updated":"20240519103035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"台灣洗腎全球第1 腎臟保健別輕忽"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-ckrok6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-ckrok6o","updated":"20240519103035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/06 16:33"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-p6tn573","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-p6tn573","updated":"20240519103044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者趙宏進台中縣6 日電）童綜合醫院今天表示，據財團法人器官移植登錄中心資料顯示，國人現有5173人等待腎臟移植，是所有等待器官移植的第1 名，台灣洗腎人口密度也是全球第1，呼籲民眾顧好腎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(光是呼籲，根本沒用，必須要將西藥廠趕出台灣才有機會洗刷這個污名。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-zmcamlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-zmcamlk","updated":"20240519103046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「愛惜腎是大代誌」，為讓民眾從生活中建立腎臟保健習慣，童醫院舉辦「愛腎護腎--腎利人生園遊會」活動，讓民眾免費做篩檢，並從活動中了解腎臟功能及腎臟飲食的保健方法。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(唯一保健腎臟的方法就是斷絕西藥與各種維他命，生病都吃中藥。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-vzhqomh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-vzhqomh","updated":"20240519103048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   腎臟內科主治醫師吳再坤表示，腎臟是由許多腎絲球與腎小管組成，有大量的微血管，若血壓、血糖或血脂控制不好，會造成血管壁傷害及病變。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(用來控制血壓、血糖的西藥就是讓腎臟會衰竭的毒西藥。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-2tcm9yl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-2tcm9yl","updated":"20240519103052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  吳再坤說，民眾應建立腎病防治的正確觀念，本身若屬高危險群更要注意，因腎臟疾病無明顯徵兆，發現時已晚。他提醒民眾依照專業醫師指示用藥，避免因服用不明藥物導致腎功能喪失，結果需要洗腎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果這樣做有用的話，這種作法已經數十年了，結果台灣還是世界第一的洗腎之島，所以沒用的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-n1s5s1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-n1s5s1x","updated":"20240519103055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  吳再坤指出，台灣洗腎人口密度是全球第 1，民眾更應加強腎臟預防保健的觀念；童醫院結合鄰近診所成立「慢性腎臟疾病共同照護網」，以實際行動教育民眾如何落實腎臟保健。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(錯了，應該結合中醫診所，成立所謂由正統中醫為主治醫師的醫療團隊才有用。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-nbxxatd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-nbxxatd","updated":"20240519103058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  活動現場還安排護理師及營養師教導民眾愛腎小撇步與保腎飲食，飲食指標為維持標準體重，三餐以五穀為主食、選用高纖維食物、少油、少鹽、少糖、多喝白開水、飲酒要節制等。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(民眾就算每天堅持按照這個方法來選擇食物，我保證沒有用，還是照樣洗腎，因為你還在繼續吃西藥啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-ertsljy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-ertsljy","updated":"20240519103035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-m7czs8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-m7czs8z","updated":"20240519103035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    台灣多年來就已經是世界排名第一的洗腎之島，並不是今年才有，而真正讓台灣民眾去洗腎的最大原因，就是台灣政府只提倡西醫藥，它們很想從根本上將中醫消滅掉，只是表面上不敢明說而已。台灣的西醫師很擔心民眾都知道真正讓他們去洗腎的原因是每天都在吃的西藥與維他命造成的，所以他們就製造出所謂的 [ 三餐以五穀為主食、選用高纖維食物、少油、少鹽、少糖、多喝白開水、飲酒要節制等 ] 這種說法的目的，就是想轉移民眾的注意力，讓大家從不去想是來自濫用西藥造成的後果。台灣的政府只要不改變醫療政策的方向，我保證台灣年年都將是世界排名第一的洗腎之島，當然還有肝癌之島的惡名。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103035-vw1fwtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103035-vw1fwtd","updated":"20240519103035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103036-3tj36sb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103036-3tj36sb"}},{"ID":"20240519103225-irkcyb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-irkcyb0","updated":"20240519103225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳房攝影定檢 減少乳癌陰影"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-zlez0bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-zlez0bd","updated":"20240519103225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者魏怡嘉／台北報導   更新日期:2010/03/07 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-xibkrca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-xibkrca","updated":"20240519103231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣每年約有7500人罹患乳癌，及1600人死於此病，但婦女接受乳房攝影檢查的百分比卻相當低，衛生署國健局統計，45至69歲婦女，近兩年內曾接受乳房攝影篩檢比率僅11％，累積曾篩檢比率也僅有17％。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣每年有1600人死於乳癌，這就表示西醫是無法治療乳癌的醫學，乳房攝影跟預防乳癌是無關的，反而乳房攝影做的越多就越容易得到乳癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-0ji62p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-0ji62p3","updated":"20240519103233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"國健局長邱淑媞表示，其實如能早期發現乳癌，存活率很高，第一期的乳癌存活率可達90％以上，零期乳癌的存活率甚至接近100％。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(怎麼不說有三分之ㄧ的乳癌是不需要治療的，因為無害啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-h2df9j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-h2df9j2","updated":"20240519103235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳房攝影檢查有助於發現早期乳癌，但為了減少乳房組織相互重疊，要讓影像更清晰，並降低輻射劑量及幫助乳房固定，以減少婦女因身體晃動而影響攝影結果，需緊壓乳房，因此，常有受檢婦女會害怕檢查時的不適。國健局提醒，因月經來潮前一週，乳房易脹痛，這時較不建議受檢。不過，近來新型乳房攝影儀器改良，已較能減少受檢時的不適感。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(就是這種近乎暴力式的檢查方式，會破壞乳房的結構造成傷害，而這些傷害恢復後就會形成許多疤痕組織，這些空間就是最容易囤積奶水的處所，而這些陳舊腐敗的奶水無法排出體外，就會造成乳癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-r42z4s5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-r42z4s5","updated":"20240519103238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據國健局統計，民國96年45歲以上罹患乳癌人數，佔當年女性乳癌患者的74.6％，且97年該年齡層因乳癌死亡人數，佔當年乳癌死亡人數亦高達86％。為此，國健局自98年11月17日擴大免費乳房攝影檢查對象為45至69歲女性，同時自今年起，將具二親等以內血親罹患乳癌的婦女也納入篩檢對象，建議45歲以上婦女應好好把握，及善用政府的福利措施，接受乳房攝影篩檢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種作法必將造成每年乳癌死亡上升，根本就無法幫助婦女免除來自乳癌的威脅。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-cy8gtop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-cy8gtop","updated":"20240519103228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-xkflvxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-xkflvxt","updated":"20240519103225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    真正要能做到預防乳癌，就必須知道乳癌的成因，一但知道乳癌的成因，然後告訴天下所有婦女，自然就能夠幫助婦女們做到預防乳癌，一個完全不知道乳癌是怎麼得到的醫學，只知要求婦女每年去做檢查，大家想想檢查工作跟得到乳癌有關係嗎？這就好像學校老師每天去檢查學生的書包，以為這樣做就可以預防學生不去吸毒嗎？這跟本就是笑話一則，所有的預防工作必須從教育上著手，我們應該教導婦女們，造成乳癌的真正成因是什麼？而不是只知鼓勵婦女們每年去做乳房檢查而已，這是不正確的政策。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-domefag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-domefag","updated":"20240519103225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者想知道乳癌的成因，請參考我寫的有關乳癌的論文吧，不要再聽信西醫的話了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103225-1cjjyod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103225-1cjjyod","updated":"20240519103225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月08日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103226-gqqbch3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103226-gqqbch3"}},{"ID":"20240519103335-7kgqho6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-7kgqho6","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究發現 維他命D是活化免疫系統的關鍵"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-bo24jrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-bo24jrh","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/08 09:07"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-t1842r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-t1842r5","updated":"20240519103347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（路透倫敦7日電）科學家今天表示，維他命D是活化人體防疫機制的重要角色。全球約有半數人口苦於維他命D不足，代表他們免疫系統內的殺手─T細胞（Tcells）在對抗感染時沒有足夠戰鬥力。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西方有許多研究，其背後都隱藏著某種目的存在，讀者必須十分小心的閱讀，千萬不可以上當。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-8h5qpde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-8h5qpde","updated":"20240519103349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹麥研究學者表示，這項發項能協助抵禦傳染疾病和全球流行病，在研究新疫苗時可能派上用場。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(流感等病是可以被完全治好的，為何需要疫苗呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-rokkoub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-rokkoub","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學者發現，免疫系統內的殺手細胞（又稱T細胞）仰賴維他命D活化，若是血液中缺乏維他命D，T細胞將維持在休眠狀態，無法察覺到感染或是病原體帶來的威脅。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-h5ikgj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-h5ikgj7","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哥本哈根大學（Copenhagen University ）國際衛生免疫學與微生物學學系的蓋斯勒（Carsten Geisler）率領這項研究，他說：「當T細胞暴露在外來病原體中的時候，它會擴大信號裝置或『天線』，又叫做維他命D接受器，來尋找維他命D的存在。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-xihtxkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-xihtxkc","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「這代表T細胞必須要有維他命D，或是活化細胞的成分。若是T細胞在血液中沒有找到足夠的維他命D，它們甚至不會開始動員。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-r7fh9y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-r7fh9y3","updated":"20240519103353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科學家早已得知維他命D對鈣吸收相當重要，也知道維他命的多寡，與癌症和多發性硬化症等疾病息息相關。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡說的是天然維他命，不是人工合成的維他命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-65extw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-65extw7","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓋斯勒在發表於「自然免疫」（NatureImmunology）期刊的研究報告中寫道：「我們不了解的是，維他命D在活化免疫系統時究竟扮演多重要的角色，現在我們知道了。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-6kfzp1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-6kfzp1r","updated":"20240519103358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人體內大多數的維他命D是在皮膚接受陽光照射時自然產生，魚肝油、蛋，鮭魚、鯡魚和鯖魚等多油脂魚類中也含有維他命D，或可藉由服用營養劑補充。中央社（翻譯）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(前面的話都對，就是最後一句有問題，絕對不要上當去購買人工合成的所謂營養劑來補充。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-sjotglr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-sjotglr","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"惡質的西藥廠"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-wgag7cb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-wgag7cb","updated":"20240519103409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   整篇研究報告的最終目的，就是要暗示大家去購買人工合成的營養劑來補充，讀者千萬要小心閱讀這類的研究報告，因為你非常容易上當，西藥廠最喜歡使用營養攝取不足這類字眼來欺騙讀者，讓大家上當而去購買浪費金錢又害人的各種維他命，像這種"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"維他命D是在皮膚接受陽光照射時自然產生，魚肝油、蛋，鮭魚、鯡魚和鯖魚等多油脂魚類中也含有維他命D"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，這樣就足夠了，人工合成的維他命D與人體自己製造的維他命D，絕對不相同，人體製造的維他命D是無可取代的一種營養劑，西藥廠在混淆視聽，想在混水中摸魚。真是壞透了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103335-mhti7n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103335-mhti7n7","updated":"20240519103335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月08日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103336-9nhnsrt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103336-9nhnsrt"}},{"ID":"20240519103418-mjkbpm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-mjkbpm4","updated":"20240519103418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吸收鈣質飲食均衡"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-ujevtwj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-ujevtwj","updated":"20240519103418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/08 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【記者鍾佩芳／台北報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-ul3kn1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-ul3kn1t","updated":"20240519103418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨折患者得少吃糙米、雜糧﹝植酸較多﹞，以免影響鈣質吸收？桃園縣營養師公會副祕書長吳秋玲表示，鈣質平衡與飲食及腎臟內分泌有關，建議飲食仍需均衡，並非一昧補充鈣質。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-utta03j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-utta03j","updated":"20240519103436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從西醫角度來看，骨折患者得少吃糙米、雜糧﹝植酸較多﹞，會影響鈣質吸收；吳秋玲營養師表示，從營養學角度來說，應均衡飲食，可補充鈣質含量高的食物，如小魚乾、牛奶、糙米、豆類等。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位營養師書讀得不夠多，她不知道光是黑芝麻含的鈣就比牛奶多200倍以上，結果她不鼓勵大家去吃黑芝麻，反而去鼓勵大家喝害人生病的牛奶。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-j4to30c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-j4to30c","updated":"20240519103432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨折患者，而從營養學角度來說，則是認為鈣質是與飲食及腎臟內分泌有關。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(中醫早就知道腎主骨。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-amswv0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-amswv0m","updated":"20240519103438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨折患者可補充鈣片或是維骨力嗎？吳秋玲營養師表示，骨鬆患者才需補充鈣片，以維持骨骼密度；而維骨力為膝蓋的軟骨素，是讓關節中的軟骨柔軟有彈性，對膝蓋關節痛的老人家或許有幫助，但對於骨折患者而言是沒用的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我從未見過一位骨鬆患者，因為補充鈣片而恢復正常，反而看到許多病人因為服用過多的鈣片而得到腎結石，我也看到過常期吃維骨力與鈣片的人，結果卻得到多發性骨髓瘤。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-ifxb7xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-ifxb7xs","updated":"20240519103441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-l0m1h1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-l0m1h1h","updated":"20240519103423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"民眾如果有骨頭的問題，請務必找中醫來治療，千萬不可以聽這些西醫與營養師的話，去吃鈣片來補充，人工合成的鈣片不但不能補充骨質，反而會將好的鈣質從骨頭中排出來，讓病人的骨質更鬆，同時因為人體根本就無法吸收這些人工合成的鈣片，於是這些鈣片自然就會累積在腎臟中，成為腎結石，這些都已經是公認的存在事實，請大家不要上當，你只有從天然含鈣的食物中去攝取天然鈣，我們人體才能真正的受用。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-neh67ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-neh67ye","updated":"20240519103440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    請點擊這裡，就可以得到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哪些是天然含鈣的食物"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，台灣人最壞的習慣就是喜歡亂吃西藥廠生產的營養劑來補身體，結果卻補到癌症。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103418-xl7bgty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103418-xl7bgty","updated":"20240519103418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月08日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103419-xazlj5b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103419-xazlj5b"}},{"ID":"20240519103502-pduh30d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-pduh30d","updated":"20240519103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小病久未癒 血癌上身"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-o5dllsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-o5dllsz","updated":"20240519103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/09 17:48"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-92p4y1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-92p4y1y","updated":"20240519103511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者王鴻國台北縣9日電）35歲的林姓女子愛好運動，但她近日卻出現牙齦異常腫痛症狀，原以為是牙周病，到牙科看診後，意外發現罹患急性白血病，醫師籲民眾有病痛勿輕忽，有可能是某些疾病前兆。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種病請立刻找正統中醫來治療，並不是很難治的病。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-u2mhvnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-u2mhvnc","updated":"20240519103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"署立雙和醫院今天公布醫例，林姓女子愛好運動，但最近才剛暖身就覺得喘，且感冒後不易痊癒，喉嚨痛、牙齦腫痛。閉嘴嘴時，腫脹的下牙齦還可碰到上層牙齒。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-ycxxo2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-ycxxo2k","updated":"20240519103514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者原以為罹患牙周病，雖曾到牙科就診，但狀況卻遲遲未改善且有黃疸現象，經抽血檢驗才發現她的白血球數值已飆高到11萬，較一般人低於1萬的數值高出11 倍，最後才確診為俗稱「血癌」的急性白血病。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫只知有病，不知病從何來。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-6zjjnzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-6zjjnzc","updated":"20240519103516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙和醫院血液腫瘤科主治醫師蘇勇誠指出，急性白血病可分為骨髓性和淋巴性兩種：成人以急性骨髓性白血病為主，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/blood13.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"兒童","TextMarkTextContent":"兒童"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"則大多屬於急性淋巴性白血病。經過化學治療，有6至8成的病患可獲得緩解，但是整體來說，長期存活率約只有2至4成。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是西醫說的治療結果，跟中醫無關，中醫治療效果遠超過西醫多多。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-coid5bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-coid5bm","updated":"20240519103518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他表示，急性白血病病患早期容易出現反覆感冒、出血不止、倦怠、牙齦腫脹、胸骨疼痛，如果早期發現，可以減少急性腎衰竭、大量顱內出血、敗血症等併發症的發生，並提高治癒率。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(極早給西醫發現還是死路一條，不需要西醫的驗血報告，中醫也可以做出診斷。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-1p44yhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-1p44yhi","updated":"20240519103507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-9cr3jxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-9cr3jxc","updated":"20240519103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   直到目前為止這種病，西醫根本就是束手無策，只有眼睜睜的看著病人死去，你如果接受西醫的更換骨髓手術或是化療，我保證你必死，要想活命，只有找正統中醫或許可以救你一命，這種病根在亂吃各種維他命，或是濫用西藥抗生素，或是經常暴露在有輻射線的地方才造成的後果。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103502-4kzifr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103502-4kzifr0","updated":"20240519103502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月09日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103503-8gvmds5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103503-8gvmds5"}},{"ID":"20240519103531-7dstsvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-7dstsvw","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女醫師跳樓自殺 開刀房等不到人"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-i4kb3pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-i4kb3pe","updated":"20240519103536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報╱記者王昭月、林保光／高雄縣報導】2010.03.11 03:24 am"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-4sl0ate","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-4sl0ate","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高雄義大醫院神經外科住院女醫師伍淑君，昨天自醫院宿舍十四樓頂樓跳樓身亡，身上還穿著藍色手術衣；警方在她房間找到遺書，研判她可能與丈夫長期分隔兩地，聚少離多感情生變，離婚後心情不佳才會尋短。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-chn28wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-chn28wu","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"義大醫院發言人陳文旭說，卅二歲的伍淑君畢業於中國醫藥學院醫學系，馬來西亞華僑，娘家在台中，四年多前進入義大醫院，在神經外科服務；她丈夫住新加坡，也是醫師。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-by428y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-by428y3","updated":"20240519103609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「平常大家醫務繁忙，伍醫師個性比較沈默，」醫護人員透露，最近有同事聽到伍醫師抱怨，與丈夫感情出問題，想不到竟尋短。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人絕對不是因為離婚而尋短，是吃藥物造成自殺的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-4iyxq8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-4iyxq8b","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫護人員指出，伍淑君昨天下午原要進開刀房，過了中午，一直沒看到她現身，打電話也沒人接；找到十樓宿舍，從門外聽到電話鈴聲響，敲門卻沒人應答。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-v64ykkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-v64ykkw","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同事們覺得不對勁，通報尋找。下午四時卅分左右，在宿舍後方草地，發現身著藍色手術衣的伍淑君躺在血泊中，下巴斷裂、胸骨變形，已無生命跡象。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-jqbi63a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-jqbi63a","updated":"20240519103538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"警方在死者房間找到兩張以便條紙寫的遺書，大意指剛與住新加坡的丈夫離異，心情欠佳，夜夜需服藥入眠，不想活。另在她房間電腦蓋上，發現安眠藥與少許不明藥物，又在宿舍頂樓發現一雙女鞋及一枚髮飾；經調閱宿舍出入口監視器，發現她中午十二時五分上樓後就沒再出門。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(安眠藥讓人非常沮喪憂鬱，於是去服用抗憂鬱藥物， 這裡說的不明藥物一定就是抗憂鬱藥，而抗憂鬱藥物的副作用就是跳樓自殺。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-o4qyys1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-o4qyys1","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"殺人於無形的西毒"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-vwsvalh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-vwsvalh","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我敢保證這位女醫不是因為離婚而自殺的，是因為長期服用安眠藥後產生憂鬱，然後再去服用抗憂鬱藥物，而抗憂鬱藥的副作用就是會讓人很開心的去跳樓自殺，這種相同的情形已經不知發生過多少回，可是衛生署卻從未去質疑過西藥廠，所有的疑案都是從表面上婚姻不幸福引起自殺去結案，我時常想想，西毒真是很厲害的腳色，它們既能合法的賺黑心錢又能殺人於無形，各國的領導者似乎都被它所掌握而左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103531-f25jw3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103531-f25jw3l","updated":"20240519103531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月11日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103532-4x9fm1t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103532-4x9fm1t"}},{"ID":"20240519103617-jv2z87g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-jv2z87g","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"太過積極降低血壓　對糖尿病患不見得好"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-zieb08y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-zieb08y","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/15 14:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"蔡佳敏"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-foomklm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-foomklm","updated":"20240519103648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社亞特蘭大14日電） 今天發表的研究報告指出，試圖積極降低血壓和膽固醇的糖尿病患者，不但沒有降低心臟病的風險，還可能遭受負面效應。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-ubv44ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-ubv44ay","updated":"20240519103629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　這項指標性、簡稱ACCORD的「控制糖尿病患者心血管危險研究」（Action to Control CardiovascularRisk in Diabetes）臨床實驗結果，似乎反駁了醫師多年來給予第二型糖尿病患的建議。第二型糖尿病患是心臟病、中風和心血管疾病死亡的高危險群。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(明白的說，就是吃越多降血糖藥物將血糖降低，這樣做反而讓病人更容易得到心臟病與中風。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-yj9yz5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-yj9yz5j","updated":"20240519103631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　國家衛生研究院「國家心肺血液學會」（National Heart, Lung and Blood Institute）代理主任蘇林（Susan Shurin）說：「這項研究結果提供避免增加不必要治療的指引，這些治療好處有限，但卻會增加得到反效果的風險。」國家衛生研究院是ACCORD 主要贊助單位。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學都是昨是今非的醫學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-r59nrx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-r59nrx2","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　這項研究針對1萬251名介於40和79歲的第二型糖尿病患，進行平均10年的追蹤。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-ugvw77h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-ugvw77h","updated":"20240519103649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　美國和加拿大77個研究中心的科學家，把4733名有高血壓的研究對象分成兩組，一組以高血壓藥進行強化治療，一組接受標準治療。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-xaer9w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-xaer9w9","updated":"20240519103632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　經過平均5年的追蹤，科學家在兩組人身上看不到明顯差異。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(也就是說，這五年的西藥是白吃了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-hnh1z2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-hnh1z2b","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　研究報告指出，強化治療組有208起「心血管事件」，相較於標準治療組的237起。不過，研究發現，強化治療組中風的風險低了約40%。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-fps9v95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-fps9v95","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　儘管如此，研究人員警告：「強化治療組的參與者，較可能有不正常低血壓或血鉀過高的併發症。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-3snrm9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-3snrm9y","updated":"20240519103636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　研究報告的撰寫人之一表示：「這些新發現顯示，我們通常不需要特別加強標準治療程序。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(所以說過去的標準是不對的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-endov1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-endov1r","updated":"20240519103638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　她警告，研究結果並不表示，病患應該跳過標準治療程序來控制血壓、壓低壞膽固醇。（譯者：中央社蔡佳敏）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是替西醫學留點面子才說的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103621-xcb0c2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103621-xcb0c2d","updated":"20240519103622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-ylkwrsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-ylkwrsd","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    西藥廠是最不老實的利益團體，當它們述說疾病時的態度是將疾病妖魔化，必須將疾病說得非常可怕，因為它們知道，只有這樣做，才會引起人們的注意，然後才有藉口去研發疫苗與所謂的抗病毒藥等，像對於將血糖控制於一定的指數之內，這本來從一開始就是不對的方向，現在出事了，當這些研究人員心裡都知道了，但是動作上卻不會很積極的去將它改變，所以這類研究等於是說了也等於沒說的研究。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-lhq3qg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-lhq3qg7","updated":"20240519103624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"    只要是會防礙西藥廠獲利的研究，都會遭到滅火或是被群魔群起而攻之的結果。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103617-sj73vim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103617-sj73vim","updated":"20240519103617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月16日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103618-jgt6nl7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103618-jgt6nl7"}},{"ID":"20240519103657-129bluv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-129bluv","updated":"20240519103657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"逾5成陽明院生 骨質老化"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-v228og1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-v228og1","updated":"20240519103657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/16 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-my5pmrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-my5pmrw","updated":"20240519103702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者邱紹雯／台北報導〕台北市立陽明教養院調查，院內超過5成身心障礙者有骨質疏鬆問題，老化問題日趨嚴重，院內展開「保骨本」大作戰，但不少院生家長也憂心，必須自費服用藥物與鈣片，成為弱勢家庭沉重負擔。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真是丟臉啊，這些醫療人員從不研究為何住院病患會出現這些問題?)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-mcmkkyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-mcmkkyd","updated":"20240519103704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽明教養院保健課長陳威勝表示，在台北市立聯合醫院陽明院區協助下，首度對全院180名院生進行骨質密度檢測，結果發現，71人骨質缺乏，25人有骨質疏鬆症，院生平均年齡31歲，但骨質年齡看起來已經65歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是證據，證明這些住院病患因為長期吃西藥才造成的後遺症。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-xg20s9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-xg20s9o","updated":"20240519103706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"院方表示，身心障礙者除較難有固定良好的運動，也因家屬重視與其障礙相關疾病，忽略飲食均衡、體適能活動與生活習慣養成，讓骨質流失成為老化的隱形殺手。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這跟病患家屬有何關係呢？又在怪別人錯，從不自己認錯。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-jibyk7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-jibyk7o","updated":"20240519103709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽明教養院展開「保骨本」大作戰，規劃防跌專區，加強戶外日照活動，同時在飲食上強化鈣質和維他命補充，配合鈣片與藥物服務治療，並針對個人狀況製作健康紀錄卡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(想法很好，但是如果不聽中醫的話，這個問題絕對越來越嚴重。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-hrt947v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-hrt947v","updated":"20240519103711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳威勝說，由於目前健保對於骨質流失與疏鬆所需的鈣片、藥物並無給付，院生若需每天服用鈣片與藥物改善骨質狀況，一年必須自負1萬多元，不少家長反映無法負荷，需要外界協助。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(又在推銷只會害人的鈣片跟騙人有效的補骨類西藥，真是壞透了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-fdd26ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-fdd26ir","updated":"20240519103657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"真是壞透了"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-bu4ffjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-bu4ffjh","updated":"20240519103657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這群長期住院病患之所以會發生這類問題，就是因為長期吃各種的西藥造成的，如果不改變這種生活方式，骨質與老化問題是不可能被解決的，我們同時也根本就不需要花錢去買任何人工合成的鈣片，吃這種山寨版的鈣片，只會讓人得到腎結石， 也同時讓人的骨質更鬆，我們只需要去吃些芝麻、海帶、小魚乾、洋西菜、蝦米等，就可以從中獲得非常巨量對骨質真正有助益的天然鈣質了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-cbv192s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-cbv192s","updated":"20240519103657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月16日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103657-7w1nryr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103657-7w1nryr"}},{"ID":"20240519103717-7k9ynn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-7k9ynn8","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"香蕉凝集素 可望成抗愛滋新成分"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-lg3rd8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-lg3rd8s","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/17 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【記者蘇湘雲／綜合外電報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-qvipho3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-qvipho3","updated":"20240519103737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"香蕉不止可以幫助消化，說不定還能對抗愛滋病毒。美國密西根大學研究人員進行實驗室研究時發現，香蕉中有一種「凝集素」成分Ban Lec，這種成分有助對抗人類免疫缺乏病毒（HIV），和兩種常用抗愛滋藥物相比效果不相上下。研究人員相信，這種治療方式很便宜，若善加應用此成分，應可拯救數以百萬的生命。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(一根香蕉就如同種抗愛滋藥效果，讀者覺得如何呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-9x944qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-9x944qi","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凝集素自然存在於植物當中，幫助植物對抗外來感染。研究人員發現，香蕉中的凝集素BanLec在蛋白質上作用，包圍HIV基因，這樣病毒就不致長驅直入。這項研究發表於「生物化學期刊」。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-t4763n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-t4763n3","updated":"20240519103739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首席研究員麥克史汪森（Michael Swanson）接受英國「每日郵報」專訪時表示，愛滋病毒會產生突變，並出現抗藥性，因此有些藥物會逐漸失去效用，但香蕉裡的凝集素較少產生這類問題，它會和糖分連結在一起，跟著病毒變化，病毒比較無法衝破防線。研究人員期盼未來這種成分能應用於臨床治療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這意思就是香蕉還比西藥好。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-vhi2wip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-vhi2wip","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天然的最好"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-gupp8w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-gupp8w7","updated":"20240519103744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     香蕉是台灣的特產，可是台灣的醫學家卻不去研究它，反而讓國外的專家發現它的好處，真是丟臉啊，一隻香蕉就可抵二種抗病毒藥，而且還沒有抗藥(蕉)性，所以還是天然的好，既沒有副作用，又沒有抗藥性，效果又強又迅速，現在有許多的研究已經證實"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"天然的蔬果與草藥等，其對人體產生所謂的自體化療"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其作用比現在醫院中使用的化療藥物還來得強又來得有威力些，這些研究顯示我們根本就不需要這些抗病毒藥與化療藥物，只要知道如何選對食物，選對正統中醫師，病痛就會遠離妳的身體。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-ub0ujq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-ub0ujq9","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     近日來我台北診所就治癒一名鼻咽癌患者，這位患者由於是從一開始就由我們診所張宸鴻醫師來施治，不到二個月現在所有症狀全部消除，連喉嚨上方的淋巴腫塊都消失了。如果你是位鼻咽癌患者，你又已經動過手術或是做過電療，放射線療等，你恢復的機會就非常渺茫，所以是交給中醫來治療還是由西醫來治療，你自己做選擇吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103717-mnu0p50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103717-mnu0p50","updated":"20240519103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月16日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103718-jc20rq5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103718-jc20rq5"}},{"ID":"20240519103840-b98muqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-b98muqq","updated":"20240519103840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"藥不得 小心骨本流失"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-me50b9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-me50b9q","updated":"20240519103840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/17 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【記者蘇湘雲／台北報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-j15dhl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-j15dhl7","updated":"20240519103855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許多藥物都可能增加骨質疏鬆風險，中華民國骨質疏鬆症學會秘書長、林口長庚醫院新陳代謝科黃兆山醫師舉例，像糖尿病患者常用胰島素增敏劑控制血糖，不過這類藥物容易干擾造骨細胞活性，造骨細胞不活化時，骨質疏鬆問題可能更為嚴重，因此服藥患者一定要留意骨質密度變化。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是位說實話的西醫師。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-hmrap3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-hmrap3i","updated":"20240519103857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃兆山醫師解釋，除了糖尿病用藥外，類固醇、某些抗癲癇藥物、抗憂鬱劑血清素抑制劑等都可能影響骨質密度，研究文獻指出，使用胰島素增敏劑患者罹患骨質疏鬆症風險增加四十五％。另外，有些胃潰瘍、胃酸逆流患者長期使用制酸劑以抑制胃酸逆流，這類藥物也容易減少骨質密度。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(過去我可有說錯嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-gqsxihz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-gqsxihz","updated":"20240519103846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃兆山醫師表示，許多因素都會影響骨質密度，有些人也許現在骨質密度正常，但未來十年罹患骨質疏鬆症的風險卻比常人高，像年齡增長，人體對鈣質、維生素D吸收效率變差，或者荷爾蒙變化、癌症、甲狀腺、副甲狀腺功能等都可能對骨質健康造成衝擊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-mrzogwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-mrzogwg","updated":"20240519103901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"為了了解罹患骨質疏鬆症風險，黃兆山醫師推薦國際骨質疏鬆症協會FRAX-WHO網站，這類網站可以幫助計算、評估十年骨鬆、骨折機率，若是高危險群，就要更小心骨質流失問題。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(光是計算骨質損失多少，是沒有用的動作，應該教民眾如何正確的選擇食物來補充骨本才對。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-9u9o2sr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-9u9o2sr","updated":"20240519103903"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃兆山醫師另指出，多數糖尿病患者常合併其他慢性疾病、甚至因某些用藥而有較高的骨鬆骨折風險，有些患者則因用藥種類繁多而導致服藥遵醫囑性不高，相當需要簡易又安全的治療方式。這類患者可考慮使用一年一針方式治療骨質疏鬆症。但醫師也提醒，使用這類雙磷酸鹽藥物時，患者要特別注意口腔衛生，以免感染增加顎骨壞死風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(其實這藥就是Forsamax。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-gsolzwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-gsolzwb","updated":"20240519103843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-wmpywgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-wmpywgn","updated":"20240519103913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    多年以來我ㄧ直在說，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正造成讓人骨質流失的是西藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果再吃西藥想將已經耗損的骨質補回來，根本就是天方夜談，不要做夢了。這種問題只有靠中醫才有可能解決，但是首先要做到的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一件事就是要停止繼續再吃西藥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了，如果病人無法停止吃西藥的話，骨質疏鬆的問題是無法解決的。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103840-l97dkfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103840-l97dkfd","updated":"20240519103840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月18日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103841-jea32hg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103841-jea32hg"}},{"ID":"20240519103917-zaybr3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-zaybr3y","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"陽萎男夠「倒」楣　心血管發病機率高"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-rosmava","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-rosmava","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/17 17:03 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"生活中心／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-dsm4v3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-dsm4v3m","updated":"20240519103921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「不舉」的人要注意了！德國薩爾倫大學（University of Saarland）對心血管疾病的男性做調查，發現陽痿(ED)男心臟病發作或死亡的風險是其他人的兩倍。主持研究的波恩博士（Michael bohm）呼籲，除了找泌尿科應順便檢查心血管。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(從一開始就說錯了，應該說是因為吃西藥就會造成陽痿，而陽痿就是有心臟病的先兆。所以還是吃西藥的人，就比較容易得到心臟病。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-fs4lwma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-fs4lwma","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千萬不要「損了小頭（龜頭），還壞了大頭」。薩爾倫大學這項研究包含了13個國家，1519名有心血管疾病的男子，針對他們心血管問題和性功能進行長期追蹤發現，性無能者心臟病發作或死亡的風險高出兩倍；中風或心臟衰竭的人也多了10％到20％。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-rlomloe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-rlomloe","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"波恩博士表示，因為勃起功能障礙去看醫師的病患，就應該順便檢查心血管，特別是年齡超過40歲的男性。事實上，醫學上一直都在探討性功能出現障礙連帶心血管的問題，但避免悲劇發生其實很簡單。飲食清淡，因為陰莖是一種血管器官，若攝取太多膽固醇及飽和脂肪，可能使陰莖窄化，造成陽萎；戒煙則可避免因血管收縮造成勃起組織的平滑肌鬆弛。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-r5mc721","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-r5mc721","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-l4bjub8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-l4bjub8","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     真正造成陽痿的原因就是來自西藥，從抗生素到止痛藥，從降三高藥到阿斯匹林等，都會造成陽痿，而這些西藥也是會造成服用的人，得到心臟病的主因，所以西藥是給敵人吃的，自己千萬不要吃，一但吃上癮，將來就會很容易的引發心臟病而猝死。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-wnz0ef4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-wnz0ef4","updated":"20240519103927"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 世界上唯一能將心臟病治好的醫學，就是正統中醫經方學，世界上唯一能夠做到預防心臟病突發的醫學，也是正統經方中醫學。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103917-2rbvhse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103917-2rbvhse","updated":"20240519103917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月19日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103918-9pjjpoz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103918-9pjjpoz"}},{"ID":"20240519103932-swz1yo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-swz1yo5","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"多重抗藥性結核病　WHO：威脅全球健康"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-24q8vfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-24q8vfn","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/19 15:20 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"張稚昀"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-oc7a2yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-oc7a2yn","updated":"20240519103943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社日內瓦18日電） 世界衛生組織（WHO）今天警告，致命的多重抗藥性結核病（multidrugresistant tuberculosis）已經成為全球健康的一大威脅，只有一小部份的病例接受診斷。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(之所以會出現多重抗藥性的病毒，就是因為過去西醫濫用西藥的結果造成的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-92pp3iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-92pp3iy","updated":"20240519103944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WHO在一份關於難以治療的多重抗藥性結核病最新報告中表示，他們已紀錄到這種結核病約5%的病例，是有史以來最高紀錄。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫已經承認自己都難以治療，這跟中醫無關的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-3f4yrkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-3f4yrkl","updated":"20240519103946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"該組織估計，每年新增的940萬結核病患中，2008年全球有44萬人罹患多重抗藥性結核，其中1/3死亡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些人之所以會死亡，就是因為沒有讓中醫出手治療的結果。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-hyfq3ed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-hyfq3ed","updated":"20240519103948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大約一半的多重抗藥性結核病例，預估是發生在中國和印度。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請居住在這兩地的人民，不要再施打各種疫苗，也不要再濫用抗生素了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-cj0mi9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-cj0mi9u","updated":"20240519103952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據這份報告，俄羅斯西北部罹患結核病的人，有1/4是屬於多重抗藥性，這是從未出現過的比例。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就表示俄羅斯西北部的西醫，過去一直在濫用抗生素。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-7fiv4ww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-7fiv4ww","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"報告作者之一奇格諾（Matteo Zignol）表示：「我們估計每年約有50萬個病例，其中只有一小部分，約7%，受到診斷和治療。」（譯者：中央社張稚昀）"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-kg57uo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-kg57uo1","updated":"20240519103958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-5xqp7i3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-5xqp7i3","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    結核病(tuberculosis)一直是個存在的問題，這種病在任何國家都不會讓中醫出手治療，因為西醫將它列入法定傳病，得病之人必須強制的服用抗結核病的西藥，直到傳染力減弱到西醫滿意為止，這種抗結核病的西藥非常之毒，許多病人服用沒多久，就發生肝臟衰竭，於是只有換肝一途，也就是說結核病還沒受到控制，卻又得面對肝臟衰竭的問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-whjlx2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-whjlx2n","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    一直以來西醫對這種病都是束手無策，唯一的治療方式就是使用這些控制性的藥物，使用西藥最讓人擔憂的就是所謂的抗藥性出現，一但出現西醫就完全無法控制，病人只能坐以待斃，現在出現了所謂的多重抗藥性結核病，就是這類問題，西醫至今都不知道中醫藥對這種結核病療效非常之好，由於我們中醫的治療方式是採用排除病毒的方式，不是要用中藥去殺死病毒，所以無論病毒怎麼變異，同樣的藥照樣可以使用，效果還是很好的，我希望醫界的同僚們，大家秉持人溺己溺的精神，遇到這種病人時，不要眼睜睜的看病人死去，應該建議病人去找中醫來治療，給病人一絲求生的機會。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-aqv4ect","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-aqv4ect","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    任何疾病一但出現抗藥性時，中醫都可以插手治療，中藥從未遇到所謂抗藥性的問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240519103932-ffwsqa3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519103932-ffwsqa3","updated":"20240519103932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月21日"}]},{"ID":"20240519103933-4px34bw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519103933-4px34bw"}},{"ID":"20240519104002-uyo74e9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-uyo74e9","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"B肝帶原 年年驗血正常 照超音波 才知肝癌末期"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-j5kf6xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-j5kf6xz","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者徐夏蓮／台中報導  更新日期:2010/03/19 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-lwwgutw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-lwwgutw","updated":"20240519104021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台中市一名20歲男子因B肝帶原，每年驗血檢查肝功能都說正常，卻忽略了同時也要定期做腹部超音波檢查。等他發現不對勁時，已經是肝癌末期，家人花了上百萬元，讓他做標靶治療，仍挽回不了他的寶貴性命。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這家人被西醫騙，才會浪費了上百萬元，病人還是死亡。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-0npybs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-0npybs7","updated":"20240519104023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"忽略定期做超音波"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不用做超音波中醫也可以知道肝癌已經發生。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-75mazrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-75mazrv","updated":"20240519104019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的46歲父親為此去做健檢，檢查出罹患第一期大腸癌，也是沒有症狀，目前正接受化療中。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不做檢查還活得好好的，一做就要出人命的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-uedfm6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-uedfm6f","updated":"20240519104017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台中榮總家醫科醫師陳惠真昨天指出，這名男子20歲時，即因肝癌病逝，震撼了全家族，男子的父母、祖父母、叔伯、阿姨、弟妹等親人，全都為此來台中榮總接受健康檢查，就是不希望憾事重演。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是西醫學太爛，才造成年輕人20歲就死於肝癌，跟中醫無關。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-6ccd87o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-6ccd87o","updated":"20240519104016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等發現不對勁 已來不及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(就算發現對，找西醫還是死路一條。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-dkpwvue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-dkpwvue","updated":"20240519104014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男子的父親在自覺沒有任何異狀下，做大腸鏡檢查發現罹患第一期大腸癌，大腸鏡檢查可以清楚看見他的腫瘤處已出血，他苦笑說：「如果不是兒子的死，我絕對捨不得花錢健檢。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不動它可能還沒事，一動它就會擴散成肝癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-phongie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-phongie","updated":"20240519104012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位父親只要一提到自己花幾萬元健檢就可以早發現、早治療，保住性命，才20歲的兒子發現時已是肝癌末期，花上百萬元也救不回一條命時，哀慟不已，也認為，政府沒有大力宣導B肝帶原者每年除了驗血檢查外，也要做腹部超音波檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(他沒有從兒子死亡得到教訓，還是一眛的相信西醫，他不知道西醫學是無法治療肝癌的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-pxdlcdk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-pxdlcdk","updated":"20240519104008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳惠真醫師指出，其實衛生單位不是沒宣導，只是很多人都誤以為，驗血檢查肝功能等指數正常，就沒必要再做腹部超音波檢查。其實「驗血正常」不代表沒有罹癌，如果知道自己是B肝帶原者，每年就該同時做抽血檢查及腹部超音波檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫不懂早期的肝癌就有症狀，所以會這樣說。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-aph8uno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-aph8uno","updated":"20240519104009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳惠真表示，健保給付40歲以上民眾每3年1次成人健檢，衛署國民健康局也給付特定資格者免費的乳癌、子宮頸癌、大腸癌、口腔癌篩檢，符合資格者不要讓自己的基本健檢權利睡著了。如果經濟能力許可，再自費做些高階健檢，早發現早治療，付出這筆錢絕對是值得的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果說付出這筆錢絕對值得的話，為何台灣還是舉世肝癌第一、洗腎第一的島，每年得到乳癌的病人人數，不斷攀升呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-gus8ocs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-gus8ocs","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-0gqe0n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-0gqe0n3","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這篇報導存在幾個疑問，第一 : 西醫不知肝癌從初期就有症狀，所以才會等到使用超音波查到時，查到病人已經是肝癌末期了。第二 : 對於肝癌末期，西醫應該已經沒有任何治療方法了，我不知道為何病人家屬還會在醫院中花費上百萬元的治療費用？這表示西醫在落井下石，趁火打劫病人家屬，真是要不得。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-mb77ct5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-mb77ct5","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    民眾有肝炎的問題時，請找中醫來諮詢，千萬不要去找西醫做檢查與治療，找西醫只有唯一死路，毫無生機，中醫藥可以治療肝炎，也可以做到預防肝癌的發生，千萬不可以聽信西醫說的吃什麼肝安能之類的藥物來殺死肝炎病毒，就以為可以預防你得到肝癌的，這是騙人錢財又害人得到肝癌的藥物。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104002-vmasgiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104002-vmasgiu","updated":"20240519104002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月21日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104003-bs6w1k4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104003-bs6w1k4"}},{"ID":"20240519104035-p9766us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-p9766us","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"服維他命D可降低罹患流感"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-n8wgs8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-n8wgs8o","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/22 02:29 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"黃文正／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-9h5flhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-9h5flhi","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報【黃文正／綜合報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-3e9tt7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-3e9tt7r","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本一項研究發現，在冬天和初春服用維他命Ｄ的學童，可降低感染季節性流感和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/v-a8.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"氣喘","TextMarkTextContent":"氣喘"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"發作的風險。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-rumsqht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-rumsqht","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"領導這項實驗的慈惠會醫科大學充義浦島博士說，此構想源於先前針對維他命Ｄ能否預防骨質疏鬆症的一項研究，該研究發現定期服用維他命Ｄ者，罹患感冒或流感的風險，較未服用者低了三倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-om8c765","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-om8c765","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"實驗於二○○八年十二月至二○○九年三月感冒和流感季節進行，隨機挑選六至十五歲學生，每日服用一千二百國際單位的維他命Ｄ３，另一對照組則每日服用安慰劑。試驗發現，一百六十七名服用安慰劑的學生中，有卅一名感染常見的Ａ型流感，但一百六十七名服用維他命Ｄ的學生，只有十八人感染。另外，此一實驗也意外發現，服用維他命Ｄ也有降低氣喘發作的功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-3j7bg27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-3j7bg27","updated":"20240519104038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-h0ehs1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-h0ehs1g","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者可以時常看到這類的報導，這些報導其真正的目的，就是要大家去購買維他命來吃，真是壞透了。大家千萬不要上當，我們絕對需要維他命Ｄ，但是不要去買維他命Ｄ片劑來吃，真正對我們有利的維他命Ｄ是自己身體製造出來的才對我們有利，而我們的身體只需曬曬太陽就會製造出維他命Ｄ，根本就不需要去吃維他命Ｄ。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-vb3kpnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-vb3kpnq","updated":"20240519104035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月23日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104035-0dkb0mt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104035-0dkb0mt"}},{"ID":"20240519104043-k85i4bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-k85i4bc","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究：從未吸菸卻得肺癌 基因變異恐為元兇"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-r0ny41u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-r0ny41u","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/22 11:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"林仟懿"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-6y0vsg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-6y0vsg7","updated":"20240519104051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社巴黎21日電） 美國醫生今天指出，數百人基因遺傳碼的調查結果，可能有助解釋從不吸菸的人為何仍有罹患肺癌的不尋常風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(每當西醫學不知道病因時，就推是基因問題，我早就說過，抽菸不是得到肺癌的原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-vbqymcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-vbqymcs","updated":"20240519104053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般認為，只有癮君子或吸過菸的人才會罹患肺癌。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我早就說過，這是錯誤的看法。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-vrv0i5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-vrv0i5g","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不過全球1成肺癌患者屬於「從未吸菸者」，即一輩子一口菸都沒抽過，或者一生抽不到100根菸。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-1gcvoio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-1gcvoio","updated":"20240519104056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這個比例在亞洲更高，約有3至4成肺癌患者「從未吸菸」。全球近2/3「從未吸菸者」為女性。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請讀者參考我寫的有關乳癌論文，就可以知道為什麼。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-7fkdige","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-7fkdige","updated":"20240519104101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這項研究由明尼蘇達州羅徹斯特（Rochester）梅約醫學院（Mayo Clinic College of Medicine）的楊平（Ping Yang）領導，研究754名不論有無肺癌的不吸菸者，他們發現，這些人的13號染色體上有兩種正能解釋他們病因的基因變異。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種說法無濟於事。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-q3hx4js","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-q3hx4js","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究發現，這些變異使罹患肺癌的機率提高近6成。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-yz3kyhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-yz3kyhg","updated":"20240519104059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一說是，天生基因脆弱的人，可能受某種常見卻不明的觸因引發肺癌。可能的觸因包括二手菸、環境污染物、砷及人類乳突病毒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種說法還是無濟於事。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-1oqc2wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-1oqc2wk","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這份研究報告刊載於「刺胳針腫瘤學」（LancetOncology）期刊線上版。（譯者：中央社林仟懿）"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-fe0ivv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-fe0ivv1","updated":"20240519104047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-rmh65r6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-rmh65r6","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這篇報導從頭到尾只有一個重點，就是抽菸不見得會得到肺癌，我ㄧ直在說這一點，我並不是要替菸草公司說話，而是我要說實話，只有實話可以深入人心，真正引發肺癌的原因，讀者可以參考我寫的有關乳癌的論文，就可以了解為什麼會得到肺癌的真正原因，抽菸不是唯一原因，所以過去西醫的宣導是錯的，西醫學需要時常去修正過去它們自己說的話，中醫學就不需要，因為千年以來，中醫學一直就是正確的醫學。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104043-0qqggi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104043-0qqggi1","updated":"20240519104043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月23日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104106-vxyl1xe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104106-vxyl1xe"}},{"ID":"20240519104116-0ssnuvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-0ssnuvu","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"海帶纖維 可抗肥胖"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-jg3b5zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-jg3b5zy","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/23 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【記者蘇湘雲／綜合外電報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-jmwt2sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-jmwt2sc","updated":"20240519104122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海帶纖維可能是對抗肥胖的利器，英國紐卡索大學（NewcastleUni-versity）研究發現，海帶纖維可以減少體內脂肪吸收，減少幅度達75％以上，研究人員希望能把海帶纖維加入麵包當中，研發減重食品，幫助民眾對抗肥胖威脅。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-aj2cmky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-aj2cmky","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國紐卡索大學傑夫‧皮爾森教授和伊恩‧布朗里博士進行實驗室研究，他們發現海帶、海藻含有「褐藻膠」（Alginate），這是一種天然纖維，可以阻止身體吸收大量脂肪，比現有減重療法更有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-of2x13f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-of2x13f","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究人員使用人工腸胃臟器作實驗，測試超過60種自然纖維，觀察這些纖維是否會影響脂肪消化、吸收。這項研究發表在今年美國化學學會春季研討會，研究人員指出，下一步將進行人體臨床研究，評估人體對這些食物纖維的反應。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-302w578","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-302w578","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布朗里博士解釋，許多人都想減重，不過往往非常困難。根據研究結果顯示，如果麵包、餅乾和優格等食品能添加這種自然纖維，或許每餐攝取的脂肪有3/4就直接通過體內，不會被人體吸收。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-gm8gu08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-gm8gu08","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布朗里博士補充，「褐藻膠」不止可以幫助控制體重，也可以把它視為膳食纖維，加入食品當中有助提升纖維攝取量。膳食纖維雖不會被消化吸收，但卻能維持腸道健康。初步研究來看，「褐藻膠」也許真能對付肥胖，減少脂肪囤積體內。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-gqojjoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-gqojjoh","updated":"20240519104119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-4v1789g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-4v1789g","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   光是看這篇研究就可以知道，西醫學對於海藻的功用，還是沒有搞清楚，海藻除了可以幫助減肥之外，中醫學認為鹹能軟堅，所以海藻對於喉部的腫瘤消除，效果非常的好，還有海藻裡的鈣含量是等量牛奶鈣含量的850倍，所以吃海藻就直接可以補到骨頭中需要的鈣，根本就不需要鈣片了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104116-b1m3nq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104116-b1m3nq5","updated":"20240519104116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月23日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104117-onuk131","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104117-onuk131"}},{"ID":"20240519104127-z7x7hoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-z7x7hoe","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北歐研究：乳癌篩檢無法救命　檢查年限爭議多"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-5u46wny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-5u46wny","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/24 12:07"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-iqq1xmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-iqq1xmn","updated":"20240519104148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（路透倫敦24日電）北歐科學家今天表示，他們未發現女性乳癌篩檢對死亡率有任何影響的證據。這個說法加劇了早已讓國際激辯已久的例行檢查一事。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(看吧，我早就說過，台灣衛生署一直在提倡婦女每年應該檢查乳房是錯的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-g2yblye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-g2yblye","updated":"20240519104151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　丹麥與挪威的研究人員在刊於「英國醫學期刊」（British Medical Journal）的研究表示，篩檢地區乳癌死亡率下滑的幅度，等同或甚至小於不做篩檢的地區。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(看吧。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-5fclm16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-5fclm16","updated":"20240519104145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"率領這項研究的哥本哈根「北歐科克倫中心」（Nordic Cochrane Centre）的約根森（Karsten Jorgensen）表示：「我們的研究結果，與其他備有全國組織計畫的國家所觀察到的結果類似。」他說：「該是質疑篩檢是否達到當初承諾的效果、降低乳癌死亡率的時候了。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這人說的就是實話，台灣衛生署官員看到了嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-84rxxtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-84rxxtv","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　約根森表示，儘管各國乳癌篩檢計畫都不盡相同，但丹麥可作為良好基準，他的研究小組的調查結果應該會對這些辯論有所影響。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-r7vxf7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-r7vxf7f","updated":"20240519104143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　丹麥女性自50歲起每兩年做一次乳房篩檢，美國則是建議年逾50歲女性每1年至2年做乳房X光檢查，英國的政策則是年逾50歲的女性每3年檢查一次。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這類檢查做得越多，不但無助於預防乳癌，反而越容易讓婦女們得到乳癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-zf51y1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-zf51y1p","updated":"20240519104138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　批評人士表示，若篩檢預防更多人死亡的功能，不敵它所需的額外就醫時間、支出和假警報所造成的壓力和擔憂，那麼篩檢的壞處便大於它的好處。中央社（翻譯）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人說得很正確。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-3l18o95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-3l18o95","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-z5dkgvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-z5dkgvc","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    西醫一直說，每年定期做乳癌篩檢可以預防婦女得到乳癌，這根本就在胡說八道，對乳房做過度的檢查，反而更容易讓婦女們得到乳癌，而且讓婦女們在檢查前與檢查後都產生嚴重的心理壓力，而這些心理壓力卻正好又是能製造乳癌或是其他癌症的最好利器，真是一種既浪費金錢又害人生病的一種金錢遊戲，這種作法必須停止，否則只會繼續浪費公帑下去，圖利了西醫院，讓百姓更受累。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104127-0gg469v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104127-0gg469v","updated":"20240519104127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月25日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104128-aa16y5b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104128-aa16y5b"}},{"ID":"20240519104159-edjj9j7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-edjj9j7","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究：笑得開活得久　笑出魚尾紋活最久"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-bdvp9a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-bdvp9a5","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/25 10:50 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"賴秀如"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-a92iazn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-a92iazn","updated":"20240519104212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社華盛頓24日電） 本週出版的「心理科學」（Psychological Science）月刊研究指出，你笑得越開懷，眼尾皺摺越深，你就可能活得越久。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是眾所週知的理論，但是每年的乳癌篩檢會讓婦女們開心嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-kqx7z7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-kqx7z7z","updated":"20240519104223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"密西根州的偉恩州立大學（Wayne StateUniversity）研究員阿貝爾（Ernest Abel）率領的研究團隊，根據1950年以前就開始進入美國大聯盟的棒球選手，從中找出230張棒球選手們照片，依微笑程度分類。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-y3gvgjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-y3gvgjk","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這些棒球選手若只是不動聲色地對著相機，就分在「不微笑」類；如果只是牽動一些嘴邊肌肉，則分在「稍為微笑」類；如果嘴笑眼笑，雙頰上揚，就歸入「完全微笑」類。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-dgw6emt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-dgw6emt","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這些棒球選手的照片是在1952年選手登記時拍的。當年的登記資料包括職業棒球選手的出生年、身高質量指數（BMI）、婚姻狀況和進入職棒的時間等資料。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-q8owkvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-q8owkvo","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由於統計資料豐富，使得研究員能夠控制其他影響壽命的因素，進行研究。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-o6tma7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-o6tma7o","updated":"20240519104217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在去年6月1日以前死亡的球員，名列「不微笑」類組的平均壽命是72.9歲，名列「稍微微笑」類組者，平均活了75歲，但是「完全微笑」類組的球員平均年齡高達79.9歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣衛生署提倡的健檢，就是一種想盡辦法讓人不開心的政策，所以台灣人必短命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-jqycje9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-jqycje9","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究指出，微笑強度反映了情緒性格，這項研究結果跟其他研究一致認為，（好）情緒跟心理健康、身體健康和長壽都是正相關。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-8lfwzet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-8lfwzet","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是研究員並不清楚棒球員在拍照時，是自發性地微笑，或依攝影師指示而微笑。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-q5bcpul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-q5bcpul","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是不論如何，還是很少人完全微笑，總共才23人，相對的，稍微微笑的是64人，不微笑者有63人。這讓研究員認為，就算是應（攝影師）要求而笑，笑的強度還是反映了棒球員的「一般深層性格」。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-81j2spd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-81j2spd","updated":"20240519104204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此整個研究結論就是，如果你想活久一點，過著快樂的日子，那就用力學會擠出魚尾紋的辦法！（譯者：中央社賴秀如）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果這是對的，那台灣的衛生署必須修正其政策，台灣的政黨也需要檢討自己的行為。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-gzie9ss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-gzie9ss","updated":"20240519104201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-7m6ii3r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-7m6ii3r","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這是絕對正確的說法，不需要再去驗證了，大家看看台灣的醫療政策與居住環境，請問你，如果你真的很在乎每一件事的話，你會開心嗎？我認為只有視而不見的人，才會開心得起來，尤其是台灣的醫療政策，就是讓人最不開心的政策，尤其是健保法這個最害人的法律，加上每年替老百姓做的健檢，不但浪費許多醫療資源，圖利了西醫院之外，還讓被檢查的人，每天擔心檢驗的結果，這些心理的壓力會讓人微笑嗎？台灣人很少有人每天都在微笑，所以台灣才是世界第一的洗腎之島與肝癌之島的原因了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104159-2855rz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104159-2855rz1","updated":"20240519104159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月25日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104233-mpwgdpc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104233-mpwgdpc"}},{"ID":"20240519104235-0oo4436","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-0oo4436","updated":"20240519104235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4項癌篩 縣府目標30萬人"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-kbbksqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-kbbksqr","updated":"20240519104235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/24 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-04dv7ij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-04dv7ij","updated":"20240519104244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者謝鳳秋／豐原報導〕口腔癌、大腸癌、子宮頸癌、乳癌篩檢納入健保給付，台中縣衛生局長陳南松23日宣布，縣內今年4項癌症篩檢目標數設定30萬人，符合篩檢資格者帶健保卡可接受免費篩檢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(又要出人命了，這些官員以為這樣做老百姓就會開心，事實上這種作法只會讓許多人，每天擔心害怕的在過日子，對人民一點幫助都沒有。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-mm0yabr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-mm0yabr","updated":"20240519104247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癌症早期發現並非絕症，龍井鄉衛生所便有一案例，媳婦載68歲王女士做乳房超音波檢查，發現左乳房有一硬塊約3公分左右，且乳頭有些凹陷，原來王女士幾個月前即感覺有硬硬的異狀，因不痛不癢，未向家人提及。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種不用檢查，光是看到乳頭凹下，就可以確診是乳癌了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-12qzd29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-12qzd29","updated":"20240519104249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衛生所轉介個案至區域醫院接受乳房攝影檢查，確診罹患乳癌，護士又鍥而不捨地追蹤鼓勵王女士接受治療，術後恢復良好，還計畫著下個月出國旅遊，媳婦最近到衛生所向護士說謝謝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者不要被騙了，這位婦女只是因為剛開完刀暫時看來沒事，我保證不出一、二年就會出現乳癌移轉成其他癌症的後果。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-fji0x71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-fji0x71","updated":"20240519104252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳南松說，衛生署國民健康局推動癌症防治相關工作，目標是癌症死亡率4年降10%，子宮頸抹片與乳房X光攝影檢查之前已納入健保，今年起又將口腔癌、大腸癌篩檢納入健保給付，且擴大篩檢對象。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(想依靠這種篩檢方式來達到癌症防治相關工作，根本就在癡人說夢，這樣做的結果只會讓人民更不開心，死得更快而已。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-3z234tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-3z234tr","updated":"20240519104254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口腔癌篩檢對象為30歲以上吸菸、嚼檳榔的高危險群民眾，大腸癌篩檢對象為50至69歲民眾，乳房X光攝影檢查對象為45至69歲婦女，這3項檢查2年補助一次；子宮頸癌抹片檢查對象為30歲以上婦女，每年一次。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(應該要民眾戒菸、戒除吃檳榔的習慣才是，光是靠篩檢是沒有用的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-wm5b29r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-wm5b29r","updated":"20240519104256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以大腸癌篩檢來說，去年共有2萬864人接受篩檢，發現疑似個案有821人，進一步檢查後，其中333人長瘜肉，屬癌前病變，確定為大腸癌者有16人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不檢查還好，檢查後被查出癌症的人，當場就已經被嚇死掉了，於是就變得死得更痛苦些又更短命些。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-2q8mtos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-2q8mtos","updated":"20240519104235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-21p9xoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-21p9xoz","updated":"20240519104235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    唯有知道病從何來，然後加以斷絕病源，這樣才可以做到真正的預防醫學，像我們可以確知長期吃檳榔會得到口腔癌，如果民眾不戒除這個壞習慣，那口腔癌就無法預防，對不對？現在西醫根本就不知道許多的癌症是怎麼得到的？那要如何去談預防癌症呢？過度的篩檢就是將潘朵拉的盒子打開，只會讓癌症加速擴散，讓人更不開心，當然就死得更快啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104235-2k26i5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104235-2k26i5v","updated":"20240519104235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月25日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104236-9q7ld8v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104236-9q7ld8v"}},{"ID":"20240519104319-6k2r4bv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-6k2r4bv","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"澳洲研發結核病新藥 號稱50年來最大突破"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-eftks3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-eftks3i","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/25 01:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"張曉雯"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-jkb68b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-jkb68b1","updated":"20240519104322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社雪梨24日電） 澳洲科學家今天表示，他們發現一種藥物，可以在結核病還不具傳染性的階段就將其治癒，這可能是50年來在結核病治療上的第一個重大突破。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-jktt0ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-jktt0ll","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細菌學家威斯特（Nick West）說，澳洲雪梨百年研究所（Centenary Institute）的研究員研發出一種藥物，可在病情惡化前根治結核病，可能在全球拯救數以百萬計的生命。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-peuncuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-peuncuf","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"威斯特說：「我們鑽研結核病菌生存所需的一種蛋白質，並且在研發可抑制這種蛋白質的藥物上獲得一些成果。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-t5vvrgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-t5vvrgd","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「我們未來幾個月的目標，是要探討這種新藥可能的完全療效。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-r1he0yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-r1he0yk","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"威斯特表示，這將是有史以來首次可以治療還在潛伏期、還沒有症狀與還不具傳染性的結核病，可能可以阻止致命的傳染潮。結核病每年奪走200萬人的性命。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-10bt3m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-10bt3m7","updated":"20240519104326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他解釋：「不幸的是，我們用來對抗結核病的抗生素，對潛伏性結核病（Latent TB）卻沒有效，只能用於開放性結核病。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(沒有新藥時，就不會這樣說。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-n4ru0lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-n4ru0lr","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「這是個嚴重的問題，因為潛伏性結核病患有1/10會發展成開放性結核病，會出現病症而且具傳染性。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-jh8y36u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-jh8y36u","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"威斯特又說：「如果能找到在潛伏期時治療結核病的方法，我們可以拯救全球數以百萬計的生命。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-0i9446b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-0i9446b","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雪梨大學（University of Sydney）附屬的百年研究所指出，如果新藥研發成功，這會是1962年以來第一個治療結核病的新療法。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-up99qxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-up99qxk","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"估計全球有1/3的人口，也就是相當於20億人，會感染到結核病，而結核病在東南亞蔓延的情況最嚴重。（譯者：中央社張曉雯）"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-1ttxtvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-1ttxtvn","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-2lvima2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-2lvima2","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   治療肺結核的西藥是非常之毒的藥物，有許多人吃了以後不出一個月就出現肝臟衰竭，結果原先的肺結核還在，現在又要面對換肝一途，真是兩難啊。中醫藥早就有解決肺結核的方法了，花費既經濟又沒有副作用存在，這些好藥因為國人只相信西醫藥而被拋棄，想想難道國外的月亮真的特別圓嗎？如果上述報導是真的，我絕對替病人高興，但是我相信這類藥物的副作用，遠超過它帶來的療效，病人又要得不償失了，如果讀者得到肺結核的話，我建議你還是找中醫來治療吧？"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-2yy7l1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-2yy7l1j","updated":"20240519104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月26日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104319-2e8ajpm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104319-2e8ajpm"}},{"ID":"20240519104333-27jwkyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-27jwkyp","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"砒霜製藥可治癌　逾百血癌病人康復"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-2hdcv7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-2hdcv7i","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/25 13:35"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-nvsepgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-nvsepgr","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吞砒霜不再是嫌命長，而是可以保命，香港大學醫學院成功把口服砒霜，研發成處方藥物，超過100名血癌病人服用及接受治療後，已經康復。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-0q7uiiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-0q7uiiw","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"港大醫學院表示，適當份量砒霜的潛在毒性，可被解除，服用後對心臟的副作用，可以大大減低。除血癌外，也可用於治療淋巴癌等其他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/cure2.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"癌症","TextMarkTextContent":"癌症"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-yn23doh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-yn23doh","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"港大已為口服砒霜，取得「美國國家專利」，校方正研究為發展中國家病人，提供免費口服砒霜。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-9tiu0n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-9tiu0n5","updated":"20240519104343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-oi5xf1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-oi5xf1h","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    使用砒霜來治療血癌，可以讓病人痊癒，我絕對相信有這種效果，因為過去我使用生附子來治療血癌，效果也是十分驚人的，生附跟砒霜都是很毒的中藥，唯砒霜更毒於生附，使用上必須要非常的小心，這些最好的醫學研究，一般都只發生在海外，台灣的醫學中心是絕對不會去做這類的研究，因為都是西醫的天下。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104333-7fl4zie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104333-7fl4zie","updated":"20240519104333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月25日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104343-wqapftw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104343-wqapftw"}},{"ID":"20240519104351-pq1cjb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-pq1cjb5","updated":"20240519104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"台灣褐藻翻身 可抗腫瘤改善發炎"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-6ibtqd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-6ibtqd2","updated":"20240519104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/26 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【基隆訊】"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-7o50vpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-7o50vpe","updated":"20240519104402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經過長期研究，經濟部生物技術與醫藥工業發展推動小組昨天表示，原被視為廢棄物的台灣褐藻醣膠（Fucoidan）可抗腫瘤及調節發炎，具加值開發經濟價值，可望萃取成抗腫瘤新藥。經濟部生醫小組今天將在北市發表這項研究。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(中醫藥裡早就論及海藻是鹹味，而鹹能軟堅，這裡的堅就是腫瘤的意思。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-vdijnvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-vdijnvx","updated":"20240519104406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"農委會水產試驗所黃培安博士表示，台灣海域蘊藏豐富的褐藻資源，經動物實驗發現具有抗癌及抗發炎的效果，且安定性佳，深具草本保健食品或生醫產品發展潛力。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我輩中醫早就用之千年，他們現在才知道。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-ksvypkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-ksvypkm","updated":"20240519104409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃培安指出，日本及韓國等緯度的褐藻常被製成海帶、裙帶菜等，是很普遍的食物。不過台灣沿岸的褐藻因口感不佳，過去被視為廢棄物乏人問津，多用於動物飼料。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真是因為不懂啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-6gnvzov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-6gnvzov","updated":"20240519104411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但萃取後的台灣褐藻醣膠在細胞及動物實驗中發現有抗發炎、抗腫瘤效果，其中細胞實驗中只要24小時就能促進膠原蛋白合成，是極佳的外用敷料。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(海藻真好，對不對？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-lfrsrwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-lfrsrwi","updated":"20240519104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"農委會藥物毒物試驗所也在褐藻粗萃物中發現有抑制肝癌及肺癌的功效性。(就是可以對抗癌症，對不對？)"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-gzifhrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-gzifhrj","updated":"20240519104356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經濟部生醫推動小組表示，台灣褐藻醣膠不但對腫瘤細胞具有抑制作用，同時對於調節發炎反應、改善肝機能代謝、外敷傷口癒合等生理機能促進，有一定功效，具有人類、寵物生藥及保健領域的發展潛力。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-t2jqnew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-t2jqnew","updated":"20240519104415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃培安指出，許多民眾對動物性的敷料及保養品產生過敏反應，加上素食風潮愈來愈盛，台灣褐藻的草本特性，具有食品、保健食品、健康食品，甚至生醫產品的發展潛力，未來運用層面相當多元化。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(海藻超完美的，對不對？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-1omkiy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-1omkiy7","updated":"20240519104354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-x1oym5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-x1oym5q","updated":"20240519104421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    當西醫在使用控制性的藥物在控制甲狀腺亢進的病人時，都不會忘記提醒病人，不要吃海帶與海藻，因為會破壞藥物的療效，這說明了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"西醫師是寧可病人去吃藥，也不要病人去吃食物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，這類幾近於笑話的治療方式，居然還被政府所接受，當中醫說海藻可以用來治療癌症時，政府跟民眾還說中醫不科學，而當政府官員或是西藥廠說海藻可以抗癌，可以用於外敷來幫助收斂傷口時，大家就會去相信，這是不信任中醫的證據。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-fivsaw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-fivsaw5","updated":"20240519104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     我的臨床經驗告訴我，海藻還有許多功能存在，以後有機會我再替大家說明。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104351-rymv04g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104351-rymv04g","updated":"20240519104351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月29日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104352-u1ck2hp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104352-u1ck2hp"}},{"ID":"20240519104458-9h1sz2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-9h1sz2i","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"近1/3的乳癌是可以預防的 少吃多動是關鍵"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-mygr4gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-mygr4gk","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/26 11:05"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-e6tpmn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-e6tpmn3","updated":"20240519104507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每三個乳癌案例中，可能有一個是可以避免的，要降低罹患乳癌的風險，少吃多動是關鍵。（夏明珠報導）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(應該說是每三個乳癌病人中，有一位是不需要任何治療的，因為是無害的乳癌。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-ubek1rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-ubek1rq","updated":"20240519104509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫療科技日新月異，早期發現，更好的治療，大幅提升了乳癌患者的存活機會，但是在疾病防治上，預防勝於治療，是永遠不變的最高指導原則，專家主張，在乳癌防治宣導上，也應該把重點放在提倡改變生活習慣上。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(應該說是要改變食品政策才對，比方說不准許飼養乳牛的農夫們，使用女性荷爾蒙來餵食乳牛，違反者要殺頭等。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-v3s1a81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-v3s1a81","updated":"20240519104512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在西班牙召開的歐洲乳癌醫學會上，米蘭大學的流行病學專家列舉國際癌症研究署的數字，指出如果女性可以讓自己維持苗條一點，運動多一點，兩成五到三成的乳癌，是可以避免的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(其實只要少用西藥與維他命就可以避免許多婦女們得到乳癌了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-98386rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-98386rd","updated":"20240519104513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這個說法和近年來許多研究結論一致，那就是改變生活習慣，比方說戒菸、健康飲食、運動以及適度的曬太陽，有助於降低罹患多種癌症的風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(還要增加最重要的一項，就是不吃西藥與維他命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-vmi118l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-vmi118l","updated":"20240519104515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"專門研究生活習慣對癌症影響的哈佛大學教授霍姆斯說，很多人以為癌症和遺傳比較有關係，其實這是錯誤的，你只要想想看，人類基因從有人類以來就有，可是癌症罹患率卻不斷在改變，癌症和基因的關連或許有，但是它的影響絕對低於生活型態的改變。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這篇報導中只有這段有關基因的論述是正確的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-0eupo7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-0eupo7s","updated":"20240519104517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乳癌是婦女最常見癌症，許多種類的乳癌，都和脂肪組織生成的雌激素有關，事實上，不只乳癌，肥胖女性罹患所有癌症的風險，都會比體重正常的女性提高將近六成。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是說明女性荷爾蒙是會致癌的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-mleictf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-mleictf","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-a872gk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-a872gk1","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這篇報導中說明西藥廠又在使用聲東擊西的作戰方式，想混搖視聽，讓民眾誤以為會得到癌症是自己的錯，是自己的生活習慣不好導致的。其實真正會讓民眾得到癌症的主因是因為人們過去濫用西藥與維他命的報應，以台灣為例，台灣多年來不斷的使用抗生素與維他命還有激素等，無論是人還是畜，都在濫用它們，現在甚至於在水溝中抽取一點水，都可以化驗出有激素成份存在，真是十分可怕。唯一可以解決的方式就是立法來嚴肅的管理西藥的使用，限制西藥廠的不實廣告，鼓勵民眾多多吃中藥，這才是好的有用的醫療政策。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-sx3j3vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-sx3j3vw","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   比方說現在台灣人得到多發性骨髓瘤的人數不斷上升，主要原因就是大家都在吃害人的各種鈣片與補軟骨的藥，這些補藥不但沒有補到骨質，反而去補到癌細胞，於是出現多發性骨髓瘤。多年來台灣到處都在賣宣稱能保護肝臟的藥物，結果台灣卻是世界排名第一的肝癌之島，這些藥如果有用的話，為何肝癌的死亡人數卻逐年上升呢？當官的應該好好思考思考了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-niytpxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-niytpxj","updated":"20240519104458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月29日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104458-2nbkb5m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104458-2nbkb5m"}},{"ID":"20240519104524-e3pb7eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-e3pb7eq","updated":"20240519104524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2009藥物排行 癌症、三高佔最多"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-ywkg64e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-ywkg64e","updated":"20240519104524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/27 17:35"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-8lacrtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-8lacrtr","updated":"20240519104531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"長年來，癌症蟬連國人十大死因第一名，在國人用藥上也有明顯數據，寰宇藥品（IMS）公布2009年台灣銷售藥物排行榜統計，前20名中，癌症用藥明顯上升，首次與高血壓、高血脂等三高藥物平起平坐，各有六項擠入排行榜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣人真是沒有警覺心，癌症藥物的使用逐年上升，就表示得到癌症人數在逐年成長中，而三高用藥卻也是致癌藥物的其中之一。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-b0wq4ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-b0wq4ca","updated":"20240519104534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去年銷售第一名的是高血壓用藥「脈優」，這項藥品在排行榜中暢銷多年。其次是治療慢性骨髓性白血病的「基力克」，從前年的第四名，躍升到亞軍。降血脂的立普妥排名第三。而銷售成長率成長最多的是「賀癌平」，用於治療乳癌，也從前年第16名，爬升到第7名，銷售金額的年成長率高達33.8%。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這三種藥物不但無法治病，反而讓人容易生病還有失去記憶。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-7g0valh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-7g0valh","updated":"20240519104536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這項排行榜的藥物品項包括健保給付、民眾自費等兩大部分，比健保局日前公布的健保用藥順位資料，更符合國內藥物市場的現況。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(健保局在幫助西藥廠賺錢中。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-xdt1ddh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-xdt1ddh","updated":"20240519104524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-2e0jws5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-2e0jws5","updated":"20240519104524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    西藥廠建立的健康標準是有目的的，其真正的目的就是要民眾長期吃西藥，這樣它們才能大賺黑心錢，比方說高血壓吧，許多人吃降血壓藥物其結果比不吃降血壓藥物的人，還更容易得到中風，也就是說越嚴格控制血壓的人，就越容易得到中風。西醫學說血醣如果不控制，就會引起心臟病，而事實上卻正好相反，也就是說越嚴格控制血糖的人，卻越容易得到心臟病，這些都還其次，西醫學不知道心臟有問題的人，就是最容易得到癌症的人，而許多西藥本身就會造成心臟受損，像是西醫使用於治療癌症的化學治療藥物，本身就會造成心臟受損，而心臟受損就會造成癌症，這種極為矛盾的治療方式之所以會出現，就是因為西醫學本身根本就不知道癌症的起因為何？而此時西藥廠就使用基因的問題來混淆視聽，用基因學來掩護它們對於癌症的無知，孔子云 : 知之為知之，不知為不知，是知也。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-w8faow6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-w8faow6","updated":"20240519104524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月29日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104524-bo6qira","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104524-bo6qira"}},{"ID":"20240519104544-cqvabym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-cqvabym","updated":"20240519104544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英學者：藥廠為賣藥發明病"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-rauw7mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-rauw7mc","updated":"20240519104544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/29 19:35"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-hbubrou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-hbubrou","updated":"20240519104553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國學者說，藥廠為了賣藥賺錢「發明」不少病，讓消費者沒事花錢買藥吃。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位學者真勇敢，敢說實話，但是民眾多數是笨蛋，他們會聽信嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-xpgdutl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-xpgdutl","updated":"20240519104555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國「艾塞克斯」大學「布絲斐」教授說，據他統計，英國健保局一天就要花兩千兩百萬英鎊，大約十一億台幣買處方藥，比十年前增加了六成。濫開最嚴重的是過動和高膽固醇藥。很多醫生明明知道，不少老師、家長拿抑制過動的藥給孩子，為的是要孩子聽話，別搗蛋。完全忽略了藥物的副作用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣民眾，你們聽到了嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-tv93box","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-tv93box","updated":"20240519104557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他說，藥廠為了把藥賣出去，常常過份渲染婦女性功能失調以及孩子過動的病情，讓病人不敢不吃藥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我早就發現西藥廠的黑心手段。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-d69tjd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-d69tjd5","updated":"20240519104559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其實有很多病沒有藥廠說的那麼嚴重，不吃藥也會好。只是藥廠就得關門了，於是，他們常派業務去看醫生，送些小禮物拉攏感情。再加上，病人也覺得看醫生不拿點藥回家很虧。結果醫生樂得開藥給病人，讓藥廠、病人跟自己都高興。結果是英國國民傷了身體，政府的健保也虧損了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣的政府官員們，你們看到了嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-y2xltsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-y2xltsw","updated":"20240519104544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"惡質的西藥廠"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-lew5jsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-lew5jsm","updated":"20240519104544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    上篇報導的內容，對我而言是不足為奇的，我是司空見慣了，其實這些還只是西藥廠使用的一些小手段而已，真正最厲害的就是只要每年利用一次流感大流行來欺騙民眾，只要人民被嚇到，該地的政府就會受制於西藥廠，任由西藥廠的擺佈，無視於人民的死活，真正受害的還是老百姓，有關於西藥廠所使用的惡劣手段，真是罄竹難書。總之西藥廠這個惡魔如果不消滅，人類必將永無寧日。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-kifr7hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-kifr7hr","updated":"20240519104544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月29日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104544-cn29bjd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104544-cn29bjd"}},{"ID":"20240519104607-gj163w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-gj163w4","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究：服用預防性抗生素　可降低AIDS死亡率"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-xpqicvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-xpqicvr","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/29 12:50 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"蔡佳敏"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-9q4zn6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-9q4zn6h","updated":"20240519104623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社巴黎29日電） 今天刊出的研究指出，預防性地使用一種廉價、常見處方抗生素，可大幅降低免疫系統遭後天免疫不全症後群（AIDS）病毒損害的非洲病患的死亡率。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真是在胡說八道，西藥廠又想騙人去買只會害人生病的抗生素來吃。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-r7rklng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-r7rklng","updated":"20240519104624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　以Septrim、Bactrim等品牌販賣的撲菌特錠（co-trimoxazole），廣泛被用來治療肺炎以及耳朵、尿道感染，且被發現含些許抗瘧疾功能。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(問題是這些病並沒有被這些藥治好啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-ukxd04d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-ukxd04d","updated":"20240519104614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　這項調查包含3179名烏干達以及辛巴威人。受訪者都開始了「抗逆轉錄病毒療法」（ART），且CD4免疫細胞數量每微升都低於200。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-gumfm9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-gumfm9h","updated":"20240519104627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　服用抗HIV藥物和撲菌特錠的病患，前3個月病死的風險較沒有服用抗生素的病患，降低了59%。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西藥廠最會玩數字遊戲，利用假數據來騙人。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-dv2zmf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-dv2zmf3","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　到了72週階段，死亡率風險的減低依然存在，不過整體穩定在35%。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-5v8n1h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-5v8n1h2","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　此外，撲菌特錠能把患瘧疾的頻率降低26%。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-g8rtutd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-g8rtutd","updated":"20240519104631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　報告表示，這些好處與極低的副作用，表示非洲的醫師可在HIV（愛滋病毒）早期治療階段，同時開撲菌特錠。這份報告刊在「刺胳針」（The Lancet）網路版。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西藥廠自己製造的疾病，現在自己在解決，又想再利用它來賺錢，真是壞透了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-ps2jpg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-ps2jpg1","updated":"20240519104634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　HIV侵入、摧毀免疫系統主要細胞，奠定罹患後天性免疫不全症候群的基礎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是西藥廠製造出來的HIV問題，原本只在非洲綠猴仔的腎臟中才有的無害SIV病毒，結果因為西藥廠利用非洲綠猴仔的腎臟來製作小兒痲痺疫苗，而讓這些SIV病毒才進入人體，於是又再製造一病名為HIV，既可以再賣藥，又可以擺脫其植入人體的罪名。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-n6d3t21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-n6d3t21","updated":"20240519104639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　聯合國愛滋防治計畫（UNAIDS）去年11月估計，至2008年底，撒哈拉以南的非洲大陸有2240萬人有HIV或AIDS，佔全球3340萬名病患的2/3。（譯者：中央社蔡佳敏）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者知道為何都集中在非洲嗎？因為非洲是西藥廠在世界上所能得到最大的疫苗研發地啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-sz0di49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-sz0di49","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"惡質的西藥廠"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-2oqdcyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-2oqdcyc","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   每次看到這類關於AIDS的報導，我就無法克制的感到一陣噁心，西藥廠非常不要臉，它們在非洲這個貧窮之地，利用當地人民的無知與政客的貪瀆，來做其藥物實驗的基地還有製造出許多疫苗來賺錢，最早在這裡研發小兒痲痺疫苗時，是採用非洲綠猴仔的腎臟來做原料，而當時西藥廠並不知道有SIV的存在，於是這些SIV病毒就隨著小兒痲痺疫苗而進入人體，若干年後西藥廠發現這個缺失，此時已經太晚而無法做彌補動作了，而這些SIV病毒對猴子跟人體原本是不會有任何影響的，哪知道這個惡魔西藥廠卻不如此想，它們硬將這SIV病毒說成是HIV病毒，而且是有害於人，於是一場腥風血雨的病毒大戰又上演了，西藥廠扮演著保護人類的超人般的腳色，這些根本無害的病毒被西藥廠宣染成好像不將之殺死的話，明天就是世界末日一般的可怕，而且將之栽贓於同性戀上，事實上AIDS是來自吸食毒品的副作用，與HIV跟同性戀是無關的，但是西藥廠知道如果這樣說的話，人人不擔心AIDS必將無利可圖，於是就將HIV與AIDS扯在一起，使用這種勾當來誇大病情的危害力量，這樣才有藉口去研發更強的抗病毒藥物，這種欺騙詐財的伎倆一直是被西藥廠拿來使用的，它們毫不羞澀的拿取這些黑心錢，利用壓榨非洲貧民健康的方式，讓自己過著豪華奢侈的生活，真是不要臉到極點的西藥廠。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104607-evyhrfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104607-evyhrfl","updated":"20240519104607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月30日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104608-yoze20e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104608-yoze20e"}},{"ID":"20240519104648-m1o6d4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-m1o6d4h","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"降膽固醇藥傷肌 台灣44案"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-9sdl3z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-9sdl3z7","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/29 19:38"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-q7mn4a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-q7mn4a5","updated":"20240519104659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者陳清芳台北29日電）美國FDA指出，日服80毫克的降膽固醇藥「素果」，會增加肌肉損傷危險。台灣並未販售此劑量，不過，已有44件此類藥物的不良反應通報，衛生署呼籲醫師和病人要注意。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我們根本就不需要任何藥物來降低膽固醇，降低膽固醇的西藥是騙人錢財又害人成為老人癡呆症的爛藥。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-nkzl2mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-nkzl2mm","updated":"20240519104706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國食品藥物管理局（FDA）近期回顧素果（英文商品名為Zocor）的臨床試驗，發現與素果的較低劑量以及其他同成分藥物相較，每日服用80毫克會增加肌肉疼痛、橫紋肌溶解等肌肉損傷的風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種害人身體又耗費政府金錢的爛藥會被通過使用，就是西藥廠與政府在勾結造成的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-1qx9skt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-1qx9skt","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"銷售素果的台灣默沙東公司指出，台灣並沒有販售此一劑量的素果，病患在服用素果和其他同類的史他汀（statin）藥物時，都要注意肌肉疼痛的副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-znjfsb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-znjfsb5","updated":"20240519104709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衛生署食品藥物管理局指出，素果的成分為simvastatin，含此成分且在台灣取得藥品許可證的藥品共36張，用於治療高膽固醇血症、高三酸甘油酯血症，降低冠心病高危險群或冠心病患者的心血管事件發生率及冠心病致死率，以及患有異核質家族性高膽固醇血症的兒童病患。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些西藥的效果差中藥多多。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-zm5wmtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-zm5wmtb","updated":"20240519104711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在全國藥物不良反應通報資料中，衛生署接獲疑似使用simvastatin成分藥品導致肌肉疼痛案件共44件，大部分屬於肌肉痛、背痛、無力、虛弱等，停藥後症狀均緩解。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這四種肌肉痛、背痛、無力、虛弱等就是中醫所謂的陽虛，如果陽虛不處理，未來就是陰實，所謂陰實就是指腫瘤。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-t49841r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-t49841r","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衛生署食品藥物管理局表示，會加強藥品安全監視，密切注意美國進一步評估結果。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-v75ivdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-v75ivdz","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"惡質的西藥廠"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-gwnlmu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-gwnlmu4","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    直到目前為止，連西醫界都分成二派，一直非常具有爭議性的議題就是壞固醇到底是否會引發心臟病？當大家尚未有正確的結論時，西藥廠已經因為誇大膽固醇的高危險性，賣藥而賺進大把的鈔票，現在市面上使用來降低膽固醇的藥物像Lipitor，最有名的副作用就是造成服用人短期記憶喪失，這還是很保守的說法，其實這種西藥何止是傷害記憶而已，它還傷害肝臟與腎臟，上篇報導中的Zocor是另外一種降低膽固醇的藥物，光是看它造成肌肉痛、背痛、無力、虛弱等四個症狀，就可以知道它會傷害人體中的陽與陰，而造成陽虛，陽虛如果不趕快治好，將來就很容易得到陰實的症狀，所謂陰實，就是癌症了，真是未受其利而先受其害。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-z9gllfo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-z9gllfo","updated":"20240519104715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 讓人出現性功能障礙、小便失禁、失智等問題，元兇就是出自西藥廠製造的這種魔藥了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-l9skqsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-l9skqsx","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這種不必要的藥物，既害人又傷財，早該下架了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104648-nyncb79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104648-nyncb79","updated":"20240519104648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月30日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104652-2eal2t6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104652-2eal2t6"}},{"ID":"20240519104721-m6hn0el","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-m6hn0el","updated":"20240519104721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腫瘤堵肛門 滿肚大便爆腸"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-2j3shlh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-2j3shlh","updated":"20240519104721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者蘇孟娟／台中報導   更新日期:2010/03/30 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-4uaavtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-4uaavtd","updated":"20240519104730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1名72歲老翁罹患直腸癌不自知，直到已6公分大的腫瘤堵住直腸腔，讓老翁長達1周大便解不出來，大便脹破腸壁引起腹膜炎，緊急開刀才救回一命，但老翁的直腸癌已轉移到肝臟，未來必須持續接受化療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人進入這種治療，而且已經移轉成肝癌，其結果必死。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-x4jssch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-x4jssch","updated":"20240519104732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一周大便解不出來"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是大承氣湯症，服後如果仍不出，可以用走馬湯。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-3p1t8qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-3p1t8qk","updated":"20240519104734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澄清醫院中港院區大腸直腸外科主治醫師邱錫雄指出，老翁是獨居老人，沒有家人照顧，雖有便秘的老毛病，但不以為意，直到近日因腹痛到醫院看腸胃內科，原以為只要吃個胃藥就可以了，但醫師診斷發現老人的腹痛有異，立即會診大腸直腸外科，照X光後，赫然發現老人腹部「白茫茫一片」，是腸子破裂空氣跑進去所致，緊急安排手術。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人早先就該找中醫來治療，會太慢就是因為不信中醫。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-hjtfi4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-hjtfi4k","updated":"20240519104736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不料，手術一切開老人腹部，竟有糞便像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/cancer134.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"土石流","TextMarkTextContent":"土石流"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"般不斷流出，赫然發現老人的升結腸出現3公分大的破洞，經檢查後，在肛門口附近的直腸部位，發現一顆約6公分大的腫瘤，且癌細胞已轉移到肝臟。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(開刀醫師真偉大，讀者知道有多臭嗎？這就是有便秘時，不立刻找中醫來治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-5v1qtpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-5v1qtpi","updated":"20240519104739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱錫雄說，手術切除老人右半側破裂的大腸及直腸腫瘤，並施作人工肛門，經1個月住院照顧，老人已出院返家，但因癌細胞已轉移，未來須接受化療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(大腸破裂後找中醫就已經太遲，必須要找西醫開刀了，開完刀後如果找中醫 治療，還可以活得久些，繼續化療只有加速死亡路一條。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-ff72f5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-ff72f5e","updated":"20240519104740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱錫雄說，老人不知道患有直腸癌，也未覺得腹部有特別不適，近來排便愈來愈細，這次雖突然無法排便，但因有便秘老毛病，直到腹痛難忍才就醫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(有便秘的老毛病時，就該去看中醫了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-3m9b4t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-3m9b4t7","updated":"20240519104743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱錫雄說，老人的腫瘤堵住直腸腔，導致糞便無法排出，新糞便又不斷形成，「只進不出」的情況，讓老人的大腸脹粗，結果就在大腸壁最薄處爆破，這名老人的腸爆處位於升結腸，一爆破累積的糞便就像輪胎充氣過滿爆胎般，形成「一肚子大便」情況，幸好老人及時就醫，若再隱忍可能會出現敗血症。 邱錫雄說，直腸癌初期確實沒有症狀，除非是堵住腸腔，病人才會開始發現異狀，老人的腫癌已有6公分大小，應已罹癌1年多，因未能早期發現及治療，導致轉移。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(就算肛門有腫瘤，中藥都有辦法治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-f90p3fa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-f90p3fa","updated":"20240519104746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱錫雄提醒民眾，如有大便習慣改變、血便、長期便秘或大便變細，一定要趁早進一步檢查。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(還是給中醫治療吧，不用再檢查了，檢查完後還是便秘。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-wc4tp0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-wc4tp0k","updated":"20240519104725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-mqkqqxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-mqkqqxa","updated":"20240519104721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   民眾請在發現你有便秘時，就立刻找中醫來治療，當然要找正統中醫來治療才是，在肛門出現有腫瘤時，也請立刻找正統中醫來治療，這些時候都是很容易治療的時機，千萬不可以去開刀，一但開刀後癌症移轉進入肝臟後，此時你再找中醫來治療時，就為時已晚，請不要忽略你的便秘習慣。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-6de9bjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-6de9bjb","updated":"20240519104721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    每次一想到西醫治療大腸癌的霸道方式，我就一肚子大便，大腸在中醫理論中是屬於陽明病，陽明無死症，而今這陽明症給西醫治療後就變成厥陰症的死症，所以我說大腸癌的病人是被西醫治死的，不是死於大腸癌的。自己覺得人生乏味的人請注意，有任何大小病就請找西醫治療，我保證哪一天你必然死於非命的。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104721-92hbwac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104721-92hbwac","updated":"20240519104721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年03月31日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104722-cuyrd8y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104722-cuyrd8y"}},{"ID":"20240519104754-4tgz9de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-4tgz9de","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不止漲保費 督保盟：健保病床也要增"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-4x2ubpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-4x2ubpy","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/03/31 15:59"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-i5kqt66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-i5kqt66","updated":"20240519104806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者陳麗婷台北31日電）健保費明天調漲，督保盟今天質疑民眾能得到更好的醫療品質嗎？有鑑很多醫院的健保特約病床比例都達不到標準，呼籲修法提高醫院裡的健保病床比例。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣的健保法是惡法，唯一得利者就是西藥廠。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-9he5zd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-9he5zd3","updated":"20240519104807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"民間監督健保聯盟發言人滕西華表示，掛不到號、等不到床是許多民眾共同的經驗，民意代表一天到晚最多的選民服務就是「喬病床」。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果發陽的醫學是正確的，人人都沒病，為何還需要病床呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-z0clv90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-z0clv90","updated":"20240519104810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"依據全民健保醫事服務機構特約及管理辦法規定，特約醫院保險病房的病床數，醫學中心公立醫院應占總病床數的65%以上，私立醫院應佔50%以上，但對照健保局公布的98年各醫院健保床特約率，台大醫院竟連基本的保險特約床都不足額，只占59.55%。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(醫院如果都是健保床，我保證通通會關門大吉。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-zcjo4a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-zcjo4a7","updated":"20240519104812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她說新光醫院、奇美醫院也剛好在50%合格邊緣低空略過，林口長庚醫院則占58.21%，中山附醫則為53.07%，其餘都是差額或自費病床，難怪病人永遠等不到健保病床。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(等得到健保病床是痴人說夢。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-7p9tryf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-7p9tryf","updated":"20240519104813"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滕西華說，以97年底全台醫學中心急性病床平均特約率為61.47%，醫學中心從病房差額到自費床，年獲利至少新台幣27億到117億元，區域醫院急性病床特約率即便達73%，保守估計1年獲利15億元到58億元不等。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我們只需要急診病床，一般病床都可以刪除。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-bv4t4pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-bv4t4pq","updated":"20240519104816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以台大為例，滕西華說，只要是自付差額、自費高級病房等，每100床年獲利就可以達到2億9200萬元，只能說醫院真的「賺很大」，罰再多也不怕。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣提倡西醫學，將來必然跟美國一樣禍延子孫，國家的經濟將被健保拖垮。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-mqfgxd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-mqfgxd5","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滕西華以義大附醫為例，健保病床率達70%，全年獲利還是有2億多元，她認為，醫院健保床不足額，不能只是罰款了事。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-nmiaimm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-nmiaimm","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同時要求衛生署、健保局應立即修正相關法規，提高公立醫學中心應從現行65%提高到85%，私立醫學中心由50%提高到70%，違者應公布並調降醫院評鑑等級，別再讓健保病人「等無床」。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-rlxb5mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-rlxb5mz","updated":"20240519104758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-8910b6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-8910b6d","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    台灣因為相信西醫學，所以健保法是一致的傾向保護西醫藥，這種花錢的方式，遲早有一天會拖垮台灣的經濟，如果說這樣花錢就可以保障台灣人民都有健康的身體的話，還可以說得過去，問題是現在所有的指標都一致的指向台灣人越來越短命，像台灣是世界第一的肝癌之島，世界第一的洗腎之島，這些已經存在的事實就是絕對證據，證明了台灣醫學已經走錯方向，而當官的還是執迷不悟，還是認為西醫學是正確的，這條路遲早走完，而台灣人付出的代價將無法彌補了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104754-y9d5ykn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104754-y9d5ykn","updated":"20240519104754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月01日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104755-x0zelar","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104755-x0zelar"}},{"ID":"20240519104849-6m28b2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-6m28b2v","updated":"20240519104849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"半夜狂飆車不自知！　安眠藥導致夢遊"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-62mguly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-62mguly","updated":"20240519104849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/01 14:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"生活中心／高雄報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-mfioeou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-mfioeou","updated":"20240519104906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夜飆車已經夠危險了，如果是吃了安眠藥後夢遊飆車那就更恐怖了。屏東一名中年男子吃了目前常用的使蒂諾斯(Stilnox)安眠藥後，根本不知道自己出門飆車，直到收到罰單才發現。而有人則是吃了後狂打電話或去運動，醫生提醒要吃這種藥最好小心。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(醫師說出這種提醒的話，根本就是廢話，唯一解決方法就是使用中藥來將失眠治好。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-4vupsrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-4vupsrm","updated":"20240519104855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屏東一名50多歲的陳姓男子日前在路上瘋狂行駛，而且一路沒事，回家後還把車子停得好好的，離譜的是他完全不知道做過如此瘋狂的事，連收到高額罰單時還覺得莫名其妙，因為飆車當時他才剛吃下了使蒂諾斯的安眠藥，他以為他應該是安穩的睡在床上，沒想到卻是夢遊去飆車。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(所以我ㄧ直在說，西藥廠是製造惡魔般藥物的工廠。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-4hmkcmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-4hmkcmx","updated":"20240519104857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"對此，義大醫院睡眠中心主任許世斌表示：「特別當你吃的劑量比較大，像有些人喜歡吃多顆，2顆、3顆，或者你合併酒精，你吃了大腦皮質馬上進入睡眠狀態，但是它的運動神經並沒有馬上被抑制下來，因此他就會有這些不自主的活動產生。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者認為是失眠比較好些？還是夢遊比較好些？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-1mgbchw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-1mgbchw","updated":"20240519104901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使蒂諾斯和酣樂欣(Halcion)等安眠藥，和傳統性安眠藥比起來比較不會上癮，隔天也不會昏沈沈的，但是缺點就是會造成短暫失憶或是夢遊，所以吃下安眠藥後，就可能出現飆車、去運動、狂打電話，或是大吃大喝。由於患者吃下藥後15分鐘就可能出現夢遊行為，所以一吃下就要馬上去睡覺，而且家人也要特別注意患者吃藥後有沒有異常行為，免得因為夢遊而出了意外。(新聞來源：東森新聞記者吳建毅)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這不是魔藥還是什麼呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-ywlxvsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-ywlxvsn","updated":"20240519104849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"超惡質的西藥廠"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-pi5p9md","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-pi5p9md","updated":"20240519104918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    只是為了一個最簡單治療的失眠症，結果卻使用西藥廠製造的會讓人夢遊的魔藥，如此做的結果就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"失眠的人沒有死於失眠，而是死於意外車禍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，請問這種藥是誰通過讓它可以合法上市使用的呢？出了問題又是誰該負責任呢？如果有法律規定，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃藥物後產生的副作用遠比原來生的病還要嚴重時"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，西藥廠就要負擔全部賠償責任，我告訴讀者，一但出現這種法律的話，幾乎所有西藥都得下架，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"市面上會有這種類似讓人成為惡魔般的魔藥，就是一群昏官沒有好好替人民健康把關，才造成這種爛藥還可以上市賣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104849-3hvymv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104849-3hvymv1","updated":"20240519104849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月02日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104850-l1y7f0e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104850-l1y7f0e"}},{"ID":"20240519104923-czt1k4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-czt1k4r","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"女性工作暴露於化學物質下　乳癌風險為3倍"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-ezy6tw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-ezy6tw4","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/01 14:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"張稚昀"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-ef4nu30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-ef4nu30","updated":"20240519104929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社巴黎1日電） 一份研究加拿大病患的報告今天表示，36歲以下女性的工作場合，若暴露於合成纖維和特定石油加工產品中，將造成她們在更年期後罹患乳癌的機率為一般女性的3倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-s6b89wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-s6b89wl","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加拿大蒙特婁國家公共衛生研究所（NationalInstitute of Public Health）的拉布雷奇（FranceLabreche）帶領研究團隊，對1169名年齡介於50至75歲的女性健康紀錄進行調查。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-zq2yge2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-zq2yge2","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比半數再少一點的女性，在1996至1997年間被診斷出於停經後罹患乳癌。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-me9ec60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-me9ec60","updated":"20240519104931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同一段時間裡，其他613名女性則被診斷出罹患其他癌症，並作為對照組。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-d96wkbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-d96wkbo","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一組化學家和產業衛生人員對某一範圍中的所有女性展開調查，她們在職業生涯中，曾暴露於約300種不同物質之下。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-dt9vqnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-dt9vqnh","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"過濾掉其他已知的乳癌誘發原因後，他們發現暴露於多種常見合成物和罹患乳癌的較高風險之間，有強烈的關係。這些物質存在於紡織工廠和其他工業場所。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-51rg4xq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-51rg4xq","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和非乳癌女性比起來，這個罹患乳癌的風險在36歲以前到達最高峰。胸部組織中持續活躍的細胞，被認為會對有害化學物質更敏感。（譯者：中央社張稚昀）"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-qhh6v8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-qhh6v8h","updated":"20240519104933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-khc7fbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-khc7fbb","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這本是眾所週知的事，猶記得黃醫師一直在提醒他已經得到乳癌的母親，不要去做頭髮美容等，因為擔心這些化學物質會加速乳癌的惡化，黃醫師絕對是正確的想法，但是愛美是女人的天性，沒有美，寧可死，這是女子終身必守的大原則，當一位婦女已經得到乳癌時，可想而知其心情必然落至谷底，如果再加上不能修飾外表，勢必加重鬱悶的情緒，這只會讓病情更加複雜難治，所以此時要做選擇時，我想讓婦女繼續尋求美髮美容，使得心情更開朗，應該會比禁止她去做頭髮來得好些，雖然這樣會讓病人身體曝露在這些化學物質之下，增加乳癌的風險，二者擇一的結果，我想還是心情開朗最為重要。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104923-7yilivx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104923-7yilivx","updated":"20240519104923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月03日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104924-2fhhfzz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104924-2fhhfzz"}},{"ID":"20240519104939-2sbto6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-2sbto6b","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究：午餐後喝咖啡減少糖尿病發機率"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-bsj5406","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-bsj5406","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/02 06:54"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-d3bpmab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-d3bpmab","updated":"20240519104946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者唐雅陵聖保羅1日專電）巴西聖保羅大學一項研究顯示，每天午餐後至少喝一杯125cc的咖啡，有助於減少2型糖尿病病發機率。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-0sxsrbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-0sxsrbm","updated":"20240519104945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究員沙托雷利（Daniela Sartorelli）使用法國從1990年起追蹤7萬名年齡41至72歲女性的一項研究資料，比較她們喝咖啡的量和糖尿病病發機率。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-0jjo81c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-0jjo81c","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她表示，已有其他研究指出咖啡可預防2型糖尿病，這項研究的差別在於指出飲用咖啡的時間。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-lreej0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-lreej0d","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究顯示，午餐後喝咖啡的女性發展出2型糖尿病的機率減少34%。在其他時段喝咖啡則未發現相同保護效益。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-grac1tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-grac1tl","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究期間，計有1425人發展出2型糖尿病，其中1051人未在午餐後飲用咖啡或飲用量低於125cc；其餘374人在午餐後至少喝125cc咖啡。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-bxzvnb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-bxzvnb8","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究還顯示，咖啡本身有沒有含咖啡因或加糖，均呈現相同防禦效益。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-ehyu2ep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-ehyu2ep","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究員指出，雖然這項研究只針對女性，但在男性身上有相同作用，因為其他有關喝咖啡可預防糖尿病的研究對象，男女都包括在內。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-1rrolm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-1rrolm6","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雖然仍在研究階段，沙托雷利認為喝咖啡可預防糖尿病的可能原因，是咖啡可減少人體吸收食物中可能引發糖尿病的鐵質。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-paynbyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-paynbyg","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其他有關喝咖啡減少糖尿病死亡率的研究還指出，咖啡內含有的物質除了可幫助改善人體對胰島素的敏感度與葡萄糖吸收能力，還能防止分泌胰島素的胰臟beta細胞產生氧化作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-kr6wi9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-kr6wi9z","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"超爛的研究"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-cioqh2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-cioqh2s","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我ㄧ看就知道這又是一群沒有良心的學者在替咖啡打廣告，巴西盛產咖啡，為了使咖啡能銷售到全世界，於是就想出這種點子，真是壞透了。我在美國臨床多年，眾所周知的就是美國人是天天在喝咖啡的民族，尤其午餐後是必喝一杯的，結果美國人得到二型糖尿病的人卻非常多，這些人每天都喝咖啡，結果卻還是得到糖尿病，這些就是絕對證據，證明了喝咖啡是不可能做到預防得到糖尿病的，完全沒有這種功效存在，只為了促銷咖啡，就可以讓一個大學的學術單位，說出昧著良心的話，真是不值啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104939-nbwpvs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104939-nbwpvs4","updated":"20240519104939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月02日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104940-6tha1ct","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104940-6tha1ct"}},{"ID":"20240519104952-dak14go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-dak14go","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"哺乳媽媽 易患乳房膿瘍"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-7lgtchk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-7lgtchk","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/02 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-awqg7xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-awqg7xd","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者林相美／台北報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-jq6v81m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-jq6v81m","updated":"20240519105000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫師觀察，台灣哺育母乳的媽媽乳房膿瘍的抗藥菌比例特高，5年前，乳腺炎患者中，僅15％為抗藥性的金黃色葡萄球菌，至民國97年已拉高為66％，有些媽媽甚至發燒到40度，變成敗血症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(造成這種情形是因為西醫不會治病，如果讓中醫來治療，怎會如此呢。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-ttmz42m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-ttmz42m","updated":"20240519105002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫師感嘆，現代社會推崇母乳，媽媽沒餵母乳，罪惡感重，單側乳房膿瘍，還堅持以另一側乳房餵乳。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(堅持餵母乳的婦女沒有錯，錯在西醫根本不會治療這種病，又強占著病人不讓中醫接手治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-h57r9kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-h57r9kh","updated":"20240519105005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台北市立聯合醫院婦幼院區乳房外科主任陳火木昨天指出，目前引發乳腺炎的病原不是傳統藥物可殺死的金黃色葡萄球菌，抗藥性病原菌已佔多數，若忽略治療，或未使用正確藥物，常會引發嚴重的乳房膿瘍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(病毒會出現抗藥性就是因為過去西醫爛用抗生素造成的，但是即使有抗藥性，中藥還是可以治療的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-2kdm1ef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-2kdm1ef","updated":"20240519105008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳火木今年2月在美國外科醫學雜誌發表一項研究指出，婦幼院區於97年收治129名乳腺炎患者，經細菌培養為抗藥性金黃色葡萄球菌者佔66％，此菌完全不怕傳統治療金黃色葡萄球菌的第一線藥物，有些患者因此病情急速惡化，甚至蔓延整個乳房充滿膿瘍，必須以手術切開引流、清創。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫不會治療這種病，所以才會利用開刀引流來清瘡，這給中醫治療起來不是十分困難的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-izzmgkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-izzmgkl","updated":"20240519105009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳火木說，台灣濫用抗生素嚴重，導致乳腺炎的抗藥菌比例升高，若以第一線藥物治療，仍可繼續哺乳，但若用到第二線藥物，必須暫停哺乳2至3週。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只有前段說出實話，給中醫治療就可以繼續餵乳。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-s1wua57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-s1wua57","updated":"20240519105012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳火木解釋，金黃色葡萄球菌無所不在，可能是手部觸摸到細菌，也可能是小孩的口腔內有病菌，若媽媽的乳頭有破皮、傷口，細菌又透過傷口進入乳房，造成乳腺炎，若忽略治療，或未使用正確藥物，常會引發嚴重的乳房膿瘍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(再嚴重的乳房膿瘍，都有中藥可以排膿，不需要吃抗生素。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-494b8s0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-494b8s0","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳火木表示，傳統治療乳腺炎與乳房膿瘍是停餵母乳，並以手術切開引流，但手術傷口大，常影響後續哺乳，婦幼院區改利用超音波引導反覆抽吸，輔以藥物，70％患者不需手術。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-ujx42uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-ujx42uq","updated":"20240519105015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳火木提醒，哺乳媽媽應留意乳頭是否有傷口，乳房若有紅腫不適，務必求診，若初步治療無效，也要懷疑抗藥菌種，改用正確藥物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此時應該找中醫來治療才對。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-3sg7lll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-3sg7lll","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-l7tm66m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-l7tm66m","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這篇報導是西醫說的，跟中醫無關，讀者從中就可以看出西醫學的無奈，這原本是非常容易治療的乳房膿瘍，給西醫弄得十分複雜，而且處理不當還會有後遺症，這後遺症就是乳癌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-zkfdjam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-zkfdjam","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  由於西醫不知乳癌從何來？所以根本無法做到預防乳癌的工作，婦女們如果濫用抗生素，這些抗生素不但無法治療乳房膿瘍，反而會傷到心臟，當心臟因濫用抗生素而受損時，乳房中的奶水就無法完全下達子宮，於是就會出現有過多的奶水停留在乳房中不去，這就是乳癌的成因，所以婦女們如果有乳房膿瘍的問題，妳去給西醫治療的結果，就是非常容易得到乳癌了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-i3akgmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-i3akgmq","updated":"20240519105022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"結論就是給西醫治療，不但乳房膿瘍沒好，還會被西醫從乳房膿瘍治成乳癌了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519104952-1cn01up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519104952-1cn01up","updated":"20240519104952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月03日"}]},{"ID":"20240519104953-3zo9j51","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519104953-3zo9j51"}},{"ID":"20240519105027-ktgas8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-ktgas8e","updated":"20240519105027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全球癌症病患將快速增加 嚴重威脅亞洲"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-7vokk9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-7vokk9q","updated":"20240519105027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/04 16:39"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-ly0q2jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-ly0q2jj","updated":"20240519105042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社台北4日電）第五屆亞太癌症預防組織大會3日在土耳其伊斯坦堡舉行，大會發表的「2010年癌症報告」警告說，今後20年世界癌症患者人數將呈快速上升趨勢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這個數據說明了現有的醫學是有問題的醫學，否則為何會如此呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-dd1yssw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-dd1yssw","updated":"20240519105044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"報告預測，從2008年至2030年，全球新增癌症患者將從每年的1240萬人增至2640萬人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(都是因為西醫學是主流醫學，才造成今天的局面。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-ihrrto2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-ihrrto2","updated":"20240519105048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新華社報導，美國、中國、日本、南韓、土耳其等70個國家的3000多名專家學者和政府官員，出席為期5天的大會，研討癌症對亞太國家的威脅以及預防措施。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(沒有用的，應該討論如何讓中醫介入癌症的治療，放棄西醫現有的治療才有可能做到減少癌症病人的人數。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-u5edso9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-u5edso9","updated":"20240519105052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"專家在報告中指出，由於開發中國家的醫療設施難以應對相關挑戰，因此開發中國家將繼續成為癌症高發地區，也是癌症死亡率較高的地區。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些地區也是正在提倡與發展西醫學的地區。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-81d4o83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-81d4o83","updated":"20240519105058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大會主席穆拉特．通切爾說，亞太地區患者佔全世界癌症患者總數的60%，主因是人口老齡化、肥胖問題、飲食習慣不良等，而吸菸是最重要的問題。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西藥廠又想將致癌的原因嫁禍給香菸公司，其實致癌的真正原因是來自西藥廠生產的各種維他命跟抗生素等，西藥廠使用這種聲東擊西的手段，讓自己脫罪，我是屢見不鮮的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-z4dsux8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-z4dsux8","updated":"20240519105100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"亞太癌症預防組織秘書長余永根表示，癌症已對亞洲構成嚴重的健康威脅。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人必是西醫出身，已經被西藥廠買通了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-oeggehv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-oeggehv","updated":"20240519105103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大會主辦國土耳其衛生部長阿克達指出，儘管土耳其採取措施加強檢查和治療，但癌症患者人數還在急劇上升。目前土耳其癌症患者約35萬人，平均每年新增癌症患者15萬人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只要不唾棄西醫學，就不可能減少得到癌症的人數。這個笨國家土耳其以為光靠加強檢查和治療，就可以做到減少得到癌症的人數，真是有夠蠢啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-zzeyryh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-zzeyryh","updated":"20240519105107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"與會的中國學者喬友林說，目前已開發國家的癌症患者人數正在下降，開發中國家的患者人數卻上升。中國平均每年約160萬人死於癌症，主要死於肺癌、肝癌和胃癌。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請問哪個已開發國家癌症死亡人數在下降？中國是已開發國家還是屬於開發中國家？此人講話糢糢糊湖的，讓人沒有頭緒。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-kboklk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-kboklk2","updated":"20240519105034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-ucc4nnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-ucc4nnd","updated":"20240519105033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這種報導根本是在作秀，完全無助於減緩每年得到癌症的人數，根本就是在替西藥廠脫罪，同時還幫西藥廠在打廣告，其中最後一段說到的肺癌、肝癌和胃癌，這是因為近年來大陸民眾生活開始富裕，於是改變了過去行之多年的生活習慣，人民開始喜歡吃快餐，喝可樂，喝咖啡，吃各種綜合維他命，感冒生病時喜歡吃抗生素，從小就接受疫苗的施打，這些才是造成大陸民眾得到肺癌、肝癌和胃癌的主要原因所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105027-ervtcd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105027-ervtcd6","updated":"20240519105027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105028-tj0hrij","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105028-tj0hrij"}},{"ID":"20240519105115-fd65l0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-fd65l0v","updated":"20240519105115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老藥新用　沙利竇邁可治療遺傳性出血疾病"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-qtp3l6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-qtp3l6d","updated":"20240519105115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/05 15:09"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-bmbvjko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-bmbvjko","updated":"20240519105129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（路透倫敦4日電）科學家今天說，曾經在50年前用來治療孕吐，結果卻造成胎兒畸形的鎮定劑沙利竇邁（Thalidomide），可能對一種遺傳性血管疾病有療效。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(已經被證明是一種害人的毒藥，現在還想鹹魚翻身，西藥廠真是厲害。連一個最簡單治療的孕吐，西醫都無法治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-3prj2st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-3prj2st","updated":"20240519105133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刊登在自然醫學雜誌（Nature Medicine）的研究報告中，法國研究團隊發現，讓患有「遺傳性出血性毛細血管擴張症」（hereditary hemorrhagic telangiectasia，HHT）的病患服用沙利竇邁，結果可以減少嚴重流鼻血，或流鼻血的頻率。流鼻血是HHT的主要症狀之一。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學是各連個流鼻血都無法治療的醫學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-apyxgtg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-apyxgtg","updated":"20240519105135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"位於巴黎的法國國家衛生研究院（INSERM）研究員利卜靈（Frank Librin）說，對老鼠的研究顯示，沙利竇邁可以透過一種與細胞成長有關的蛋白質機制，修復血管。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些中藥都可以做到，為何不研究使用中藥呢。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-6crixbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-6crixbv","updated":"20240519105137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沙利竇邁在1960年代用來治療懷孕期間的反胃嘔吐，但是後來因為會對嬰兒造成嚴重先天性畸形，被禁止販賣。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(懷孕期間的反胃嘔吐只需要使用人參乾薑半夏三味中藥立刻就可以好的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-676z124","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-676z124","updated":"20240519105126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近年來，具有強力抗癌物質的沙利竇邁老藥新用，開始用在治療多發性骨髓瘤（multiple myeloma）等特定類型的癌症。 中央社（翻譯）"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-6yj2ijv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-6yj2ijv","updated":"20240519105119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-jx7gr71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-jx7gr71","updated":"20240519105115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    如果沙利竇邁真的可以協助癌症病人恢復健康的話，我絕對不會去反對，但是要如何知道哪種藥對癌症有幫助呢？西藥廠是絕對不會說實話的，所以民眾只好靠自己身體的感覺比較妥當些，我給大家下一個定義，無論你得到的是哪種癌症，只要你吃藥以後，你的雙腳雙手從冰冷變成溫熱，就表示這藥有效，如果你吃藥的結果是越吃腳就越冷，就已經證明這個藥是沒效的藥。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-arh61fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-arh61fd","updated":"20240519105115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105115-4sng87o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105115-4sng87o"}},{"ID":"20240519105146-y9y6avx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-y9y6avx","updated":"20240519105146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吃綜合維他命 乳房容易長腫瘤？"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-hsvjszp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-hsvjszp","updated":"20240519105146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/06 15:05"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-jnq5jsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-jnq5jsf","updated":"20240519105153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瑞典研究發現，婦女固定服用綜合維他命，乳房比較容易長腫瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(何止是讓乳房長腫瘤，還會滋生出許多癌症西醫卻還不知道。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-9dyn7hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-9dyn7hn","updated":"20240519105154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瑞典「卡洛琳卡」研究院花了十年時間，追蹤三萬五千名中老年婦女的健康狀況。結果發現每天都吞一顆綜合維他命的婦女，得到腫瘤的機會比不吃的人高了兩成。不過，他們強調，長腫瘤應該跟維他命的關係不大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這段說法前後矛盾，就是害怕得罪西藥廠，這些研究人員是群沒有膽量的孬種。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-31mfycl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-31mfycl","updated":"20240519105157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究人員說，會吃維他命的人多半是生活不正常的人。為了補充養分才吃藥。因此，他們懷疑，腫瘤發生率高還是跟生活習慣有關。不過，他們也擔心，綜合維他命會增加胸部組織，刺激腫瘤生長。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡又說有關係，上段末說關係不大，他們真是嚇壞了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-4f1mrxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-4f1mrxf","updated":"20240519105149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-lpbqa55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-lpbqa55","updated":"20240519105146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我早就說過西藥廠製造的各種維他命都不行吃的，其第一個主要原因就是這些人工合成的營養劑都會去餵時癌腫瘤的，而我們每一個人體內都有癌細胞存在，一旦每天吃這種合成的純營養劑，自己身體是不會吸收的，但是難保不會讓腫瘤細胞同時吃到，由其是男人的攝護腺最明顯，我在美國臨床多年，已經看到不少男子因為每天吃一片綜合維他命而得到攝護腺癌，案例多到數不清，所以攝護腺癌是美國男性的頭號殺手。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-9on8iod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-9on8iod","updated":"20240519105201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     請大家唾棄所有的維他命跟西藥的補骨藥，這些"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"害人得到癌症宇宙無敵超爛的東西，只能給你的敵人享用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，自己千萬不要去吃，想要浪費錢財又讓自己生病短命的，其莫過於此了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-g17tohr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-g17tohr","updated":"20240519105146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105146-i6mszu5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105146-i6mszu5"}},{"ID":"20240519105206-u6qrtte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-u6qrtte","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"打過疫苗! 童仍罹肺炎鏈球菌重症"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-kr732fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-kr732fl","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/06 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-b5xsi60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-b5xsi60","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今年感染人數明顯增加"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-s76amh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-s76amh3","updated":"20240519105217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者李容萍、王昶閔／綜合報導〕桃園縣林口長庚兒童醫院上個月共收治八名肺炎鏈球菌重症幼童，其中一人接種過肺炎鏈球菌疫苗卻仍染病。而重症人數與去年一整年該院十八名肺炎鏈球菌重症幼童相比，人數更是明顯增加。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我早就說過，疫苗是騙人又害人的東西。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-m4dvghh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-m4dvghh","updated":"20240519105219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"長庚上月八重症 一人不治"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫是寧可看著病人死去，也絕對不讓中醫插手治療。所以西醫師是面子第一重要，病人生命不重要。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-vmsdrcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-vmsdrcm","updated":"20240519105224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林口長庚兒童醫院院長林奏延表示，上個月該院加護病房收治的八例肺炎鏈球菌重症病例，有兩人還嚴重到用「葉克膜」體外維生系統續命，但其中一人因呼吸衰竭合併敗血症、顱內出血、瞳孔放大等，最後家長忍痛放棄治療。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(為何不讓中醫出手呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-0uv7c5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-0uv7c5c","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林奏延說，兒科醫師分析發現感染的肺炎鏈球菌以19A型居多，因為19A型具有抗藥性，是現有疫苗未含的型別，且傳染力強，治療上也較不容易。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-izhc51f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-izhc51f","updated":"20240519105225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還是打疫苗較有保護力"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(已經有案例證明疫苗無效，那為何還要去打呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-sujlkn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-sujlkn1","updated":"20240519105229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衛生署疾管局副局長林頂表示，肺炎鏈球菌共有九十幾型，主要流行的則有二十幾型，現有的疫苗雖只能涵蓋其中七型，但已有高達八成幼童接種後，可獲得保護，政府目前已對低收入戶、五歲以下高危險群提供公費補助，對於一般家長則建議自費讓孩子接種。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是誇大其辭的說法，疫苗是沒有用的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-uyl0839","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-uyl0839","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未滿五歲弱勢童免費施打"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-sl5858e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-sl5858e","updated":"20240519105233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺炎鏈球菌常潛伏在人類鼻腔內，是人類細菌性肺炎、菌血症、敗血症、腦膜炎等侵襲性感染的重要致病源，幼童感染的高峰期為五歲以下，一旦感染易引起幼兒中耳炎、鼻竇炎，甚至造成死亡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(之所以惠出現死亡，這是因為西醫無法治療造成的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-caw9zhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-caw9zhj","updated":"20240519105235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林頂指出，健康的兒童口咽部也可能感染肺炎鏈球菌，這類細菌的侵襲性感染，往往可能是在感染流感等病毒後，導致呼吸道黏膜破壞，使肺炎鏈球菌趁虛而入，才進一步引發嚴重感染，因此除了接種疫苗以外，更應該養成勤洗手等良好的衛生習慣。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些西醫就是不提中醫可以治療。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-c4rmb8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-c4rmb8r","updated":"20240519105210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-u3t2du1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-u3t2du1","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這種病給中醫治療又有何難呢？民眾可以就近找一家中醫診所來治療，應該都可以治好的，如果一位中醫連這種病都無法治好，程度也實在太差勁了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-nucc5oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-nucc5oz","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     因為中醫是使用排除法跟加強病人體力法來治療這種病，所以無論是屬於哪種病毒都沒有關係，也沒有抗藥性存在。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105206-sl3hryx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105206-sl3hryx","updated":"20240519105206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105207-16chl6h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105207-16chl6h"}},{"ID":"20240519105241-lvowewu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-lvowewu","updated":"20240519105241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"感冒糖漿當水喝　險成猛暴性肝炎"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-yzdhtnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-yzdhtnk","updated":"20240519105241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/06 18:08"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-kjd47un","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-kjd47un","updated":"20240519105249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者黃彥瑜新竹市 6日電）署立新竹醫院今天表示， 1名男子日前肝功能指數高達上千，黃疸及腎功能指數也偏高，醫院擔心變成猛暴性肝炎送進加護病房治療；詢問病史，竟是由感冒糖漿引起的肝功能異常。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣最壞的藥就是這種騙人的所謂的感冒糖漿了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-dya5ak0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-dya5ak0","updated":"20240519105251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"行政院衛生署新竹醫院加護病房醫師陳憲青表示，這名老農夫平常很少就醫，日飲 6種不同廠牌的感冒糖漿，飲用劑量超過使用安全劑量；這種情形，據病患兒子表示已有多年。由於飲用量太大，還以推車去藥房 1箱1箱載回來。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位農夫已經上癮了，衛生署應該負全部的責任，因為就是他們核准讓這類感冒糖漿上市賣的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-1r21pwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-1r21pwt","updated":"20240519105255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳憲青表示，市售的感冒糖漿主要成分有乙醯胺酚（Acetaminophen）具有止痛及退燒作用，1瓶60c.c.的感冒糖漿，內含900毫克的乙醯胺酚，正確用法是1次喝10c.c.，1天3次。但老農夫卻1天6瓶，明顯地藥物過量，會傷害肝臟，少數造成胃損壞或胰臟炎。臨床表現有厭食、欲嘔、倦怠及黃疸等症狀。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(有這種問題存在，結果衛生署還是讓它上市販賣，這些官員真是只顧西藥廠利益，從不去顧百姓的健康。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-t1qpro3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-t1qpro3","updated":"20240519105258"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他指出，市售的感冒糖漿成分還包括咖啡因及甲基麻黃素等，咖啡因長期過量使用也會傷肝、腎，甲基麻黃素主要是鎮咳使支氣管擴張，可能會引發血壓升高，過量會導致呼吸換氣困難；長期使用這 2種藥物均有成癮性，不可不慎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫師都知道，我想衛生署也知道，可是就是不見這些官員有所動作。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-erdogrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-erdogrw","updated":"20240519105300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳憲青表示，一般民眾誤信廣告，把感冒糖漿當成萬靈丹，認為可以治百病。身體酸痛、頭痛及不適症狀只喝感冒糖漿，而不去找疾病發生的成因，這種想法不正確；因為身體不舒服，有可能是疾病發生前的警訊。他呼籲，身體如有不適，應立即就醫，而不是買成藥服用，延誤就醫時間。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫師都已經知道了，可是衛生署卻視而不見。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-vuyfns9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-vuyfns9","updated":"20240519105244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-shaz1xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-shaz1xi","updated":"20240519105241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   現在台灣是世界第一的肝癌之島，世界第一的洗腎之島，其之所以會如此，就是要拜南部地下電台在賣偽藥，還有就是西藥房在賣這些害人的感冒糖漿了，這些糖漿不下市，地下電台不取締，台灣就永遠擺脫不掉這世界第一的肝癌之島、世界第一洗腎之島的惡名。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105241-6fu9jcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105241-6fu9jcl","updated":"20240519105241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105242-st8wuml","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105242-st8wuml"}},{"ID":"20240519105306-kvihluh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-kvihluh","updated":"20240519105306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"貴族健檢有風險　癌專家：花錢恐討罪"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-g38rria","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-g38rria","updated":"20240519105306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/07 13:16 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"張倍綺"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-7ndxlh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-7ndxlh0","updated":"20240519105312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許多民眾聞癌色變，為了揪出癌症，不只一家醫院健檢中心推出高價健檢，有磁振造影、正子掃描等，動輒3、4萬元，真的人人都需要花這個錢嗎？和信治癌醫院院長跳出來打破這個迷思，他說這些儀器太過敏感，很多時候照出來的影子並不是癌症，卻要花更多功夫來證明自己沒有罹癌，不是討罪受嗎！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我早就說過這種健檢根本就是給你的敵人使用的，自己千萬不可以去做，做得越多病就越多。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-nxp4cgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-nxp4cgj","updated":"20240519105315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這台是64切電腦斷層，針對心血管還有肺癌，陳前總統羈押期間用過，一度竄紅；而這台是磁振造影，全身照射下，癌症無所遁形，費用3萬，還有正子掃描，更是0.3公分的腫瘤都能被揪出來，代價也不斐，輻射量卻還比電腦斷層，再高上百倍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種的輻射的副作用，就是會造成致命性的癌症。所以本來沒有癌症的健康人，去做這種檢查以後就會出現像血癌、腦瘤之類的癌症。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-vgte9sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-vgte9sn","updated":"20240519105318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這些全被視為貴族健檢，不少名人加持，醫界卻有人跳出來打破迷思。和信醫院院長黃達夫：「它的敏感度比較高，高的時候，你就會診斷出，很多不是(腫瘤)的東西，也診斷出來，看出來了。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(許多人就因為這樣而被嚇死了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-n65ydim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-n65ydim","updated":"20240519105320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"認為這些昂貴儀器，不應該拿來「篩檢」癌症，不只是輻射的問題，為了確認腫瘤的嫌犯身分，身體先得受不少的罪。黃達夫：「很多時候是穿刺，有些大一點的(腫瘤)，可能要手術進去，(結果)少數是惡性，為了抓一個壞人，可能會傷到附近的好人。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(過度的檢查就是會造成致命的傷害。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-wotzkx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-wotzkx6","updated":"20240519105323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即使是有家族病史，癌症的高危險群，黃達夫認為，是要「定期」篩檢，而非依賴儀器，糞便潛血、內視鏡、子宮抹片等檢查，便宜又有效益，恐怕一舉戳破不少健檢中心的行銷手法。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位醫師很有良心啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-4uku137","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-4uku137","updated":"20240519105306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-3ekereb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-3ekereb","updated":"20240519105306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我們每個人身體裡面都有些癌細胞存在，但是它並不是會產生致命的結果，反而它 時常還因為具有領域性，也就是說 有它存在，其他癌症就無法滋生，而西醫學時常是不分青紅皂白的將它們都列入危險性很高的癌症，按照中醫理論，如果一個人身上的症狀，只要持續是出現能吃、能喝、能拉、能睡再加上一年四季隨時都感覺手腳溫熱而頭面是冷的，只要這種感覺是持續存在，就算你身體內有腫瘤，它們絕對不會對你產生致命的後果，不去動它就是最明智的作法，上篇報導中的磁振造影、正子掃描等，就是過度的檢查，這種打開潘朵拉盒子方式的檢查，最終只會讓人加速的死亡，讓一群笨蛋以為花錢可以買到健康，結果卻適得其反。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105306-5m4fykd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105306-5m4fykd","updated":"20240519105306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月09日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105307-16h8zhm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105307-16h8zhm"}},{"ID":"20240519105413-nhm192i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-nhm192i","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"罹癌機率僅降2.5%／天天5蔬果 防癌沒效果？"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-4whrxka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-4whrxka","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/08 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-c8dbpvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-c8dbpvx","updated":"20240519105441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔國際新聞中心、王昶閔／綜合報導〕世界衛生組織（ＷＨＯ）曾在一九九○年公開建議，每人每天至少應食用五份蔬果，以預防癌症和慢性疾病；不過紐約西奈山醫學中心研究小組調查歐洲十國、近四十七萬名歐洲民眾之後，發現日食五蔬果，抗癌效果其實不大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學就是昨是今非的醫學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-j3udjh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-j3udjh8","updated":"20240519105436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其他研究宣稱有50％降癌效果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學就是誇大療效的醫學，各說各話。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-sewc2r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-sewc2r7","updated":"20240519105434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紐約西奈山醫學中心刊登在美國國家癌症研究院期刊網路版上的研究報告指出，每天吃五樣蔬果對降低罹患癌症效果有限，預估只能減少二．五％的罹癌機率；這個結果和之前其他研究宣稱的五十％降癌效果，有很大差距。不過研究人員強調，多吃水果和蔬菜仍對健康很有幫助。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我想是有幫助的，但是對於有多少的抗癌效果，就有誇大療效了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-rhrk09r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-rhrk09r","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究小組將受訪者的生活型態，諸如吸菸、運動等都考慮在內，結果發現平均每天吃三百三十五克蔬果的受訪者，其蔬果進食量與減少罹患癌症的關連性微弱；研究發現，如果再多吃兩百公克的蔬果，可降低約三％的罹癌風險。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-1o6mxel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-1o6mxel","updated":"20240519105432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美調查歐洲47萬人結果差很大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學是各說各話閉門造車的學識，所以不同的醫學單位就會出現不同的結果。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-7tkbqa9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-7tkbqa9","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雖然多吃蔬果對防癌的好處不大，不過對於酒量很大的民眾來說，多吃蔬果確實有某種降低罹患癌症風險的效果，但這樣的好處僅限於菸酒引起的癌症。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-xry2a9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-xry2a9m","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"西奈山醫學中心的研究總結說，蔬果雖然有某種保護效果，但是其功效比先前所想的小，充其量只能說有中度功效而已，不過吃蔬果整體來說確實對健康有益，這份研究的結果也並未駁斥多吃蔬果的建議。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-xfwh16c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-xfwh16c","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哈佛公衛學院的威勒特教授在期刊上的評論就說，一天五蔬果，心血管疾病的發生率可減少三十％。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-e4bdu0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-e4bdu0o","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據世界衛生組織的數據，全球約一成九的胃腸癌、三成一的缺血性心臟疾病、一成一的中風，是因為蔬果攝取量低所引起。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-s372809","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-s372809","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究仍認為多吃蔬果身體好"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-lvqpv9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-lvqpv9c","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國這項研究顛覆一般人多吃蔬果防癌的觀念，不過和信治癌中心醫院新書《癌症大秘密》，曾引用美國哈佛大學一份重要報告指出，人類有九大致癌因素，蔬果攝取不足便是其中之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-hjevsw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-hjevsw3","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"癌症希望協會理事長、血液腫瘤科主治醫師王正旭表示，癌症成因複雜多元，防癌需多管齊下才能奏效，多吃蔬果對身體的好處不容否定，但若只改變飲食習慣，其他如吸菸、喝酒、熬夜、少運動等不良生活習慣若不改變，防癌效果自然有限。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-5dl4p2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-5dl4p2m","updated":"20240519105427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王正旭強調，癌症是長期慢性的疾病，從接觸病因到罹癌往往要二、三十年，也因此多蔬果、多運動、防治肥胖等生活飲食習慣應該從小扎根，才能發揮防癌效果。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學是一種不知道癌症從何而來的醫學，所以西醫學是無法做到防癌的醫學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-08miwc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-08miwc7","updated":"20240519105416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-ighdu3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-ighdu3s","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     我原本很想寫一篇有關中醫的防癌觀念方面的論文，可是因為現在出現許多人不尊重智慧財產權，盜用我的文章，盜版我的人紀學，盜賣我美國診所的醫案紀錄，這些人中有些還是我的學生，只為了賺些黑錢，但是他們沒有想到，這樣做會害到許多有心學習經方的人士，我現在已經禁止任何學生再拷貝我美國診所的病例，也禁止學生再將醫案打字存檔，也禁止再出現同學間互傳我的醫案，原本我的一番好心，想讓沒有機會來美國參加臨床跟診的同學，也可以藉由醫案的紀錄而得知我看病的手法，現在因為這些少數居心不良的學生，我只好嚴格禁止這類行為。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-5vgjdj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-5vgjdj2","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    大陸出現許多網站使用我的文章，不註明出處，硬說是他們自己寫的，這種竊盜行為讓我十分痛心，所以我原本想寫些好論文給大家分享，現在也只好作罷，不尊重智慧財產權的結果，就是無法讓人心甘情願的提供最好的知識給大家，造成竊盜者因小失大，要去坐牢，然後廣大的群眾將是最後的受害者。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105413-uuprv43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105413-uuprv43","updated":"20240519105413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月10日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105414-lv2uki0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105414-lv2uki0"}},{"ID":"20240519105501-hh7tccu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-hh7tccu","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"隔空治腦瘤 伽馬刀效果佳"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-crxi5a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-crxi5a5","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/09 15:58"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-thuoz80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-thuoz80","updated":"20240519105507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者劉嘉泰花蓮縣9日電）伽馬刀立體定位放射手術透過伽馬射線集中照射顱內特定腦瘤，不需打開病患顱骨即可治療腦瘤，且不傷害腦組織，花蓮慈濟醫院神經外科主任蘇泉發表示，治療效果非常好。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-6dtnafp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-6dtnafp","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蘇泉發指出，伽馬刀手術是利用201根伽馬射線集中照射在顱內的特定腦瘤，就如同太陽光的聚光點，讓腦瘤接受極高的治療劑，而周圍組織接收的劑量則是減到最低，以達到治療腫瘤卻不傷害腦組織的目的。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-u0pfl4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-u0pfl4l","updated":"20240519105515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1名80歲病患因腦膜瘤大到頂著視神經，並嚴重壓迫腦幹，經評估如果採取傳統手術切除腫瘤，病患癱瘓的風險相當高，最後決定進行開顱手術，切除部分腫瘤後，再以伽馬刀治療，結果治療效果非常好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只要對病人有利的，我就贊成，希望西醫師不要欺騙大眾。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-dkvpwzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-dkvpwzn","updated":"20240519105517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蘇泉發指出，以往治療腦動靜脈畸形的傳統開顱手術，需要8至16小時，且在手術過程中可能因為大出血危及生命，而伽馬刀對於腦膜瘤、聽神經瘤、腦動靜脈畸形瘤、海綿竇血管瘤、腦下垂體瘤、轉移性腦瘤和各種邊緣清楚且直徑小於3公分的腦瘤，治療效果都相當良好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫學定義了許多不同病名的腦瘤，結果治療的動作卻一樣，都是開刀跟伽馬刀。一般不信中醫的人，就認為中醫無法診斷病名，所以不信，殊不知中醫不使用病名學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-gmd2vky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-gmd2vky","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1名37歲男性病患因突發性癲癇發作，經檢查發現腦內有6顆多發性腦膜瘤，其中最大直徑約5公分，開顱手術移除後，剩下的5顆腫瘤，透過單次伽馬刀一併完成治療。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-hnydha0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-hnydha0","updated":"20240519105520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蘇泉發表示，伽馬刀治療並不是除去腦瘤，而是讓腫瘤縮小或不變，腫瘤不變就像是盛開的花朵變成乾燥花不起作用，讓病患與腫瘤和平共處。文獻證實，以伽馬刀治療腦膜瘤、聽神經瘤等良性腫瘤，15年內的控制率可達95%，幾乎等於治癒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(所以能與腫瘤共處而沒有出現危險症狀，就可以說是痊癒了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-eg3wf43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-eg3wf43","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至於原發性惡性腦瘤如膠質細胞瘤，因腫瘤周邊與腦組織分辨不清，蘇泉發表示，如果單以伽馬刀治療，仍然不易控制；惡性腫瘤仍以開顱切除手術配合放射治療為主，伽馬刀只提供補助性的治療，而對於雖屬惡性的轉移性腦瘤，因周邊清楚，伽馬刀治療效果也很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-ugn21kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-ugn21kc","updated":"20240519105522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-421z3d3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-421z3d3","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    讀者看看西醫學所使用的名稱無論是病名或是手術，其名字都取得非常好，像 腦膜瘤、聽神經瘤、腦動靜脈畸形瘤、海綿竇血管瘤、腦下垂體瘤、轉移性腦瘤和各種邊緣清楚且直徑小於3公分的腦瘤，治療手術名字像伽馬刀這種名稱，還可以不打開頭顱就可以隔空治療腦瘤，如果效果真的像西醫說的如此之好，我絕對不反對，反而會鼓勵病人給西醫去開刀或是做伽馬刀之類的治療， 但是西醫學最大的問題就出在不知病從何來？如果這個問題無法突破，病就不可能根治，所以只能說讓腫瘤縮小或不變，腫瘤不變就像是盛開的花朵變成乾燥花不起作用，讓病患與腫瘤和平共處，這就等同於治癒。而這種治癒後的未來，還是很有可能繼續發生這種同樣的病出現，就是因為不知病從何來？"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-o9aqk9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-o9aqk9o","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我舉一例來說明，比方說乳癌，如果我心知肚明這位病人的乳癌是來自此人愛吃綜合維他命與愛吃維他命C想要美白，結果因此而得到乳癌，今天就算西醫將她的乳癌治好，但是如果不知她為什麼會得到乳癌的真正原因，因而沒有要求病人立刻停止吃綜合維他命與維他命C，我保證她的乳癌還是會再發生的，這是Common sense對不對呢？西醫學時常因為不知道病因，於是就推說是來自基因造成的，也就是說得到癌症的病人是活該的，是自己身體的基因有問題才造成癌症的，真是會牽拖啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105501-dxk175b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105501-dxk175b","updated":"20240519105501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月11日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105502-f7bjmvf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105502-f7bjmvf"}},{"ID":"20240519105604-mki1ia6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-mki1ia6","updated":"20240519105604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"h1n1劉小弟死亡案 總統:研究修法強制解剖"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-g9mw2gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-g9mw2gk","updated":"20240519105604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/09 19:05"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-1iw2m1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-1iw2m1o","updated":"20240519105611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   馬總統今天下午在府內主持第四次H1N1防疫諮詢會議，馬總統表示，這次防疫的成功經驗可以繼續複製，首先要加強公眾溝通；其次，有專家建議死亡個案應該在24小時就要解剖，總統認為如果有需要就修法，不能像台中劉小弟事件，因為拖延太久，造成太大傷害。（繆宇綸報導）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(疫苗造成死亡已經是一大傷害，現在還需要經過解剖才能確定，這是二次傷害，真是無能的政府。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-xuu5phm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-xuu5phm","updated":"20240519105613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   H1N1防疫指揮中心在2月間解散，馬總統下午在府內召開第四次防疫諮詢會議，對防疫成果進行檢討。總統認為，台灣的防疫作戰打了場漂亮的勝仗，這次成功的經驗，應該可以複製。首先，總統認為要加強公眾溝通，針對下次可能出現的疫情，做好公眾教育和溝通的工作『接種疫苗後發生意外，跟（疫苗）都沒有關係，這恐怕要強力地去宣導，讓大家充分地了解，而且把所有數據都攤出來，我覺得這一點衛生署可能要更積極。換句話說，要把這次可能當初被認為是陰霾，要在新的疫情發生前就一掃而光！』"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(哪裡來的漂亮的勝戰呢？疫苗造成對人民的傷害，遠大於對人民的保護，現在還妄言是場勝戰，真是不要臉啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-xzbq1xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-xzbq1xn","updated":"20240519105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   其次，總統要求要加強危機處理，成大醫院副院長蘇益仁建議死亡個案24小時內就要解剖，總統認為有需要就修法『換句話說，制度要改進到能夠立即反應的程度，絕對不能容許像劉小弟事件，這樣一拖拖幾個禮拜，傷害真的太大了！』"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(h1n1沒有造成人民傷亡，真正造成人民傷亡的就是疫苗。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-h1vsmfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-h1vsmfd","updated":"20240519105618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   此外，總統也強調官民合作和國際合作的重要，讓成功的經驗繼續複製，並要求行政院一定要辦理敘獎，包括官員和國光生技，以及幫助過大家的防疫大使，希望透過激勵，讓大家更有信心面對未來。（圖由總統府提供）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是個只知道如何保護西藥廠的政府，真是害民又傷財的政府。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-t17vdou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-t17vdou","updated":"20240519105620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-sqd5968","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-sqd5968","updated":"20240519105604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    現在讀者可以看到我說的吧，台灣政府早就被西藥廠所控制，一切以西醫說的算，結果西藥廠為了賺錢，首先將h1n1誇大嚴重性，再將疫情的感染性強調其擴大說法，讓世界各國必須面對這個原本根本就不是敵人的敵人，讓政府浪費無數的金錢來購買許多無效又害人死亡的疫苗來注射，疫情會受到控制是因為百姓的抵抗力，加上h1n1本身只是個小感冒而已，根本就不會致命，再加上我們中醫的宣導，許多人都知道使用大青龍湯可以治癒h1n1，這才是真正打勝戰的原因，結果這個昏庸的政府卻將功勞歸給西藥廠生產的疫苗，疫苗已經造成許多人民死亡，還有終身癱瘓這都是事實，結果真正有功勞的沒有得到嘉獎，真正害人民的卻得到功勳，這種本末倒置的政府真是只有無能可以形容了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-3e04eqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-3e04eqg","updated":"20240519105604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月12日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105604-g77ac8l","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105604-g77ac8l"}},{"ID":"20240519105626-ys0708l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-ys0708l","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"新流感疫苗仍有8百多萬劑供施打到9月底"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-s5gar6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-s5gar6k","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/09 09:05"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-gvqaziu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-gvqaziu","updated":"20240519105636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   新流感疫情降溫，病毒株也納入季節流感疫苗中，國內先前準備的大量疫苗，扣除耗損的部分，還剩下八、九百萬劑，疾病管制局表示，未開封的疫苗存放在共同儲運中心，隨著南半球進入秋冬流感季節，為了防範可能的病毒威脅，季節性流感疫苗開打前，新流感疫苗還是重要的防疫武器，國內接種工作仍將持續到九月底。(陳奕華報導)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種沒用又會害人的疫苗，早就該火燒處理，居然還留存至今。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-rfxeckd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-rfxeckd","updated":"20240519105638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   北半球新流感疫情趨緩，打疫苗的人越來越少，有些國家採購的大量疫苗還剩下不少，光是美國就有七千多萬劑疫苗，因為快要過期，只好丟棄，至於國內第二波疫情宣告結束，先前政府採購的一千五百萬劑疫苗，接種了五百多萬劑，扣除耗損的，仍存有八、九百萬劑，剩下疫苗該如何處理？疾管局表示，雖然世衛組織已經把新流感列入一般流感疫苗株中，不過季節流感疫苗約在11月左右才開打，在此之前，這批疫苗剛好可以銜接，以防範可能疫情，因此預防接種服務仍將繼續進行到九月底。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些大量沒有用到的疫苗，就是證據，它證明了h1n1只是個小感冒而已，本身就不會致命的小感冒，所以疫情自然就被控制住，根本用不到這些疫苗，所以才會出現如此大的庫存。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-xbdcthg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-xbdcthg","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   疾病管制局副局長林頂說：「因為這段時間，其實南半球還是一個比較流行的季節，這段時間可能如果(疫情)又上來的話，還是有那個風險，民眾如果有意願要打會提供(接種)服務，至於有一些(疫苗)分到各縣市去，完全沒有開封我們把它收回來，會有一個儲備的中心。」"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-jv5pgr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-jv5pgr6","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據疾病管制局監測資料顯示，並未發現第三波疫情，將持續密切監測，不過現階段A型流感病毒減少，反而B型為主，B型流感的症狀跟一般感冒類似，不過症狀較輕微。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-9adgxn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-9adgxn3","updated":"20240519105629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-6981p0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-6981p0p","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      這種就是錯誤的政策造成浪費公帑的證據，本來就沒有必要去購買這些既害人又無效的疫苗，結果因為政府受到西藥廠的控制，所以就浪費了人民的血汗錢去購買，現在只有兩千三百萬的台灣人口，光是庫存疫苗就達到八、九百萬劑，大家想想這已經浪費了多少錢？真是會浪費的政府啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105626-y6fa9ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105626-y6fa9ly","updated":"20240519105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月12日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105627-yygicqh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105627-yygicqh"}},{"ID":"20240519105648-gesxete","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-gesxete","updated":"20240519105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026quot;針\u0026quot;的有用! 針灸能淡疤痕"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-k0tketj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-k0tketj","updated":"20240519105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/09 22:18"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-y7rbyd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-y7rbyd6","updated":"20240519105655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全台灣大約有一百多萬人，有蟹足腫的困擾，不小心受傷就會留下又紅又腫的疤痕，甚至有人連小小的擦傷都惡化成5公分的疤痕，怎麼都治不好因此覺得很自卑，現在有中醫利用針灸，每個禮拜針灸兩次，大約三個月，就可以讓疤痕淡去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(針灸的功效何止可以這樣，它的真正功效已經超凡入聖了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-15bjbco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-15bjbco","updated":"20240519105658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紅腫的疤痕，長達5公分，上頭插了六根針，這是陪伴了賴小姐12年的疤痕，現在經過了10次治療，蟹足腫的顏色變淡、範圍變小，全靠這根針，一個禮拜兩次，一個半月，疤痕已經少了0.5公分，老祖宗的針灸，真的這麼神。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(光是這樣子就可以被稱做很神了，如果這為記者看到我使用針灸的效果，那針灸必然是宇宙無敵，超級好的中醫治療方法。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-sa7j40x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-sa7j40x","updated":"20240519105700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30歲的賴小姐，不自覺的掩住胸口，這是她十二年來的習慣動作，過去，她穿POLO衫從不開扣，現在已經勇敢的抬頭挺胸，健保給付，一次只要一百多，針灸，讓賴小姐重獲新生，再看看這個鄭先生，臉上坑洞，像坦克碾過，青春痘差點讓他不敢見人，一樣是針灸治療，雖然沒有美的像水煮蛋，至少疤痕少了一半，誰說愛美只能靠雷射、拉皮、肉毒桿菌，咱們老祖宗的智慧，才驚人。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(非常感謝這位記者的報導，實在是很難得出現這種有良心敢說真話的記者。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-gy6m0hz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-gy6m0hz","updated":"20240519105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"非常好的報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-clflj3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-clflj3a","updated":"20240519105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    針灸已經歷經六千年以上的傳承，其效果早就被世界各國公認的，現在台灣因為是西醫當權，所以所有只要有關中醫藥的報導，都只出現些片面的，沒有全面性與整體性的報導，也因為這樣，所以中醫藥一直都不被重視，無法進入主流醫學，其實這是非常不正確的作法，如果中醫藥能夠進入主流醫學，同時中醫師的素質也非常統一，也非常的強，這樣絕對是國人的福氣，不但可以節省下數以億計的金錢，而且還可以讓人民更為健康長壽。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105648-4u6apki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105648-4u6apki","updated":"20240519105648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月11日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105649-0qi6l1b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105649-0qi6l1b"}},{"ID":"20240519105709-ndd1yqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-ndd1yqr","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乙醯胺酚+阿斯匹靈…綜合止痛劑隨處賣 吃多傷腎"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-evz81z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-evz81z4","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/11 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-nens7am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-nens7am","updated":"20240519105723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者洪素卿／台北報導〕台灣洗腎發生率居全球之冠，一年光是洗腎用去三百億的健保資源。為此，吳揆要求掃蕩亂賣藥影響民眾腎臟健康的地下電台。不過，另一項潛在的腎臟風險，也就是混合型止痛藥劑，在台灣卻仍然隨處可買到。醫師呼籲，政府應正視混用止痛藥可能造成的腎臟危害。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣是世界密度第一的洗腎之島，就是因為台灣人濫用止痛藥造成的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-xeet5zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-xeet5zq","updated":"20240519105727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林口長庚醫院臨床毒物科主任林杰樑指出，含phenacetin-阿斯匹靈綜合止痛劑未被禁用前，在美國，止痛劑腎病變佔末期腎病變的一％到三％。澳洲、比利時、瑞典止痛劑腎病變佔末期腎病變甚至高達三％到二十％ 。但在含phenacetin-阿斯匹靈綜合止痛劑被禁用後十到十五年， 歐美國家止痛劑腎病變大幅下降，佔末期腎病變的一％不到 。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西藥都是在害到許多人之後，才會改變作法，那當初西藥廠送審藥物時，為何沒有詳細說明呢？為何衛生署會同意讓這種藥上市呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-7h6c4ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-7h6c4ff","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩成分會影響腎臟血流與乳突"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-z544g5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-z544g5t","updated":"20240519105733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目前我國雖沒有phenacetin與阿斯匹靈綜合止痛劑，但phenacetin代謝後，會產生乙醯胺酚（acetaminophen），也就是普拿疼等止痛藥成分 ，乙醯胺酚與阿斯匹靈做成的綜合製劑，一樣會對腎臟造成嚴重危害。這兩種成分一個是會影響腎臟血流，一個則影響腎臟乳突，兩者合用很可能升高止痛劑腎病變、尿毒症及腎臟泌尿系統惡性腫瘤風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者可知你的周圍有多少人正在同時吃普拿疼與阿斯匹靈這兩種藥？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-pbi0vf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-pbi0vf4","updated":"20240519105735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但台灣不只沒有禁用，且將這類藥品放在非處方藥，民眾可以隨便買到，成為民眾腎臟健康的隱憂！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者看看西藥廠厲不厲害？是誰在縱容它們呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-wpuuc8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-wpuuc8s","updated":"20240519105736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衛生署表示，目前我國對於阿斯匹靈合併乙醯胺酚類止痛藥的管理比照日本管理模式，主要是因為阿斯匹靈有消炎、解熱以及鎮痛效用，乙醯胺酚只有解熱跟鎮痛作用，但阿斯匹靈具腸胃刺激的副作用，為降低腸胃刺激，又要維持止痛消炎效果，因此以降低阿斯匹靈劑量，加入乙醯胺酚的方式來製造。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(台灣為生署從沒考慮過使用中藥製劑，來給這些病人服用，只知道要使用西藥，就算有副作用又如何呢？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-hs60of2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-hs60of2","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要服用止痛藥最好先就醫諮詢"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-oplwexw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-oplwexw","updated":"20240519105739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針對這類藥物，衛生署除了要求兩種成分劑量減半，同時也要求加註警語，建議民眾從最小劑量開始服用。一天服用超過八顆以上五百毫克的乙醯胺酚類止痛藥，可能造成中毒或肝傷害。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者看到了吧，衛生署都知道，但是還是讓醫師使用，完全不顧民眾的健康。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-6kyz2f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-6kyz2f1","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"榮總神經內科主治醫師王署君認為，我國非處方止痛藥最大的問題是，部分民眾服用頻率太高與劑量太大。常用的感冒糖漿，說明書指示患者一次飲用十西西，但民眾常一次喝一罐。建議若每個月至少服用止痛藥三、四次以上，應找醫師確認病因及諮詢用法。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-6qmh6lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-6qmh6lf","updated":"20240519105712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-mokeqg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-mokeqg2","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   台灣不管是非法販賣的還是合法在販賣的西藥，都會造成腎臟衰竭，這些連衛生署都已經知道的事實，可是就是不見到他們有何動作來預防，西藥廠依然故我的繼續在販賣這些害人腎臟衰竭的藥，看來台灣人想要不洗腎還很難啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105709-5q10cas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105709-5q10cas","updated":"20240519105709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月14日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105710-5i0igcs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105710-5i0igcs"}},{"ID":"20240519105748-okl05tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-okl05tw","updated":"20240519105748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"糖尿病、心血管疾病患者應嚴格控制低密度膽固醇"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-mu51ojb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-mu51ojb","updated":"20240519105748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/12 11:44 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"中時健康 楊格非／台北報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-k3up4i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-k3up4i8","updated":"20240519105802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據統計，國內每年新增3萬5000名急性腦中風患者、近3萬人次接受心導管手術，糖尿病患者更是高達240萬人，這些都屬於心血管疾病高風險群。醫師提醒，這些病患應該嚴格控制「低密度膽固醇」在100mg/dl以下，以降低罹病風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位醫師說錯了，真正讓糖尿病的病人得到心血管方面疾病的是降血醣藥，不是嚴格控制低密度膽固醇。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-nhzvzc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-nhzvzc1","updated":"20240519105803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中華民國心臟學會秘書長黃瑞仁指出，糖尿病患者跟冠狀動脈心臟病、腦中風的患者一樣，罹患心血管疾病風險較高，如果能將「低密度膽固醇」控制在100mg/dl以下，可以有效避免、減緩或降低心血管疾病的發生。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(糖尿病的病人如果使用降血糖藥來嚴格控制血醣，這才是真正會製造心臟病的元兇，跟低密度膽固醇是無關的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-hzwyuek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-hzwyuek","updated":"20240519105806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"對於已有冠狀動脈心臟病、缺血性腦中風的患者，將低密度膽固醇控制在100mg/dl以下，則可大幅降低支架再狹窄、發生新的狹窄病變，或二次中風。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(唯有停止繼續使用降血糖藥，改以純中藥來治療糖尿病，才有可能降低支架再狹窄、發生新的狹窄病變，或二次中風。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-s0t1khk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-s0t1khk","updated":"20240519105808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"糖尿病衛教學會理事長許惠恆則指出，台灣目前約有240萬糖尿病患者，每年新增2萬5000名。即使沒有心血管疾病病史，這些患者未來罹患心血管疾病的死亡率，與心血管疾病患者的風險一樣高。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(之所以會這樣，是跟病人使用降血糖藥有關。因為降血糖藥才是真正傷害心臟的藥物啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-glaah2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-glaah2c","updated":"20240519105810"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林口長庚腦中風中心主任李宗海指出，腦中風患者再次發生腦中風的機會是正常人的9倍，發生心臟病的機會是2到3倍；心肌梗塞患者發生腦中風的機會是正常人的3到4倍，再發生心臟病的機會是5到7倍。罹患糖尿病，危險性等同罹患心血管疾病，需要比一般人更嚴格控制危險因子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是病人使用西藥的後遺症，此刻只有用中藥來解決。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-br3t83y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-br3t83y","updated":"20240519105812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所謂的危險因子就是低密度膽固醇。2009年院基隆、林口、嘉義、高雄等四家長庚院區、4274位缺血性中風患者中，高達六成低密度膽固醇值高於100mg/dL，顯示絕大多數的缺血性中風的患者，都有低密度膽固醇偏高等毛病。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我告訴讀者，降低這低密度膽固醇是無法預防病人再次得到心臟病與中風的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-uq4eoc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-uq4eoc5","updated":"20240519105815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許惠恆建議，糖尿病患者應該比照血管疾病的患者，將低密度膽固醇控制在100mg/dl以下。即使是糖尿病前期，也應該積極治療，提早預防，嚴格控制「低密度膽固醇」，不能掉以輕心。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(沒有用的，這樣做的結果就是病人照樣還是會得到心臟病與中風。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-rnjoy6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-rnjoy6u","updated":"20240519105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"為了能讓國人更了解低密度膽固醇值的重要性，中華民國心臟基金會與中華民國心臟學會特別把每年的第100天訂為台灣血脂日，今年度預計舉辦100場民眾衛教講座，詳細時間地點都登載於心臟基金會網站http://www.tsoc.org.tw/THF公告）。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是在賣無效又害人的藥啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-4ydrlyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-4ydrlyw","updated":"20240519105819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"楊瑞仁指出，希望透過面對面的溝通，讓低密度膽固醇值＜100mg/dl的目標深入人心，讓國人的低密度膽固醇也有機會達到＜100mg/dl的好成績。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種作法只是變相的在賣藥，根本無助於防治病人再次得到心臟病與中風的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-qqd4wg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-qqd4wg0","updated":"20240519105748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的西醫學"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-lnb1j8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-lnb1j8c","updated":"20240519105748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    目前就已經有研究指出降血醣的藥物是會引起心臟病的，還有目前爭議最大的就是控制膽固醇可以預防病人得到心臟病與中風，連西醫自己都還有爭議，西藥廠就已經將降膽固醇的藥物賣到火紅，這些降膽固醇的西藥最大的副作用就是會讓服用的人記憶衰退，讀者如果看到新聞中出現有人在出門後，居然會忘記自己的家在哪裡？這就是服用降膽固醇的西藥引發的後遺症，而事實上已經有許多人得到心臟病與中風，可是他們的低密度膽固醇並不會很高，還是照樣得到心臟病與中風，西醫學是不可以相信的醫學，希望大家相信中醫學，只有中醫學可以預先知道病人會得到中風或是心臟病等，而且不但可以預知，還可以藉由中藥來預防病人得到心臟病與中風。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-syy2vv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-syy2vv6","updated":"20240519105748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月14日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105748-0iq3hb6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105748-0iq3hb6"}},{"ID":"20240519105826-8nazaaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-8nazaaw","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"魚類、堅果和水果可降低罹患阿茲海默症機率"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-q27p87r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-q27p87r","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/13 12:20"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-ygn19f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-ygn19f0","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社華盛頓12日電） 最新研究顯示，食用特定食物，包括魚類、水果和堅果類，與降低阿茲海默症（Alzheimer's）罹患機率有關。阿茲海默症是一種腦損耗疾病（brain-wasting disease）。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-lvnm5r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-lvnm5r1","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究同時發現，患病機率降低與較少攝取高脂乳製品、紅肉、臟器及奶油也有關連。這份研究報告今天刊登於「神經學檔案」（Archives of Neurology）線上期刊。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-7het0gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-7het0gs","updated":"20240519105830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紐約哥倫比亞大學（Columbia University）醫學中心團隊針對65歲以上、尚未罹患阿茲海默症的2148位民眾展開研究。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-p893cvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-p893cvd","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究對象提供日常飲食的內容清單，每隔1年半接受1次阿茲海默症測試，平均追蹤4年。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-67yqb2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-67yqb2a","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學者表示，其中253人在研究期間罹患阿茲海默症。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-9c4ovir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-9c4ovir","updated":"20240519105835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能降低患病風險的食物包括沙拉醬、堅果類、魚類、番茄、禽鳥肉類、水果，以及深色多葉的綠色蔬菜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果你在長期吃降三高的西藥，你就會得到阿茲海默症。吃再多的蔬果都沒有用。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-xqozdmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-xqozdmw","updated":"20240519105839"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少吃高脂乳製品、紅肉、臟器和奶油也能降低患病機率。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是在胡說八道，只有喜歡吃西藥的人才是最容易得到阿茲海默症的一群。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-4fxzzmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-4fxzzmj","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學者在結論寫道：「我們的發現提供依據，將能進一步探索食物的組合方式，讓飲食成為阿茲海默症的預防之道。」（譯者：中央社戴雅真）"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-77ufytu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-77ufytu","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"錯誤的醫學理論"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-3ek4jud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-3ek4jud","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這類的報導只有一個目的，就是想轉移大家對西藥造成的記憶衰退想法，民眾想不要得到阿茲海默症，只有一個方法，就是遠離西藥與各種維他命，因為西藥與維他命才是真正造成阿茲海默症的元兇。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105826-cl49c45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105826-cl49c45","updated":"20240519105826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月14日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105827-lezp0g3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105827-lezp0g3"}},{"ID":"20240519105846-wcxhe1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-wcxhe1c","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"吃保健品排毒 他腸爛她幾毀容"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-qtqwjkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-qtqwjkv","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/14 02:41 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"馮惠宜／台中報導"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-6itjin0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-6itjin0","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報【馮惠宜／台中報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-gcr7k71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-gcr7k71","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃健康食品排毒，當心惹病上身！四十五歲程姓男子聽信五葉松汁可治痛風，拿來當水喝，直到狂瀉還誤認是排毒；最後狂拉血水，動了五次手術，部分大、小腸切除。另名五十九歲婦女因長期吃保健食品，一年間兩度併發急性藥物疹和過敏性皮膚炎，直到面容幾乎全毀，才趕忙就醫求救。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-0vw6by9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-0vw6by9","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"務農的程姓男子當兵時開始出現痛風，親友介紹他喝五葉松汁，他喝上癮，當成解渴飲料，並用五葉松調小米酒飲用。一個月後肚子拉不停，有時還出現血水和黏液，他還以為是「排毒」、「好轉」現象，不以為意。直到兩個星期後狂拉血水，他才就醫。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-i6qn27u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-i6qn27u","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五葉松汁當飲料 腹瀉狂拉血水"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-ih1g480","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-ih1g480","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醫師診斷是罕見的潰瘍性大腸炎，腸部黏膜從淺層到深層都發炎潰爛，一年半內，五度手術切除部分大腸、小腸，肚皮還留有小腸造口，他和醫師都在等待傷口癒合後再把小腸接回直腸，以免要靠人工肛門排便。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-5fwwbpe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-5fwwbpe","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五十九歲的陳姓婦人長期茹素，並聽信親友介紹吃健康食品補充營養，去年三月間出現脫皮、紅腫症狀，就醫後皮膚科醫師發現是過敏性皮膚炎，建議停止食用健康食品，並按時服藥、塗抹藥物。未料親友堅持說是正常排毒現象，撐過去就好了。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-p9bqx6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-p9bqx6m","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茹素想補充營養 膚腫滲組織液"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-5pyd6t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-5pyd6t8","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拖了兩個星期，皮膚潰爛紅腫更嚴重，她才再就醫，不再吃保健食品，並按時服藥。去年十二月親友再介紹她服用另一種保健食品，她服用三個月，皮膚再出現紅腫、脫皮，甚至滲出組織液，只好再找醫師求救。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-znno6yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-znno6yf","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中山醫學大學副校長、台灣營養學會理事長王進崑表示，人體透過正常排泄、排汗就能排毒，不需透過腹瀉、拉血水，甚至皮膚病變等生理病變才能排毒。服用健康食品要遵守安全劑量，過量攝取易引發毒性反應，嚴重甚至致命，不能不慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-m77rb55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-m77rb55","updated":"20240519105850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-uo7daez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-uo7daez","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我已經不知多少次在網站上呼籲，千萬不要去吃各種所謂的健康食品，這些假借健康食品之名，來販賣真正害人生病的食品，真是壞透了，請民眾千萬不要再去買任何的健康食品，根本都在欺騙民眾，這種浪費民眾金錢又會傷害民眾身體的東西，根本就不該存在的。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105846-cyf16bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105846-cyf16bw","updated":"20240519105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月14日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105847-r46lua6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105847-r46lua6"}},{"ID":"20240519105855-r0hxchf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-r0hxchf","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"早餐營養不足 國人普遍缺鈣"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-crhpia0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-crhpia0","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/04/12 23:01"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-3w4oe04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-3w4oe04","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"您吃的早餐夠營養嗎?根據衛生署針做的5次國民健康調查，我國各個年齡層都有鈣質攝取量嚴重缺乏的問題，早餐到底要怎麼吃，才能把足夠的鈣質吃進去，讓專家來告訴你。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-5m1hrmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-5m1hrmg","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"幾位小朋友穿著蜜蜂裝跳舞，超級卡娃依，對這個年紀的小朋友來說，鈣質的攝取很重要，不過營養師指出，國人攝取的鈣質普遍不足。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-yzh8s6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-yzh8s6h","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高達98%10到12歲的學童有缺鈣的問題，而早餐應該要吃的最豐盛，但怎麼吃才能把該有的營養吃下肚呢?早餐的鈣質攝取量足夠，除了可以小朋友長高，也能降低成人和老年人骨質疏鬆和骨折機率。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-9cazyfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-9cazyfc","updated":"20240519105859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-353tipe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-353tipe","updated":"20240519105855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   台灣人之所以會出現這個問題，就是因為喝太多牛奶跟吃太多鈣片才出現的問題，電視上每天都在廣告牛奶很好，可以補鈣，鈣片很好，鼓勵大家要多吃鈣片，連衛生署也在鼓勵民眾要這樣做才對，殊不知，牛奶中的鈣與人工合成的鈣片，不但人體不會吸收，反而這種鈣會使人體骨格中的鈣加快流失，也就是說你牛奶喝得越多，鈣片吃的越多，你的身體就越缺鈣，這種錯誤的作法已經行之多年，所以現在才會出現國人普遍缺鈣的問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105855-yiiq6e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105855-yiiq6e2","updated":"20240523090441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   想要知道該怎麼選擇食物吃，就可以正常的補充鈣質，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"請看這裡"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（倪海厦-其他-搜索\u0026quot;同重量的黑芝麻，含鈣量達牛奶的十八倍\u0026quot;）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240519105944-k5hz6ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240519105944-k5hz6ff","updated":"20240519105945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年04月14日"}]},{"ID":"20240519105856-y81vhoz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240519105856-y81vhoz"}}]}